  ('4a9e6113-1cd3-4ffe-b6fb-5f921d290f92', 'K: MISSING KINGS', NULL, 'K: MISSING KINGS', 'K MISSING KINGS', ARRAY['K-Project Movie'], 16904, NULL, 'Ever since the School Island Incident, in which the four Kings were involved, the Silver Clansman, Kuroh Yatogami and Neko were on their search for their master Shiro. Unable to find any leads to Shiro, the two were in a gloomy mood until they ran into Homura members, Rikio Kamamoto and Anna Kushima, who were apparently being chased by someone...

(Source: Official Movie Pamphlet)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx16904-MqA6kzSdRDsK.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16904-mgiInFXzl17C.jpg', NULL, 7.4, 2014, 'completed', 'movie', ARRAY['Action', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['Starchild Records', 'Mainichi Broadcasting System', 'GoHands', 'KLOCKWORX', 'Glovision'], 1, 75, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:44:47.886964+00:00', '2026-05-31T20:51:38.0928+00:00'),
  ('b83b2a3c-a15d-4e44-847a-9bce425fada9', 'Pseudo Harem', 'Pseudo Harem', 'Giji Harem', '疑似ハーレム', ARRAY['ฮาเร็มนี้มีแต่เธอ'], 54968, 'pseudo-harem', 'Eiji Kitahama joins the drama club with dreams of having a harem like the ones from his favorite manga. Rin Nanakura, an underclassman, finds herself crushing hard on Eiji and tries on different personas in his presence to win him over. No matter how she acts, one thing is certain—her feelings for Eiji continue to grow stronger. Will she ever be able to tell him the truth and be herself?
(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx163623-pzR6vIHoJh0b.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163623-A5g41LWbH3WT.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/PlA02yr5gyQ', 7.6, 2024, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Comedy', 'Romance', 'Slice of Life'], ARRAY['Nomad', 'Pony Canyon', 'bilibili', 'TOKYO MX', 'BS Fuji', 'Nomad'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:25:03.960792+00:00', '2026-06-01T06:03:12.844886+00:00'),
  ('a17e1b29-56aa-4e69-bb86-19312d05cfc4', 'The strongest job is apparently not a hero or a sage, but an appraiser (provisional)!', 'The strongest job is apparently not a hero or a sage, but an appraiser (provisional)!', 'Saikyou no Shokugyou wa Yuusha demo Kenja demo Naku Kanteishi (Kari) Rashii desu yo?', '最強の職業は勇者でも賢者でもなく鑑定士（仮）らしいですよ？', ARRAY['The Strongest Occupation Is Not a Hero or a Sage, but an Appraiser (Provisional)!', 'Kanteishikari'], 62825, 'the-strongest-job-is-apparently-not-a-hero-or-a-sage-but-an-appraiser-provisional', 'Hibiki, a high school student who was suddenly transferred to another world, wanders alone in a vast grassland of a fantasy world where monsters inhabit. All he has are non-combat skills such as "Appraisal"! From a hopeless situation, he is saved by encounters, and his all-powerful abilities blossom! An another world adventure tale of miraculous reversal cheats burst forth!

(Source: Alpha Manga)

Note: Saikyou no Shokugyou wa Yuusha demo Kenja demo Naku Kanteishi (Kari) Rashii desu yo? was streamed a week in advance of the TV broadcast on dAnimestore, and ABEMA starting with episode 2. The first episode was released on April 2, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on April 4, 2026.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx200769-8WkFkoFxc2fw.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/f3QbevP2CG0', 5.8, 2026, 'ongoing', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Studio Flad', 'Docomo Anime Store', 'NBCUniversal Entertainment Japan', 'Sun Electronics', 'BS Asahi', 'AlphaPolis', 'TOKYO MX', 'Bushiroad Move', 'Bit grooove promotion', 'KLOCKWORX'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:17:45.065727+00:00', '2026-05-31T13:46:58.995927+00:00'),
  ('ed99e7a2-dde7-4ce9-9102-26a5c6be9e83', 'The Classroom of a Black Cat and a Witch', 'The Classroom of a Black Cat and a Witch', 'Kuroneko to Majo no Kyoushitsu', '黒猫と魔女の教室', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 62171, 'the-classroom-of-a-black-cat-and-a-witch', 'The Royal Diana Academy is a prestigious school that accepts individuals with adept magical abilities. Upon graduation, these students find themselves at the top of their field or employed by the royal family. Spica Virgo dreams of studying at the academy, aiming to be a top-rate sorceress like her idol Claude Sirius. Claude is a world-renowned sorcerer who became the institution''s youngest instructor, but mysteriously disappeared soon after.

Lacking the experience and connections required for admission, Spica finds herself unable to make meaningful progress with her training. One day, however, she meets a talking black cat with magical abilities. Hoping to change the situation for the better, she begs the animal to take her as his apprentice and teach her the magic she needs to attend the academy. The cat accepts the deal on one condition—she must find a way to reverse his feline curse. Despite the arduous challenges ahead of her, Spica is determined to prove herself as a student worthy of the cat''s mentorship.

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1716/153989l.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/97lYICAGNmE?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1', 6.6, 2026, 'ongoing', 'tv', ARRAY['Comedy', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['LIDENFILMS'], NULL, 23, 'PG-13', '2026-05-31T08:12:46.894+00:00', '2026-05-31T13:47:27.257983+00:00'),
  ('7b8b27d5-49d6-4c33-9ce2-2ede837c0a2e', 'Nukitashi THE ANIMATION OVAs', NULL, 'Nukitashi THE ANIMATION OVAs', 'ぬきたし THE ANIMATION OVAs', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 63046, NULL, NULL, 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx194712-lfwR1kGiy8NR.png', NULL, NULL, 6.3, 2025, 'completed', 'ova', ARRAY['Ecchi'], ARRAY['Passione'], 4, 5, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:25:19.829425+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:19.829425+00:00'),
  ('10f3ee97-d8d3-4c6f-bb54-6b0a042172ec', 'LOVE FLOPS', 'LOVE FLOPS', 'Renai Flops', '恋愛フロップス', ARRAY['Renai Furoppusu'], 51403, NULL, 'Asahi Kashiwagi lives the typical life of an average high school student — until the day a TV fortune teller’s predictions come true one after another, culminating in a series of risqué encounters! Destiny seemingly draws five beautiful girls into Asahi’s path, and soon he finds himself fielding not one, not two, but five love confessions. Asahi will need to follow his heart to find the perfect love for him, or else his love fortunes may end in one epic flail and flop.

(Source: HIDIVE)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx146676-8hkJxhY3b4tX.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/146676-puPd4socxvXT.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/d7i5bjOtaJ0', 6.5, 2022, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Comedy', 'Drama', 'Ecchi', 'Romance', 'Sci-Fi'], ARRAY['KADOKAWA', 'Passione', 'AT-X', 'BS11', 'Movic', 'NTT Plala', 'TOKYO MX', 'TV Aichi', 'Sun Television', 'Sentai Filmworks'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:28:36.569679+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:28:36.569679+00:00'),
  ('ef4a86d4-06d6-4dad-b1ba-0c28f7b0b5fc', 'The Testament of Sister New Devil: Tojo Basara''s Hard, Sweet Daily Life', 'The Testament of Sister New Devil: Tojo Basara''s Hard, Sweet Daily Life', 'Shinmai Maou no Testament: Toujou Basara no Hard Sweet na Nichijou', '新妹魔王の契約者 東城刃更のハードスウィートな日常', ARRAY['Shinmai Maou no Keiyakusha OVA', 'The Testament of Sister New Devil OVA', 'Shinmai Maou no Keiyakusha: Toujou Basara no Hard Sweet na Nichijou'], 29027, NULL, 'An unaired episode of Shinmai Maou no Testament, bundled with the eighth light novel volume.

Basara finds himself in a compromising situation with the school nurse, but was it all a dream?!

(Source: Funimation)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/21247-rLeBLBb78aUQ.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/AfDCSdkWWxE?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1', 6.5, 2015, 'completed', 'ova', ARRAY['Action', 'Ecchi', 'Fantasy', 'Romance'], ARRAY['Production IMS', 'Funimation'], 1, 25, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:08:03.378314+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:29:32.275604+00:00'),
  ('a29d8f36-e604-415d-9ae2-994d27faec3a', 'Mob Psycho 100 II', 'Mob Psycho 100 II', 'Mob Psycho 100 II', 'モブサイコ100 II', ARRAY['Mob Psycho Hyaku', 'ม็อบไซโค 100 คนพลังจิต ภาค 2', 'Моб Психо 100 II'], 37510, NULL, 'The second season of Mob Psycho 100. 
Kageyama is an ordinary 8th grader who just wants to live a normal life. Although he can disappear in the crowd in a flash, he was actually the most powerful psychic. The lives of those around Mob and his numerous feelings that softly piles up for the eventual explosion. The mysterious group "Claw" stands before him once again. In the midst of his youthful days, where will his roaring heart take him!?


(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101338-rokVscjRYzdP.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101338-Rl54Qhx71dUq.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Pr43Sayk37s', 8.7, 2019, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Comedy', 'Drama', 'Psychological', 'Slice of Life', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['bones', 'Warner Bros. Japan', 'Shogakukan-Shueisha Productions', 'KLOCKWORX', 'BS Fuji', 'Hakuhodo DY Music & Pictures'], 13, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:05:52.574554+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:44:14.8214+00:00'),
  ('fe785bb8-c001-42e9-8aba-62d039a4e4d4', 'Sentenced to Be a Hero', 'Sentenced to Be a Hero', 'Yuusha Kei ni Shosu: Choubatsu Yuusha 9004-tai Keimu Kiroku', '勇者刑に処す 懲罰勇者9004隊刑務記録', ARRAY['ผู้กล้าโทษประหาร : บันทึกการรับโทษของหน่วยผู้กล้าต้องโทษ 9004', '용사형에 처함'], 56009, 'sentenced-to-be-a-hero', 'In a world where heroism is a punishment, Xylo Forbartz, a condemned goddess killer, battles endless hordes of monstrous abominations as part of Penal Hero Unit 9004. Death is no escape, only a cycle of resurrection and relentless combat. But when Xylo encounters a mysterious new goddess, their unlikely alliance sparks a rebellion that could shatter the chains of eternal punishment.

(Source: Crunchyroll)

Notes:
- The first episode aired with a runtime of ~58 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.
- Initially scheduled to air in October, 2025', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx167152-O1pm6DWwifBD.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/167152-6QxZG8Dmf1EL.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/GcRs1JC7xeg', 8.1, 2026, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Drama', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Studio KAI', 'KADOKAWA', 'VIC GAME STUDIOS', 'Sammy', 'Kansai TV'], 12, 25, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:36:44.499661+00:00', '2026-05-31T13:56:22.575081+00:00'),
  ('2f9dd806-948e-4be0-99d6-10f114f448a8', 'DARLING in the FRANXX', 'DARLING in the FRANXX', 'Darling in the Franxx', 'ダーリン・イン・ザ・フランキス', ARRAY['DitF', 'DarliFra', 'Любимый во Франксе'], 35849, NULL, 'The distant future: Humanity established the mobile fort city, Plantation, upon the ruined wasteland. Within the city were pilot quarters, Mistilteinn, otherwise known as the “Birdcage.” That is where the children live... Their only mission in life was the fight. Their enemies are the mysterious giant organisms known as Kyoryu. The children operate robots known as FRANXX in order to face these still unseen enemies. Among them was a boy who was once called a child prodigy: Code number 016, Hiro. One day, a mysterious girl called Zero Two appears in front of Hiro. “I’ve found you, my Darling.”

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx99423-8MBxtwCeHf8B.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99423-OQfem628gdxD.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/KNIS0mVawhc', 6.9, 2018, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Drama', 'Mecha', 'Psychological', 'Romance', 'Sci-Fi'], ARRAY['TRIGGER', 'Aniplex', 'CloverWorks', 'A-1 Pictures', 'Movic', 'Ultra Super Pictures', 'Crunchyroll', 'Funimation'], 24, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:08:49.566488+00:00', '2026-05-31T15:42:34.963291+00:00'),
  ('7e64ab31-7fe1-4d82-afd2-622cf5b2b6e2', 'Secrets of the Silent Witch', 'Secrets of the Silent Witch', 'Silent Witch: Chinmoku no Majo no Kakushigoto', 'サイレント・ウィッチ 沈黙の魔女の隠しごと', ARRAY['ไซเลนต์วิตช์: ความลับของแม่มดแห่งความเงียบงัน', 'Silent Witch 沉默魔女的祕密'], 59459, 'secrets-of-the-silent-witch', 'Monica Everett, the Silent Witch, is the world’s only practitioner of Voiceless Magic, a veritable heroine who single-handedly fended off the Black Dragon of legend. However, the young prodigy is actually…super-duper shy! Yup, turns out she only learned Voiceless Magic to avoid speaking in public. Ignorant of this, the Seven Sages have placed her on a top-secret mission to guard the Second Prince. Can Monica keep it together as she contends with both social interaction and the evils targeting the young royal?
(Source: Yen Press, edited)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx179966-g0EU7rVe2Og7.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/179966-hf71VrF1zhPM.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/0OBF29HoV4A', 8.1, 2025, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Adventure', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Aniplex', 'KADOKAWA', 'Studio Gokumi', 'TOKYO MX', 'BS11', 'Movic'], 13, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:21:08.853636+00:00', '2026-05-31T14:00:11.624289+00:00'),
  ('bb3e48cb-0fc6-484b-aad8-7b100f5ffa83', 'ID: INVADED', 'ID: INVADED', 'ID: INVADED', 'イド：インヴェイデッド', ARRAY['异度侵入 ID:INVADED'], 40046, NULL, 'Welcome to Kura, an organization that investigates crime using the Mizuhanome system which senses the drive to kill. Sakaido is a brilliant detective and pilot of the Mizuhanome. To solve a case, he enters the world of the killer''s unconscious mind: the id well. In the shadows of brutal and puzzling cases lurks John Walker, the Serial Killer Creator. Where will Sakaido''s pursuit lead?

(Source: Funimation)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx110350-uchN78wglmhN.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/110350-kJfEuQ4Cx4j1.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/nc7Y0BvEYQk', 7.7, 2020, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Drama', 'Mystery', 'Psychological', 'Sci-Fi', 'Thriller'], ARRAY['NAZ', 'Funimation', 'KADOKAWA'], 13, 25, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:31:48.521358+00:00', '2026-05-31T15:29:58.231832+00:00'),
  ('2dd633ac-06c9-4718-9f1d-f89c46cb0acd', 'No Game, No Life Zero', 'No Game, No Life Zero', 'No Game No Life Zero', 'ノーゲーム・ノーライフ ゼロ', ARRAY['NO GAME NO LIFE Movie', '游戏人生 零', 'โนเกม โนไลฟ์ เดอะมูฟวี่', 'โนเกม โนไลฟ์ ซีโร่', 'NGNL Zero', 'ノゲノラ ゼロ', 'nogenora 0'], 33674, NULL, 'A movie adaptation of the sixth volume of the light novel series announced at the MF Bunko J Summer School Festival 2016 event.

Six thousand years before Sora and Shiro were even a blink in the history of Disboard, war consumed the land, tearing apart the heavens, destroying stars, and even threatening to wipe out the human race. Amid the chaos and destruction, a young man named Riku leads humanity toward the tomorrow his heart believes in. One day, in the ruins of an Elf city, he meets Schwi, a female exiled "Ex Machina" android who asks him to teach her what it means to have a human heart.
(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx21875-ybSgx75MgRMM.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21875-WWkiWSnNcdbt.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/0i1AxFdlu0M', 8, 2017, 'completed', 'movie', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Drama', 'Fantasy', 'Romance'], ARRAY['MADHOUSE', 'AT-X', 'Movic', 'Kadokawa Pictures Japan', 'Sentai Filmworks', 'Frontier Works'], 1, 110, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:35:28.233608+00:00', '2026-05-31T15:59:26.566085+00:00'),
  ('a2d5c1c8-ce7a-42ed-b017-7cddd43fd9b9', 'Mob Psycho 100 REIGEN The Miraculous Unknown Psychic', 'Mob Psycho 100 REIGEN The Miraculous Unknown Psychic', 'Mob Psycho 100 REIGEN: Shirarezaru Kiseki Reinouryokusha', 'モブサイコ100 REIGEN ～知られざる奇跡の霊能力者～', ARRAY['Моб Психо 100: Рейген — таинственный чудесный экстрасенс'], 36616, NULL, 'Reigen Arataka, the GREATEST psychic of the 21st century, tells us the 100% true, never before seen story behind some of his greatest supernatural feats. The world renowned psychic narrates his tell-all book in a retelling of the events in Mob Psycho 100.

(Source: Funimation) 

Note: The OVA was screened at the Maihama Ampitheater in Chiba on March 18, 2018.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx100353-6dM62JCho2Yg.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100353-4rbNdk54kkHu.jpg', NULL, 7.3, 2018, 'completed', 'ova', ARRAY['Action', 'Comedy', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['bones'], 1, 60, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:05:54.472967+00:00', '2026-05-31T15:59:33.478724+00:00'),
  ('7760fd29-c5d3-4847-9309-59604f2b0cc1', 'Summer Time Rendering', 'Summer Time Rendering', 'Summertime Render', 'サマータイムレンダ', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 47194, NULL, 'Since the death of his parents, Shinpei Ajiro had lived with the Kofune family and their two daughters—Mio and Ushio. Although he then left his home island to continue his education in Tokyo, Shinpei returns after Ushio tragically drowns during the attempted rescue of a little girl. During the funeral, his best friend informs him about bruises found around Ushio''s neck, casting doubt over the cause of her death.

Suspecting a murder has taken place, Shinpei reevaluates recent events, but strange incidents only continue to transpire. Disappearing people and other unexplainable occurrences lead Mio to recall an old folktale referring to entities called "Shadows," which may not be entirely fantasy. Supposedly, an encounter with one''s Shadow foretells the person''s impending demise.

Facing the dark side of Hitogashima Island, Shinpei stands against his grim fate to fulfill Ushio''s final will—to protect Mio.

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1120/120796l.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/wtjP_PzzhTU?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1', 8.5, 2022, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Mystery', 'Supernatural', 'Suspense'], ARRAY['OLM'], 25, 23, 'R', '2026-05-31T08:09:34.712+00:00', '2026-05-31T16:43:23.055161+00:00'),
  ('ac72bdfa-0143-4a07-870f-94a4d518d146', 'To LOVE-Ru OVA', NULL, 'To LOVE-Ru OVA', 'To LOVEる -とらぶる-', ARRAY['To-LOVE-Ru OVA', 'Trouble OVA', 'To Love You OVA', 'To Love Ru OVA'], 5667, NULL, 'Episode 1: Rito becomes a Woman
Lala invents a gizmo to make her bust bigger. However, this invention of hers accidentally turns Rito into a woman.

Episode 2: Rito and Mikan
Feeling lonely because Rito is always spending time with Lala, Mikan storms out of the house. While Rito and Lala are out looking for her, a few flashbacks from the past showing Rito and Mikan as kids are shown.

Episode 3: Welcome to the Southern Resort!!
Haruna wins an island resort trip for ten females. Rito gets turned into a dog by one of Lala''s inventions and somehow ends up on the island as well.

Episode 4: Trouble Quest
Rito and the girls become trapped inside an RPG game where the objective is to save Lala and defeat the evil witch Kyouko.

Episode 5: Nana and Momo
Lala''s sisters cause mischief for Rito and his harem at a cherry blossom viewing.

Episode 6: Draft, Metamorphose, Hand   Mikan finds Peke taking snapshots of new clothing while shopping. Suddenly, a stranger steals her bag; As Rito tries to explore Lala''s cleaned-up bedroom, he accidentally activates one of Lala''s inventions, fusing his hand to Lala''s tail.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b5667-CoLrg1dTE6h7.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5667-su9csSfBb5cI.jpg', NULL, 6.8, 2009, 'completed', 'ova', ARRAY['Comedy', 'Ecchi', 'Sci-Fi'], ARRAY['Xebec'], 6, 25, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:29:18.481789+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:24:29.674084+00:00'),
  ('8d49887c-740b-4521-b3d4-54112ff472c5', 'Rakudai Kenja no Gakuin Musou: Nidome no Tensei, S-Rank Cheat Majutsushi Boukenroku', NULL, 'Rakudai Kenja no Gakuin Musou: Nidome no Tensei, S-Rank Cheat Majutsushi Boukenroku', '落第賢者の学院無双～二度目の転生、Sランクチート魔術師冒険録～', ARRAY['From Overshadowed to Overpowered: Second Reincarnation of a Talentless Sage', 'The Unsuccessful Yet Academically Unparalleled Sage: A Cheating S-Rank Sorcerer''s Post-Rebirth Adventurer Log', 'The Failed Sage''s Academy Domination'], 63508, NULL, 'Ephtal is reincarnated as a human, coming from modern Earth. In this new world where magic is real, he decides to devote the entirety of his life in the pursuit of magic. Despite his efforts, though, he discovers that he is absolutely talentless in magic, and breathed his last in anguish....But it isn''t the end for him just yet! He reincarnates once again bearing the same name, Ephtal, 400 years later. Having retained his knowledge and power, he steals his resolve and once again sets his sights for the peak of magic!

(Source: Comikey)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx208044-jweYvjbGKnCo.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2026, NULL, 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['EMT Squared'], NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:24:39.780002+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:24:39.780002+00:00'),
  ('3a36db9a-00b9-4c67-82d1-32f6084ddbb1', 'Nukitashi THE ANIMATION', 'Nukitashi THE ANIMATION', 'Nukitashi THE ANIMATION', 'ぬきたし THE ANIMATION', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 57969, NULL, 'The island of the everlasting summer, Seiran Island.

Junnosuke Tachibana, whose family home was on this island, returned to it with his sister, Asane Tachibana, after the death of their parents.

However, Seiran Island has become a place of madness due to the implementation of the “Perverted Law,” a law designed to combat population decline. This law permits and even encourages lewd sex acts everywhere on the island, and refusing to engage in “reproductive activities” is punished almost as severely as a crime.

Junnosuke, a proud virgin and staunch defender of virginity, questions the legitimacy of this law. Determined to protect both his and his beloved sister’s purity, he forms the anti-copulation front NLNS (No Love No Sex) and sets out to destroy the Perveted Law once and for all.

“I’ll… destroy the Perverted Law!”

(Source: Official Site, translated)

Note: Prior to the TV broadcast, a special pre-release screening titled “Nukitashi THE ANIMATION – Seiran Island Special ver. Pre-release Screening Event” was held on June 22, 2025 at Cinem@rt Shinjuku in Tokyo. It featured episodes 1-3.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx174188-fZg8iePD9Dca.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/174188-zHfBIXSeesMT.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/cgWYINOVyR4', 6.8, 2025, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Comedy', 'Drama', 'Ecchi', 'Romance'], ARRAY['KADOKAWA', 'Passione', 'Yostar', 'AT-X', 'Qruppo'], 11, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:25:19.832953+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:19.832953+00:00'),
  ('6572f9f9-075f-4f27-a5be-2af3b85659ef', 'Harem in the Labyrinth of Another World', 'Harem in the Labyrinth of Another World', 'Isekai Meikyuu de Harem wo', '異世界迷宮でハーレムを', ARRAY['ฮาเร็มนี้พี่ขอสร้างที่ต่างโลก', 'Harem in the fantasy world dungeon'], 44524, NULL, 'Struggling with life and society, high school student Michio Kaga wanders about the Internet and lands on an odd website. The website, featuring a number of questions and a point-based system, allows one to create skills and abilities for a character. Upon completing his character, Kaga was transported to a game-like fantasy world and reborn as a strong man who can claim idol-level girls. Thus begins the cheat and harem legend of a reborn man!

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx127090-ftd2rro80kk9.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/127090-TeI6dTx0Zd6z.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/9wgtphu-7mI', 6.3, 2022, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Drama', 'Ecchi', 'Fantasy', 'Romance'], ARRAY['Passione', 'KADOKAWA', 'Crunchyroll', 'Docomo Anime Store', 'AT-X', 'Shufunotomo', 'Movic', 'Kadokawa Media House'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:26:57.62542+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:57.62542+00:00'),
  ('69ab1563-abdd-468e-b1d3-e1c645a2e382', 'Maken-Ki! Battling Venus', 'Maken-Ki! Battling Venus', 'Maken-Ki!', 'マケン姫っ！', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 9936, NULL, 'Based on the manga series by Hiromitsu Takeda, this romantic comedy is about Takeru Ohyama, a typical perverted teenage boy. His new school doesn''t require entrance exams, and it just turned co-ed! Unfortunately, his dreams of a happy high school life are dashed when he finds out the school is much more than it seems. All of the students wield a special item a Maken to unleash their magical abilities in duels! Can Takeru find a Maken that works for him? Even while trying to fit in at a new school and dealing with all kinds of girl problems?
(Source: FUNimation)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/9936.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9936-TxE1ElPknoOw.png', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/pBlx0N9eLNY', 5.9, 2011, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Ecchi'], ARRAY['AIC', 'Funimation', 'AIC Spirits'], 12, 25, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:26:22.248623+00:00', '2026-06-01T06:37:24.192784+00:00'),
  ('f8022b36-927c-4a70-869e-23d8eca4a72c', 'Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2', 'Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2', 'Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria Season 2', '杖と剣のウィストリア Season 2', ARRAY['Wistoria''s Wand and Sword Season 2'], 59983, 'wistoria-wand-and-sword-season-2', 'Second season of Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria.', 'https://myanimelist.net/images/anime/1190/155788l.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/eGyEl5uTQLo?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1', NULL, 2026, 'upcoming', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Actas', 'Bandai Namco Pictures'], 12, NULL, 'PG-13', '2026-03-08T06:29:42.371+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:27:46.683145+00:00'),
  ('c0f14e66-c86e-45ec-979f-4bc5d5347507', 'Seraph of the End: Battle in Nagoya - Owaranai Seraph Battle in Nagoya', 'Seraph of the End: Battle in Nagoya - Owaranai Seraph Battle in Nagoya', 'Owari no Seraph: Nagoya Kessen-hen - Owaranai Seraph Nagoya Kessen-hen', '終わりのセラフ 名古屋決戦編 「終わらないセラフ名古屋決戦編」', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 31918, NULL, 'Specials included in the Blu-ray and DVD releases.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21765-ecyvqRcGhM5m.jpg', NULL, NULL, 7.2, 2015, 'completed', 'special', ARRAY['Comedy', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['WIT STUDIO'], 4, 5, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:33:47.204397+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:33:47.204397+00:00'),
  ('35262705-66fd-49ad-908a-61fa0c90a92f', '86 EIGHTY-SIX', '86 EIGHTY-SIX', '86: Eighty Six', '86－エイティシックス－', ARRAY['86--EIGHTY-SIX', '86 -เอทตี้ซิกซ์-', '86 ВОСЕМЬДЕСЯТ ШЕСТЬ', '86 -不存在的战区-'], 41457, NULL, 'Called “Juggernaut,” these are the unmanned combat drones developed by the Republic of San Magnolia in answer to the attacks by the autonomous unmanned drones of the neighboring Empire of Giad, the “Legion”. But they’re only unmanned in name. In reality, they are piloted by the Eighty-sixers—those considered to be less than human and treated as mere tools.

Determined to achieve his own mysterious ends, Shin, the captain of Spearhead Squadron, which is comprised of Eighty-sixers, continues to fight a hopeless war on a battlefield where only death awaits him.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx116589-KawXHB6sApFt.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/116589-SqwYWzaZCdD5.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/VSdS29SDvn4', 8.3, 2021, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Drama', 'Mecha', 'Sci-Fi'], ARRAY['A-1 Pictures', 'Aniplex', 'KADOKAWA', 'BANDAI SPIRITS'], 11, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:31:33.328694+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:33.328694+00:00'),
  ('599f580c-ed07-414d-a196-e79eee637373', 'I Got a Cheat Skill in Another World and Became Unrivaled in The Real World, Too', 'I Got a Cheat Skill in Another World and Became Unrivaled in The Real World, Too: Real World', 'Isekai de Cheat Skill wo Te ni Shita Ore wa, Genjitsu Sekai wo mo Musou Suru: Level Up wa Jinsei wo Kaeta', '異世界でチート能力を手にした俺は、現実世界をも無双する ～レベルアップは人生を変えた～', ARRAY['I Got a Cheat Ability in a Different World, and Became Extraordinary Even in the Real World', 'Isekai de Cheat Nouryoku Ote ni Shita Ore wa, Genjitsu Sekai o mo Musou Suru', 'สกิลโกงไร้เทียมทาน สร้างตำนานในสองโลก: ชีวิตพลิกผันด้วยการอัปเลเวล', 'Ganhei um Poder Apelão em Outro Mundo e Agora Sou Imbatível no Mundo Real', 'Iseleve', '在异世界获得超强能力的我，在现实世界照样无敌～等级提升改变人生命运', 'いせれべ', 'Skill Nge-Cheat yang Kudapat di Dunia Lain Juga Membuatku Tanpa Tanding di Dunia Asal'], 52830, 'i-got-a-cheat-skill-in-another-world-and-became-unrivaled-in-the-real-world-too-real-world', 'All his life, Yuuya has been bullied at school and neglected by his parents. After moving into his late grandfather’s home, he discovers a strange door that seems to be calling out to him. Yuuya opens the door, steps inside, and is suddenly transported to a magical world! This new world holds rare treasures and grants him powerful skills, which he takes back to Earth for a new lease on life.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx153845-C47aoKy7wf19.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/153845-qcUXgT0toF1J.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/qDaUzzpowzQ', 6.3, 2023, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Fantasy', 'Romance'], ARRAY['Millepensee', 'TMS Entertainment', 'KADOKAWA', 'BS11', 'CTW', 'Victor Entertainment', 'Fuji TV', 'TOKYO MX'], 13, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:37:23.704895+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:42:01.021419+00:00'),
  ('5040d00f-8524-49d8-b69f-6d27ca1b473b', 'THE LAST SUMMONER', 'THE LAST SUMMONER', 'Zuihou De Zhaohuan Shi', '最后的召唤师', ARRAY['最後の召喚師 -The Last Summoner-'], 41915, NULL, 'A talented young cook''s encounter with a hungry girl who popped up in his kitchen changes his ordinary life forever. Dora, a summoned spirit and a truly cute goddess, now calls him master. However, he is not interested at all and trying everything he could to get away from the ghostly figure. As fate would have it, when he becomes a summoner by accident, there is no turn back in life.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx114108-Qe5wwJQr5H4O.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/A8VxQ6y5t0s', 6.3, 2022, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['ASK Animation Studio', 'bilibili'], 12, 23, NULL, '2026-05-31T18:42:26.490371+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:26.490371+00:00'),
  ('479769d9-d48c-4a9c-8318-2662e34fe71a', 'I''ve Somehow Gotten Stronger When I Improved My Farm-Related Skills', 'I''ve Somehow Gotten Stronger When I Improved My Farm-Related Skills', 'Noumin Kanren no Skill Bakka Agetetara Naze ka Tsuyoku Natta.', '農民関連のスキルばっか上げてたら何故か強くなった。', ARRAY['I Somehow Got Strong By Raising Skills Related To Farming', '点满农民相关技能后，不知为何就变强了。', 'Fantasy Farm - Avevo coltivato solo le mie abilità legate all''agricoltura, ma sono diventato più forte'], 51128, NULL, 'Al Wayne loves farming — and we don’t mean the video game sim. He wants to be a literal farmer, but in the process of improving his agriculture skills, he somehow winds up maxing out his overall character stats! He’s superpowered in the most unexpected of ways with abilities even the strongest of heroes would envy. Alas, all he wants is an idyllic farmer''s life, but with demons and monsters invading the realm, Al may have to take up the mantle of hero just to keep his dreams from withering away!

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx145815-XsgcXy7WzgtK.png', NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/KWtUuFPwo00', 5.7, 2022, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Fantasy', 'Slice of Life'], ARRAY['studio A-CAT', 'bilibili', 'Futabasha', 'NBCUniversal Entertainment Japan', 'Docomo Anime Store', 'Bushiroad Move', 'Nippon Columbia', 'KLOCKWORX'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T18:42:44.525595+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:44.525595+00:00');

(Source: MAL News)', 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1423/155713l.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ICOxQWf8zFU?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1', 7.9, 2026, 'ongoing', 'tv', ARRAY['Romance'], ARRAY['Connect'], 12, 23, 'PG-13', '2026-05-26T03:43:58.482+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:01:05.067877+00:00'),
  ('5374bfd1-7589-4b46-abd0-cf4a19ec1faa', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Cursed by Light', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Cursed by Light', 'Nanatsu no Taizai: Hikari ni Norowareshi Mono-tachi', '七つの大罪 光に呪われし者たち', ARRAY['Los siete pecados capitales: La maldición de la luz', 'ศึกตํานาน 7 อัศวิน: สาปแห่งแสง', 'Сім смертних гріхів: Прокляття світла', 'Семь смертных грехов: Проклятие света'], 46420, NULL, 'Taking place in-between the final two episodes of Nanatsu no Taizai: Fundo no Shinpan, Meliodas and his friends jump back into action when the new era of peace is threatened by a powerful magical alliance that could spell the end for all. The original film also adapts the manga''s last chapter.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx128740-xpjfCO2kpFdz.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/128740-S637ZLKVe6S9.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/s4U5ipjy6Vk', 7, 2021, 'completed', 'movie', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Ecchi', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Studio DEEN'], 1, 80, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:08.732565+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:08.732565+00:00'),
  ('6d192b8f-9b2b-4beb-b905-2f3a600a38be', 'Assassination Classroom the Movie: 365 Days‘ Time', 'Assassination Classroom the Movie: 365 Days‘ Time', 'Ansatsu Kyoushitsu Movie: 365-Nichi no Jikan', '劇場版 暗殺教室 365日の時間', ARRAY['Assassination Classroom the Movie: 365 Days'], 33513, NULL, 'A compilation film of the Ansatsu Kyoushitsu TV series, featuring anime-only epilogue scenes not originally in the manga.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx101102-3J3GRv1D9MGL.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101102-ioRyUOsdcPBK.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/AVss5CGbNPA', 7.2, 2016, 'completed', 'movie', ARRAY['Action', 'Comedy', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['Lerche'], 1, 92, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:41.215639+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:41.215639+00:00'),
  ('f506b84b-c936-4c17-8d0f-17676a4b4dda', 'Heavenly Delusion', 'Heavenly Delusion', 'Tengoku Daimakyou', '天国大魔境', ARRAY[]::TEXT[], 53393, NULL, 'Fifteen years ago, disaster struck human civilization, and now dangerous man-eating monsters roam the ravaged lands, posing an existential threat to the remaining survivors. Amid this turmoil, an isolated facility shelters children and nurtures them in peace. However, as a few among them find out about the world beyond the narrow periphery of their nursery''s walls, their curiosity about it slowly grows.

Meanwhile, in the outside world, young survivors Maru and Kiruko band together to search for a special place called Heaven, each for their own reasons. Carrying past burdens and tragic secrets, the two hope to find answers to the cruelty they have experienced in their lives and in the world, which still remains in tatters.

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1121/133132l.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/62_aXZGkG3E?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1', 8.2, 2023, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Adventure', 'Mystery', 'Sci-Fi'], ARRAY['Production I.G'], 13, 23, 'R', '2026-05-31T08:20:41.258+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:14:23.190685+00:00'),
  ('acc5effb-4627-4704-a837-dd8792d09ce9', 'Dragon Raja II -The Mourner''s Eyes-', 'Dragon Raja II -The Mourner''s Eyes-', 'Long Zu 2', '龙族 第二季', ARRAY['Dragon Raja 2', '龍族Ⅱ -The Mourner''s Eyes-', 'Ryuuzoku II: The Mourner''s Eyes', 'Long Zu II: Daowangzhe Zhi Tong'], 59662, NULL, 'The second season of Long Zu.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx157692-lihmnuJGcbM6.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/157692-bnduywLJZIxk.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/CdlC09jSl7U', 7.5, 2025, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Drama', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Tencent Penguin Pictures', 'GARDEN'], 24, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:30:42.122775+00:00', '2026-05-31T20:17:55.374123+00:00'),
  ('ec5b3eef-35c4-444f-b2b6-2600d151b1e3', 'God Eater', 'God Eater', 'GOD EATER', 'GOD EATER', ARRAY['ゴッドイーター'], 27631, NULL, 'The Far East, 2071.
The domain of the mad gods.

In the early 2050s, unknown life forms called “Oracle cells” begin their uncontrolled consumption of all life on Earth.
Their ravenous appetite and remarkable adaptability earn them first dread, then awe, and finally the name “aragami”.
In the face of an enemy completely immune to conventional weapons, urban civilization collapses, and each day humanity is driven further and further toward extinction.

One single ray of hope remains for humanity.
Following the development of “God Arcs”—living weapons which incorporate Oracle cells—their wielders are organized into an elite force.
In a world ravaged by mad gods, these “God Eaters” fight a desperate war...

(Source: Daisuki)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20849-TvJpY8iLEcYG.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20849-w4KnIo3OfMx1.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/1nRWcVlNPsc', 6.9, 2015, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Sci-Fi'], ARRAY['ufotable', 'Lantis', 'Bandai Visual', 'Bandai Namco Entertainment', 'TOKYO MX', 'Aniplex of America', 'Hanabee Entertainment', 'ufotable', 'Anime Consortium Japan'], 13, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:35:08.712052+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:49:03.12395+00:00'),
  ('d9b64d5b-c5ec-42bf-9c7e-1cc76ccbfc3e', '86 EIGHTY-SIX Part 2', '86 EIGHTY-SIX Part 2', '86: Eighty Six Part 2', '86－エイティシックス－ 第2クール', ARRAY['86－エイティシックス－ 2クール', '86 -เอทตี้ซิกซ์- พาร์ท 2'], 48569, NULL, 'The second cour of 86: Eighty Six.

Having bid Lena farewell, Shin and the surviving members of the Spearhead squadron continue into the heart of Legion territory. There, they endure countless hardships until they''re rescued by the Federal Republic of Giad, a reformed nation that offers them a second chance at a peaceful life. But it isn''t long before a sense of duty calls the Eighty-Six back to the battlefield. Choosing to enlist in the military, they willingly walk back through the gates of hell, this time joined by a peculiar new ally-Frederica Rosenfort: a haughty young girl with a rare ability and wisdom far beyond her years.

(Source: Yen Press)

Note: The last two episodes were originally set to air in the first two weeks of January 2022, but were postponed to the second and third week of March due to production issues.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx131586-JhC0wcBi09EZ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131586-TQED17cUhGnT.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y6OE1TBLtJs', 8.7, 2021, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Drama', 'Mecha', 'Sci-Fi'], ARRAY['A-1 Pictures', 'Aniplex', 'KADOKAWA', 'BANDAI SPIRITS'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T17:31:33.32193+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:03:43.152471+00:00'),
  ('946932ad-d292-498a-9281-59cbc422ca3d', 'Erased', 'Erased', 'Boku dake ga Inai Machi', '僕だけがいない街', ARRAY['The Town Where Only I am Missing', 'BokuMachi'], 31043, NULL, 'When tragedy is about to strike, Satoru Fujinuma finds himself sent back several minutes before the accident occurs. The detached, 29-year-old manga artist has taken advantage of this powerful yet mysterious phenomenon, which he calls "Revival," to save many lives.
 
However, when he is wrongfully accused of murdering someone close to him, Satoru is sent back to the past once again, but this time to 1988, 18 years in the past. Soon, he realizes that the murder may be connected to the abduction and killing of one of his classmates, the solitary and mysterious Kayo Hinazuki, that took place when he was a child. This is his chance to make things right.
 
Boku dake ga Inai Machi follows Satoru in his mission to uncover what truly transpired 18 years ago and prevent the death of his classmate while protecting those he cares about in the present.

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/10/77957l.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/DwmxEAWjTQQ?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1', 8.3, 2016, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Mystery', 'Suspense'], ARRAY['A-1 Pictures'], 12, 23, 'R', '2026-05-31T08:09:58.252+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:30:54.885698+00:00'),
  ('74f80ae4-1bf9-4d89-a1c5-9aecdcd06b06', 'Seraph of the End: Battle in Nagoya', 'Seraph of the End: Battle in Nagoya', 'Owari no Seraph: Nagoya Kessen-hen', '終わりのセラフ　名古屋決戦編', ARRAY['OwaSera 2', 'Seraph of the End: El Reino de los Vampiros', 'เทวทูตแห่งโลกมืด ภาค 2'], 28927, NULL, 'Yuuichirou has reunited with Mikaela at the Shinjuku Battle. But Mikaela was turned into a vampire... To save the "family," and to protect his fellow members, Yuuichirou needed to gain knowledge and power. He searched for ways to bring back vampire to human beings, and at the same time, trained hard working on the Cursed Gear. 

Meanwhile, Kureto calls Guren and tells him a shocking truth. That in one month, the main unit of the vampire will start attacking Tokyo. To get a head start against vampires, Kureto orders Guren to go to Nagoya. The noble extermination mission is about to open fire!

(Source: Official website)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20993-c34UTma2bCcv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20993-pZacVGnE1F2L.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/KRYkpjKW9sQ', 7.5, 2015, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Drama', 'Fantasy', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['WIT STUDIO', 'Shueisha', 'Sony PCL', 'Rakuonsha', '10GAUGE', 'NBCUniversal Entertainment Japan'], 12, 23, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:33:47.213924+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:33:47.213924+00:00'),
  ('3b56a12a-bb06-4edf-8d41-8d15d4e6ffa4', 'The Promised Neverland', 'The Promised Neverland', 'Yakusoku no Neverland', '約束のネバーランド', ARRAY['YakuNeba', 'TPN', 'نيفرلاند الموعودة', '约定的梦幻岛', 'พันธสัญญาเนเวอร์แลนด์', '約定的夢幻島'], 37779, NULL, 'Emma, Norman and Ray are the brightest kids at the Grace Field House orphanage. And under the care of the woman they refer to as “Mom,” all the kids have enjoyed a comfortable life. Good food, clean clothes and the perfect environment to learn—what more could an orphan ask for? One day, though, Emma and Norman uncover the dark truth of the outside world they are forbidden from seeing.

(Source: VIZ Media)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101759-8UR7r9MNVpz2.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101759-MhlCoeqnODso.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/ApLudqucq-s', 8.4, 2019, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Drama', 'Fantasy', 'Horror', 'Mystery', 'Psychological', 'Thriller'], ARRAY['CloverWorks', 'Aniplex', 'Dentsu', 'Fuji TV', 'Shueisha', 'Aniplex of America'], 12, 23, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:35:00.053224+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:35:00.053224+00:00'),
  ('66e603bf-47c7-47d8-b45b-752137064a9b', 'The Promised Neverland Season 2', 'The Promised Neverland Season 2', 'Yakusoku no Neverland 2', '約束のネバーランド2', ARRAY['YakuNeba', 'TPN2', 'พันธสัญญาเนเวอร์แลนด์ ภาค 2', '約定的夢幻島 第二季'], 39617, NULL, 'The second season of Yakusoku no Neverland.

Fifteen children escape Grace Field House, a false paradise, hoping for a chance at freedom. Instead, they encounter plants and animals they have never before seen, and are chased by demons. The outside world is so beautiful, and yet is almost too cruel to face.

Even so, the children refuse to give up. They are guided in their search for better lives only by a message from Minerva and a pen Norman left behind in order to fulfill their promise to return to the House to save those of their family who are still trapped within.

(Source: Aniplex of America)

Note: Episode 1 streamed early on Amazon Prime on Jan 7, 2021. The regular TV broadcast started on Jan 8, 2021.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx108725-ZKivuyr4Jtc9.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108725-lg940Urvxzfu.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/DXNXOsZqc28', 5.2, 2021, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Drama', 'Fantasy', 'Horror', 'Psychological', 'Thriller'], ARRAY['CloverWorks', 'Aniplex', 'Shueisha', 'Dentsu', 'Fuji TV', 'Aniplex of America'], 11, 23, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:35:00.061205+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:35:00.061205+00:00'),
  ('f9c51840-6278-4d22-b6c0-3e31d9bf05d7', 'The Seven Deadly Sins the Movie: Prisoners of the Sky', 'The Seven Deadly Sins the Movie: Prisoners of the Sky', 'Nanatsu no Taizai Movie: Tenkuu no Torawarebito', '劇場版 七つの大罪 天空の囚われ人', ARRAY['ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน: นักโทษแห่งท้องนภา ', 'Семь смертных грехов: Узники небес'], 35946, NULL, 'The Seven Deadly Sins travel to a remote land in search of the phantom ingredient "sky fish." Meliodas and Hawk end up at a "Sky Palace" that exists above the clouds, where all the residents have wings. Meliodas is mistaken for a boy who committed a crime and is thrown in prison. Meanwhile, the residents are preparing a ceremony for defense against a ferocious beast that awakens once every 3,000 years. But the Six Knights of Black, a Demon Clan army, arrives and removes the seal on the beast in order to threaten the lives of the residents of Sky Palace. Meliodas and his allies meet the Six Knights of Black in battle.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx99540-QnY48c1oifvY.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99540-O4ey5WgXrMR8.jpg', NULL, 6.9, 2018, 'completed', 'movie', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['A-1 Pictures', 'Aniplex', 'Kodansha', 'Toei', 'Mainichi Broadcasting System', 'Dentsu', 'Movic', 'Sammy'], 1, 99, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:04.999387+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:04.999387+00:00'),
  ('38b41561-aec1-4513-a38e-70659704bcb1', 'Kaiju No. 8', 'Kaiju No. 8', 'Kaijuu 8-gou', '怪獣８号', ARRAY['Monster #8', '8Kaijuu', 'KAIJU No. EIGHT', 'Kaiju N°8', '괴수 8호'], 52588, 'kaiju-no-8', 'With the highest kaiju-emergence rates in the world, Japan is no stranger to attack by deadly monsters. Enter the Japan Defense Force, a military organization tasked with the neutralization of kaiju. Kafka Hibino, a kaiju-corpse cleanup man, has always dreamed of joining the force. But when he gets another shot at achieving his childhood dream, he undergoes an unexpected transformation. How can he fight kaiju now that he’s become one himself?!

(Source: VIZ Media)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx153288-25FBfFJzEQ5O.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/153288-JNsWuMPMAuJL.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/7n_mFVPeApw', 8.1, 2024, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Sci-Fi'], ARRAY['Toho', 'Shueisha', 'Production I.G', 'Production I.G', 'Studio Khara'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:34:13.844453+00:00', '2026-06-01T07:14:56.059268+00:00'),
  ('9e4472c0-0e09-4948-b493-0bd8e53429cf', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh Part 2', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh Part 2', 'Nanatsu no Taizai: Ensa no Edinburgh - Kouhen', '七つの大罪 怨嗟のエジンバラ 後編', ARRAY['Nanatsu no Taizai: Ensa no Edinburgh Part 2', 'Сім смертних гріхів: Гнів Единбургу. Частина 2', 'Семь смертных грехов. Гнев Эдинбурга. Часть 2'], 53911, NULL, 'The second half of The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh. 

Reunited with Lancelot for the first time since their tragic accident, Tristan must learn to conquer his inner demons in order to save his mother''s life. 

(Source: Netflix)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx162291-gw8Vc73wJORZ.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/9z9o7T2BMsY', 6.5, 2023, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Netflix', 'Alfred Imageworks', 'Marvy Jack', 'The Monk Studios', 'Studio Live'], 1, 54, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:08.727064+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:08.727064+00:00'),
  ('5b58f1b0-dd6e-4844-b6a3-db556b83e9c3', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Imperial Wrath of the Gods', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Imperial Wrath of the Gods', 'Nanatsu no Taizai: Kamigami no Gekirin', '七つの大罪 神々の逆鱗', ARRAY['The Seven Deadly Sins: Wrath of the Gods', 'ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน ภาค 3 เพลิงพิโรธของเหล่าทวยเทพ', 'Семь смертных грехов: Гнев богов'], 39701, NULL, 'Despite repelling the demon invasion of the Kingdom of Lioness, the war is far from over, for Arthur''s Kingdom of Camelot is still being occupied by the demon army and the surviving members of Jikkai. However, in order to begin counter-offensive, the Seven Deadly Sins needs all of its members. Unfortunately, King and Diane are still hiding in the Fairy King''s Forest, where they are made to discover the strange history of Jikkai.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx108928-DuyUzi0JyPIr.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108928-QzElQ1VVSFoC.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/KouDTbLt6WM', 6.3, 2019, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Ecchi', 'Fantasy', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['Studio DEEN', 'Marvy Jack', 'TV Tokyo'], 24, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:05.475+00:00', '2026-06-01T05:11:05.062486+00:00'),
  ('d5262743-fdc4-4a38-b4a9-a98f39588f1a', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh Part 1', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh Part 1', 'Nanatsu no Taizai: Ensa no Edinburgh - Zenpen', '七つの大罪 怨嗟のエジンバラ 前編', ARRAY['ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน: แค้นเอดินเบอระ', 'Nanatsu no Taizai: Ensa no Edinburgh Part 1', 'Сім смертних гріхів: Гнів Единбургу. Частина 1', 'Семь смертных грехов. Гнев Эдинбурга. Часть 1'], 50315, NULL, '14 years since the Kingdom of Liones defeated the Demon Clan and brought peace to the land, Prince Tristan is tormented by his inability to control two great powers: the Demon Clan power of his father, Meliodas, who served as captain of the Seven Deadly Sins as the Dragon Sin of Wrath, and the Goddess Clan power of his mother, Elizabeth. When Elizabeth’s life is threatened, Tristan flees the kingdom and heads toward Edinburgh, where Deathpierce — who was once a member of group of the kingdom’s Holy Knights, the Pleiades of the Azure Sky — maintains his castle. But what are Deathpierce’s intentions?

The wheel of fate begins to move and sweeps up even The Seven Deadly Sins…

(Source: Netflix)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx141352-5GzCzHxoH29X.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/aaW4Gib1F-M', 6.1, 2022, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Marvy Jack', 'Alfred Imageworks', 'Netflix', 'The Monk Studios', 'Studio Live'], 1, 52, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:08.73703+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:08.73703+00:00'),
  ('76a53309-eee1-4eb6-8da2-5952bc802053', 'Assassination Classroom', 'Assassination Classroom', 'Ansatsu Kyoushitsu', '暗殺教室', ARRAY['כיתת ההתנקשות', 'فصل الاغتيال', 'Klasa skrytobójców'], 24833, NULL, 'The students of class 3-E have a mission: kill their teacher before graduation. He has already destroyed the moon, and has promised to destroy the Earth if he can not be killed within a year. But how can this class of misfits kill a tentacled monster, capable of reaching Mach 20 speed, who may be the best teacher any of them have ever had?', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20755-dWrhs569YGUO.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20755-D4ipww9U8YkC.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/vAuTJFzjNLs', 7.9, 2015, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Comedy', 'Drama', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['Lerche', 'Funimation', 'Kansai TV'], 22, 23, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:41.233083+00:00', '2026-06-01T05:16:19.854731+00:00'),
  ('c140a1a7-fe46-4a51-948b-dc39d31b15a9', 'One-Punch Man Season 2', 'One-Punch Man Season 2', 'One Punch Man 2', 'ワンパンマン 2', ARRAY['OPM2', 'Wanpanman 2', 'مرد تک مشتی', 'วันพันช์แมน ภาคที่ 2', 'One-Punch Man Phần 2', '一拳超人 第二季', 'Jagoan Sekali Pukul S2', 'ون بنش مان 2', 'رجل اللكمة الواحدة 2'], 34134, NULL, 'Saitama is a hero who only became a hero for fun. After three years of “special training,” he’s become so strong that he’s practically invincible. In fact, he’s too strong—even his mightiest opponents are taken out with a single punch. Now, the great seer Madame Shibabawa’s prediction about the Earth being doomed seems to be coming true as the frequency of monster incidents escalates. Alongside Genos, his faithful disciple, Saitama begins his official hero duties as a member of the Hero Association, while Garou, a man utterly fascinated by monsters, makes his appearance.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx97668-nC8gQrXVxt7k.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/97668-8Yo3iH2fxbKR.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/NezvLw2gRAY', 7.4, 2019, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Comedy', 'Sci-Fi', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['J.C.STAFF', 'TV Tokyo', 'Bandai Namco Arts', 'Shueisha', 'BANDAI SPIRITS', 'Good Smile Company', 'ADK Marketing Solutions', 'Viz Media', 'Magic Capsule', 'Lantis', 'JR Higashi Nihon Kikaku'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:38:11.386257+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:38:11.386257+00:00'),
  ('4e85175a-3988-46c2-acc1-174f1dbe3c16', 'Assassination Classroom Second Season', 'Assassination Classroom Second Season', 'Ansatsu Kyoushitsu 2nd Season', '暗殺教室 第２期', ARRAY['فصل الاغتيال 2', 'Klasa skrytobójców 2', 'Assassination Classroom Season 2'], 30654, NULL, 'The second season of Ansatsu Kyoushitsu.

The students return as school is back in session for the second semester. Following their exploits on the island during summer vacation, Class 3-E continues to sharpen their blades with their sights set on their teacher, the slippery Koro-sensei. They have more to worry about than just their teacher, however, as enemy assassins, both old and new, are out for the increased bounty on the octopus'' head.

Moreover, their rivals in Class A, as well as Kunugigaoka Junior High''s fearsome principal, stand to block Class E from achieving academic excellence. With all of these obstacles opposing them, the group must continue to work together in order to overcome their foes and accomplish their goal of successfully assassinating their teacher.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21170-kbcfTTZGSaFt.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21170-3sLTirZD2J4K.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/CQZR3XNqDwo', 8.3, 2016, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Comedy', 'Drama', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['Lerche'], 25, 23, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:41.22612+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:40:07.895104+00:00'),
  ('0edd934e-c71d-4880-9455-6e2ab70d9af1', 'takt op.Destiny', 'takt op.Destiny', 'takt op.Destiny', 'takt op.Destiny', ARRAY['タクトオーパス', 'แท็กต์ โอปัส. เดสตินี ~ลิขิตเสียง บรรเลงชะตา~', '宿命回响：命运节拍', 'Такт. Опус Дестини'], 48556, NULL, 'Music is the light that illuminates people''s hearts-- and that "light" was suddenly taken from the world. The world changed the night the black "Kuroya Meteorite" fell. Grotesque monsters known as D2 emerged from the meteorite and began to overrun the land and people. As the D2 were drawn to melodies people played, eventually "music" itself became taboo. 

However, those who opposed the monsters appeared. They the "Musicart," girls who draw power from music. They possess the great operas and musical scores of humanity history and use them to defeat the D2.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx131565-3W2YEX6V3K3i.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131565-JBlm0IItFlUV.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Sal5NXCPv14', 6.9, 2021, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Fantasy', 'Music'], ARRAY['Bandai Namco Arts', 'DeNA', 'MADHOUSE', 'MAPPA'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:44:01.453582+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:44:01.453582+00:00'),
  ('b93d2ac1-c66f-44b6-b45c-5be6b1377523', 'High School of the Dead', 'High School of the Dead', 'Gakuen Mokushiroku: HIGHSCHOOL OF THE DEAD', '学園黙示録HIGHSCHOOL OF THE DEAD', ARRAY['HOTD', 'HSOTD', 'High School of the Dead: Apocalipsis en el Instituto'], 8074, NULL, 'The lockers are splattered with blood, the student bodies are piling up and that''s not mystery meat they''re eating in the cafeteria… it''s the faculty! And that''s just the start of the worst day of school ever when a nightmarish virus is unleashed, turning humans into flesh eating zombies and converting Fujimi High School into a literal hell on Earth. Now it''s a crash course in survival, and the only test or skill that matters is the ability to keep moving, breathing and fighting. Because if nerds, jocks and the surviving staff can''t find a way to work together to escape this carnal house of education, they''re all going to end up on the menu. And that''s assuming there''s anyplace safe left to escape to.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx8074-YB63Ik96fjPj.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8074-g8bVkL09nkdw.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Kl6cNSBg3Wg', 6.7, 2010, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Drama', 'Ecchi', 'Horror', 'Romance', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['MADHOUSE', 'NBCUniversal Entertainment Japan', 'AT-X', 'Sentai Filmworks', 'Hakuhodo DY Music & Pictures'], 12, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:44:18.092477+00:00', '2026-06-01T07:04:52.889397+00:00'),
  ('a39c741b-918e-4e33-8236-64151720374c', 'High School of the Dead: Drifters of the Dead', 'High School of the Dead: Drifters of the Dead', 'Gakuen Mokushiroku: HIGHSCHOOL OF THE DEAD - Drifters of the Dead', '学園黙示録HIGHSCHOOL OF THE DEAD ドリフターズ・オブ・ザ・デッド', ARRAY['High School of the Dead OVA', 'HOTD', 'HSOTD'], 9515, NULL, 'When an unplanned stop on a deserted island gives Takashi, Saeko and the rest of the ragged band of survivors a chance to expose themselves to something other than zombie bites for a change, they''re more than ready to take a break and let their hair down. Discovering the remnants of an old beach store, the entire group strips to swimsuits and sets out to make the uninhabited island inhabitable, but they''re unaware that this seeming paradise is actually just the dead calm before the storm. Because sometimes the recently deceased aren''t the only problems that can lie buried in the sand, and as the swimwear comes off and the inhibitions come down, a kink in the island''s food chain sets a truly shocking series of events into motion! You won''t believe what comes out next, but suffice it to say that the deserted island may not be so deserted after all!

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)

Note: An unaired episode bundled with the seventh volume of the manga.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx9515-Bmnn8nMYyYuY.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9515-WmVIg0n7nVc4.jpg', NULL, 6.2, 2011, 'completed', 'ova', ARRAY['Comedy', 'Ecchi', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['MADHOUSE', 'Sentai Filmworks', 'Hakuhodo DY Music & Pictures'], 1, 16, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:46:19.020533+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:46:19.020533+00:00'),
  ('70f45680-b8b1-4b46-89ae-de20fddba850', 'The Seven Deadly Sins', 'The Seven Deadly Sins', 'Nanatsu no Taizai', '七つの大罪', ARRAY['七大罪', 'ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน', '7DS', 'Семь смертных грехов'], 23755, 'the-seven-deadly-sins', 'When they were accused of trying to overthrow the monarchy, the feared warriors the Seven Deadly Sins were sent into exile. Princess Elizabeth discovers the truth - the Sins were framed by the king''s guard, the Holy Knights - too late to prevent them from assassinating her father and seizing the throne!
Now the princess is on the run, seeking the Sins to help her reclaim the kingdom. But the first Sin she meets, Meliodas, is a little innkeeper with a talking pig. He doesn''t even have a real sword! Have the legends of the Sins'' strength been exaggerated?

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20789-Ma5ouSYPkru9.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20789-qwG9GcxIrmVE.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/wxcvbL6o55M', 7.3, 2014, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Ecchi', 'Fantasy', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['A-1 Pictures', 'Funimation', 'Aniplex', 'Movic', 'Dentsu', 'Mainichi Broadcasting System', 'Kodansha'], 24, 25, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:05.460456+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:57:59.975632+00:00'),
  ('8fd316a4-56a6-4ae9-88b7-51780ad90d71', 'K', 'K', 'K', 'K', ARRAY['K-Project (K-プロジェクト)', 'K -eine weitere Geschichte-'], 14467, NULL, 'Yashiro Isana has lived a relatively ordinary, simple life. He lives in the technologically advanced Shizume City and attends Ashinaka High School, a notable high school that is located on an island just outside the areas. Yashiro is friendly with everyone. Nothing seems wrong about him, except perhaps his habit of forgetting where his school-issued PDA is.

However, nothing normal has been happening since the recent murder of Tatara Totsuka, prominent member of the infamous HOMRA. No one knows who exactly killed him but the man responsible bears an uncanny, identical appearance to Yashiro. Seeking vengeance, the Red Clansmen of HOMRA set out to get Yashiro and kill him. Everyone suspects that Yashiro is the murderer.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx14467-TQjwOvq4jkYS.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/14467-jG939pd2036a.jpg', NULL, 7.1, 2012, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Mystery', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['Starchild Records', 'Viz Media', 'Mainichi Broadcasting System', 'GoHands', 'KLOCKWORX'], 13, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:44:47.839585+00:00', '2026-06-01T05:45:25.715732+00:00'),
  ('dc09d33b-392c-463c-ad57-4c397e2d5a37', 'Dragon Raja -The Blazing Dawn-', 'Dragon Raja -The Blazing Dawn-', 'Long Zu', '龙族', ARRAY['Dragon Raja', '龍族 -The Blazing Dawn-', 'Ryuuzoku: The Blazing Dawn'], 44408, NULL, 'Lu Mingfei never expected to live an extraordinary life. He was content with his average achievements and took pride in his skill in Starcraft. However, all that is upended when he suddenly receives a scholarship to study in Chicago at a place called Cassell College.
It all seems too good to be true, this can only be a scam! Little does he know, that when he does eventually accept the offer, it is but the beginning of the rest of his life, and the college''s obscurity will be the least of his concerns once they start telling him about the dragons...

Note: Episode 0 aired with a runtime of 49 minutes.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx122511-h6FpxJGfKx3I.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/122511-c2NEixtg4qHx.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/j3azzxRVU0k', 7.3, 2022, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Drama', 'Fantasy'], ARRAY['Tencent Penguin Pictures', 'GARDEN'], 17, 18, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:30:42.133948+00:00', '2026-05-31T20:35:50.475474+00:00'),
  ('566c3fb1-d6f9-4577-a3cb-61b188b857f9', 'K: RETURN OF KINGS', NULL, 'K: RETURN OF KINGS', 'K RETURN OF KINGS', ARRAY['K-Project 2'], 27991, NULL, 'In modern Japan, where history has strangely overlapped with reality. There, seven "Kings" with great superpowers existed. Along with their clansman to whom they shared their own power with, the kings each formed clans. Order bound by blue, red flames that cause chaos, irregularities that shine in white, and reforms branched off into green. The Kings, each with their own abilities, now...
With "jungle" once again jumping back into action, the fates of the various Kings are brought together.

(Source: Anime News Network, spoilers edited out)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20913-gtriPcPNUwAQ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20913-0Dt52EJfG9d1.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/lXKYCOShfAI', 7.3, 2015, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['GoHands', 'Glovision'], 13, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:44:47.87894+00:00', '2026-05-31T20:38:45.108794+00:00'),
  ('b9ed6ebb-a429-4f36-abb9-4d4134f32867', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Revival of the Commandments', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Revival of the Commandments', 'Nanatsu no Taizai: Imashime no Fukkatsu', '七つの大罪 戒めの復活', ARRAY['The Seven Deadly Sins: Die Rückkehr der Gebote', 'ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน ภาค 2 คืนชีพบัญญัติสิบประการ', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Odrodzenie przykazań', 'Семь смертных грехов: Возрождение Заповедей'], 34577, NULL, 'Melodias, Hawk, and Elizabeth retook the Kingdom of Leones from the Holy Knights. The festival went off without a hitch and the crew enjoyed their well-earned peace. And yet, another threat looms on the horizon. The Ten Commandments, a group of elite demon clan warriors, have their sights set on the kingdom.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx99539-caPX28RSsgRP.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99539-ermF56v2Gz2p.png', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/ULP_6faadB4', 7.3, 2018, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Ecchi', 'Fantasy', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['A-1 Pictures'], 24, 25, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:05.447758+00:00', '2026-05-31T21:02:25.88207+00:00'),
  ('44579192-1773-4daf-8cb5-a7dee4fc3475', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Dragon''s Judgement', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Dragon''s Judgement', 'Nanatsu no Taizai: Funnu no Shinpan', '七つの大罪 憤怒の審判', ARRAY['七大罪：愤怒的审判', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Dragens dom', 'ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน ภาค 4', 'Сім смертних гріхів: Правосуддя Дракона', 'Семь смертных грехов: Яростное правосудие'], 41491, NULL, 'Time is running out. The curse imposed on Elizabeth will kill her in few days. To lift the curse Meliodas and Ban have travelled to the Demon Realm to challenge Meliodas'' father, the Demon King.

Meanwhile, Merlin, Escanor, and Archangel Ludociel are set to slay Meliodas'' brother Zeldris. Elsewhere, Meliodas'' other brother Estarossa has kidnapped Elizabeth, and it falls to King, Diane, Gowther, and Hawk to rescue her.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx116752-yIJuKp88adqt.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/116752-P72hkhtqD76t.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/oaoViWF8P74', 6.5, 2021, 'completed', 'tv', ARRAY['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Ecchi', 'Fantasy', 'Supernatural'], ARRAY['Studio DEEN', 'Marvy Jack'], 24, 24, NULL, '2026-05-31T19:37:05.473354+00:00', '2026-06-01T04:42:23.989705+00:00');

