Akane Kurokawa is a rising star actress from the Lalalie Theatrical Company. Although a shy and quiet person, she is very serious when it comes to creating a good performance. She does a deep examination of each role she is given, allowing her to perfectly portray the character''s personality and motivations. Akane is introduced to [Aqua](https://anilist.co/character/183885) as a fellow cast member on the set of the reality dating show *The Beginning of My Love With An Idol*.', 'Manaka Iwami', '石見舞菜香', '2026-03-08T10:29:58.695322+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:35:48.633367+00:00'),
  ('9f64726b-3db3-4d2e-a4b7-1882a37da2fc', '45485dbc-0a36-47a1-9cb1-bb6936fa1e14', 'Lufas Maphaahl', 'ルファス・マファール', 'Lufasu Mafaalu, Ruphas Mafahl', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b161623-TzQnL3HussOW.jpg', 'main', '__Level:__  1000
