The strongest being who once unified Mizgarz and was feared as "The Black-Winged Overlord". Was sealed after a battle with The Seven Heroes, but was summoned back into the world 200 years later. ', 'Ami Koshimizu', '小清水亜美', '2025-12-21T10:55:37.202805+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:35:52.836291+00:00'),
  ('88bd79d8-9c92-4841-90f1-47be7678aec5', '3cb85a07-d511-4285-b384-a63727b01014', 'Tsuyoshi  Mukouda', '向田剛志', 'ムコーダ, Mukohda', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157881-uLcY9D0sFskw.png', 'main', 'A salaryman summoned from modern Japan. He possesses the unique skill, "Online Supermarket", which allows him to buy goods from modern Japan any time, any place. The food he buys with his skill has buffing effects, making anyone who eats it become much stronger than before. He is very good at cooking, but is a coward by nature.

Mukouda was first seen wearing a suit and tie, a huge difference from his co-summoned heroes which were wearing school uniforms. After selling his former clothes, he now wears a dark green shirt with long sleeves that he usually kept folded when he cooks.', 'Aaron Campbell', '内田雄馬', '2025-11-01T07:26:57.997528+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:36:09.169768+00:00'),
  ('fb2b879a-925d-4665-99be-bec87946fde4', '3ed773b5-abae-4b93-a8d2-6c6e58ed48dd', 'Enjin', 'エンジン', 'Engine', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266438-3Veykti1lXgg.png', 'main', '__Affiliation:__ Cleaners
