  ('caee4e75-5fa0-4780-b3a8-52792e4bcf9c', 'fd496044-cabc-466d-8f7b-7bd222062e35', 'Yor Forger', 'ヨル・フォージャー', 'Yor Briar (ヨル・ブライア), Thorn Princess (Ibara-hime‚ いばら姫), Yorticia, Tornprinsessa', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138102-ZOAu9jI2d5ke.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 170 cm
__Occupation:__ City Hall Clerk, Assassin (Covertly)
__Affiliation:__ Berlint City Hall, Garden (Covertly)
__Relatives:__ <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger">Loid Forger</a> (Husband), <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger">Anya Forger</a> (Adoptive Daughter), <a href="https://anilist.co/character/150425/Yuuri-Briar">Yuuri Briar</a> (Younger Brother)

Yor Forger is the tritagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. She is a clerical employee at the Berlint City Hall. She is soft-spoken and mild-mannered, but has a strong sense of humor. She has a bad drinking habit and falls into a coma when she drinks. At home, she struggles to be a good wife and a kind mother. Although her cooking skills are not very good, she likes to keep clean and is good at cleaning.
While she works in the capital of Ostania''s city hall... or at least that''s her civilian cover. In truth, she is an infamous Professional Killer known as "Thorn Princess". After becoming overly fixated on the idea her cover might be blown after a coworker ribs her about not being married or even having a boyfriend, Yor suggests to <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger">Loid</a> a Marriage of Convenience, which he accepts, as he needs a mother for <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger">Anya</a> for his own mission.

~!As of Mission (Chapter) 44, it is revealed that Yor is part of Garden, a powerful paramilitary assassin organization operating within Ostania.!~', 'Natalie Van Sistine', '早見沙織', '2025-10-25T10:59:01.28411+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:38:18.596315+00:00'),
  ('5407f913-9146-4f7b-a7c4-bf35b2f26ff1', '6f92c3e6-3f9a-4b41-8e7d-9bcfb4187c5d', 'Kazuya Kinoshita', '木ノ下和也', 'Master, Kazu-kun (かずくん)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128105-gad6JuGEXPWe.png', 'main', '__Height__: 177 cm (5''10")

A struggling university student living in Tokyo. He studies at Nerima University. Kazuya possesses a wishy-washy nature and is susceptible to yielding to his selfish desires. His lies often get him into trouble, because he cannot muster the strength to tell the truth. On the other hand, possessing a straightforward kindness that cares for those around him. He has also developed feelings for Chizuru.', 'Aleks Le', '堀江瞬', '2026-05-28T11:13:46.405791+00:00', '2026-05-28T11:13:46.405791+00:00'),
