Akane Kurokawa is a rising star actress from the Lalalie Theatrical Company. Although a shy and quiet person, she is very serious when it comes to creating a good performance. She does a deep examination of each role she is given, allowing her to perfectly portray the character''s personality and motivations. Akane is introduced to [Aqua](https://anilist.co/character/183885) as a fellow cast member on the set of the reality dating show *The Beginning of My Love With An Idol*.', 'Kristen McGuire', '石見舞菜香', '2026-03-08T10:29:55.211766+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:35:42.739702+00:00'),
