  ('a453a3d0-2407-4ea5-8df5-025601ffd2d6', '1df4e060-79c6-42ea-96a6-59c863185b69', 'Denji', 'デンジ', 'Chainsaw Man, Chainsaw Devil, Lord Chainsaw', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130102-FO1VHNnEnLlB.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 173 cm (5''8"), Devil Form - 180 cm (5''11")

Denji is Chainsaw Man''s Human Form. He became Chainsaw Man after his dead body was resurrected by his pet dog, [Pochita](https://anilist.co/character/170266/Pochita).

He is a Public Safety Devil Hunter who works under [Makima](https://anilist.co/character/137080/Makima) as a member of an experimental squad in Special Tokyo Division 4. He works alongside his partner [Power](https://anilist.co/character/137079/Power) and under the supervision of [Aki Hayakawa](https://anilist.co/character/137081/Aki-Hayakawa).

Denji''s personality is both brash and naive as a result of being unable to have a formal education and socialize due to living in severe poverty. He comes off as rude and harsh, yet in an almost childish way. He doesn''t know how to be clever or wise but he knows how to lighten the mood. As the Chainsaw Devil, he has the ability to grow chainsaws out of his body. ', 'Ryan Levy', '戸谷菊之介', '2026-05-26T05:36:35.667491+00:00', '2026-05-26T06:33:16.423095+00:00'),
  ('8b274a92-c1ea-4897-bc31-2d041742f881', 'f967f9fe-5927-4e52-91de-e461f04d5665', 'Kana Arima', '有馬かな', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188783-77orwP7vNuNg.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 150 cm (4''11")

An actress who was called a prodigy child. She has a rather stubborn personality yet an empathic side to her. She easily succumbs to pressure and while she does put up a front to others, she has very self-deprecating thoughts when it comes to her abilities. She''s an honest and earnest person, who is very diligent and persistent even in the roughest of times. Also, she tends to place all responsibility on herself when it comes to others as she is the one who has the most experience in the show business world. She also hates bell peppers.
  
~!After the events of the Sweet Today Drama adaptation, she secretly develops a crush for Aquamarine.!~

~!She longs for someone to look at her for who she is now and praise her efforts, someone to say that its okay for her to be here. And after the new B-Komachi''s first concert, that person becomes Aquamarine after he waves her respected colored glow stick. Only reinforcing Kana''s resolve to make Aquamarine fall for her.!~', 'Megumi Han', '潘めぐみ', '2026-03-08T10:29:58.357823+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:35:48.254796+00:00'),
  ('20364be6-4b90-4e2c-8f83-d2772e224a25', '1f075f7d-a0b6-4527-909b-2822584f03f8', 'Akira Himegami', '姫神アキラ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b368145-LrBLUb5UXA7b.png', 'main', 'A high school boy with excellent grades and good looks. After losing his parents at a young age, he was raised by his father''s friend''s family. He has a crush on his childhood friend and housemate, Towasa. He is seriously injured in an incident and falls unconscious. After being put into cold sleep, he wakes up in a future world.', 'Gabriel Regojo', '梅田修一朗', '2025-12-19T14:16:15.284195+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:36:20.123385+00:00'),
  ('2973633f-6dbf-446b-a184-91089d183f51', '7cff199a-b592-41c4-9159-a8738db5486c', 'Abel', 'アベル', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b353217-uVweL8tWPNSU.png', 'main', NULL, 'Kazuki Ura', '浦和希', '2025-10-23T00:47:20.155767+00:00', '2026-05-30T18:09:16.32784+00:00'),
  ('1ba5bd07-3c29-49b4-b00d-572c6f8a3c2a', '3d89f65f-f3fc-4813-9a68-c056fe8b8259', 'Armin Arlert', 'アルミン・アルレルト', 'Armin Arlelt', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46494-g7xYYuBtYPnO.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 163 cm (5''4")
__Position:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps
__Relatives:__ [Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/84313/Armin-no-Ojiisan)

Armin is a young boy who was born and raised in the Shiganshina District within the walls, being childhood friends with both [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881). After Wall Maria was breached, he chose to join Mikasa and Eren in joining the military, both to try to make a good and meaningful impact on the world, and to fulfill his dream of seeing the outside world.

Even when he was young, the naturally curious Armin has always had a deep fascination with the world beyond the Walls. As a child, he found and studied an illegal book about the outside world that was owned by his grandfather. He often shared the book and information contained in it with Eren Yeager, his best friend, and his dreams of seeing the world outside the walls. Armin was branded a heretic by other children for his unusual interest in the outside world and was thus frequently picked on. Too timid to defend himself, Armin would often rely on his friends Eren and Mikasa Ackerman to protect him from local bullies. This, coupled with his frail physique, was a deep shame for Armin, leading him to have poor self-esteem and to believe that he is a burden to others. Because of this, Armin has always been very eager to prove his worth, especially towards his close friends. 

Armin is known to be exceptionally loyal and selfless. He constantly worries for the safety of his friends, and he is always prepared to throw himself into dangerous situations to save them. Alongside his kindhearted nature and emotionally intelligence, Armin is a very analytical person. He likes to think deeply about situations and solve problems using his mind. These personality traits, in conjunction with his intelligence, good judgment, level headedness, ability to plan ahead, come up with creative ideas and to think outside the box, are what make him a great tactician. Although he may appear among the physically weakest of the 104th Training Corps, his incredible intelligence and strategic genius makes him an invaluable asset to any team.
', 'Jessie James Grelle', '井上麻里奈', '2026-05-28T15:56:41.840665+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:56:41.840665+00:00'),
  ('da3c5686-c1d4-4cba-8ada-41e4c2d66532', '4d800eff-833f-4740-87fc-2158b9617a87', 'Suruga, Shushu', NULL, NULL, 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/8/615954.jpg?s=04a0a7e078a910b73dcf59cf3b3da157', 'main', NULL, 'Simmons, Juliet', 'Hino, Mari', '2026-05-24T15:25:25.865836+00:00', '2026-05-24T15:25:25.865836+00:00'),
  ('c0cb878e-3488-4319-a802-f5b8ab1bfb81', '4180b711-2df0-4534-99ad-25679dc61bf1', 'Reg', 'レグ', 'Regu, The Treasure of the Deep', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122444-9rGUpcjwygHD.png', 'main', 'Reg is a robotic being who appears to be a little boy. His actual age, origins, and even name are unknown because he cannot recall anything about his life before his encounter with [Riko](https://anilist.co/character/122443/Riko). He is named after a dog Riko used to have. Having a seemingly artificial body, Reg might be the only being completely immune to the Curse of the Abyss. Because of this, he is sometimes referred to as "The Treasure of the Deep."

Reg’s body is extremely durable, even to the point that [Ozen the Immovable](https://anilist.co/character/122464/Ouzen) couldn’t break him even when slamming him into the floor with all her strength. Despite his high durability, Reg is agile and weighs little. His wounds heal at a faster rate than a human’s, and has a very high pain tolerance. His senses of smell and hearing are strong, one comparable to a dog. His arms can extend up to 40 meters each and can shoot them to the top of cliffs or grab things very far away. The cords attached are very durable. He is also equipped with an incinerator, which is a powerful incendiary cannon built into his hands and feet, emitting a beam of light, indicating the area to eliminate, penetrating through objects. Objects within the range of the light break apart and are absorbed into the spinning axes. The incinerator is connected to the Abyss in an unknown way, having the power to rewrite the rules of the Abyss. Reg passes out for 2 hours upon use, but it can be fired multiple times in the 10-minute deadline, and can also be set to not affect living beings.

Despite being a formidable fighter, Reg is rather shy, naive, and unassertive. He blushes easily and often cries when in distress. However, when forced into danger or an unpleasant situation, he is shown to be hot-tempered and sharp, compared to Riko''s analytic, noncombatant role. Regardless of his skittishness, Reg has made it his sworn duty to protect Riko and doesn''t hesitate to put up a fight when she is in harm''s way. According to Ozen, the way he speaks and handles his body is similar to [Lyza](https://anilist.co/character/122465/Lyza). One of his favorite words to say is "irredeemable," which was a word that Lyza often said.', 'Luci Christian', '伊瀬茉莉也', '2026-05-26T10:29:21.810315+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:03:38.379768+00:00'),
  ('770573ca-32d5-4c5d-9d01-2aa07dd1faff', 'c0e213cb-295d-4975-99a0-26b2dc68ef53', 'Ruby Hoshino', '星野ルビー', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b183884-iyo3BmTuhJ0l.jpg', 'main', '__Height:__ 158 cm (5''2")

[Ai Hoshino](https://anilist.co/character/172759/Ai-Hoshino)''s daughter, and the younger twin sister of [Aquamarine Hoshino](https://anilist.co/character/183885). 
~!She was previously a patient named Sarina under Goro''s care. Due to her illness, she was wheelchair-bound. After discovering B-Komachi, she had always aspired to be an idol although her condition kept her from achieving her dream. Since being reincarnated as Ruby, she is now working towards her dream of being an idol like Ai. To do so she''s currently working with Strawberry Productions to revive B-Komachi along with Arima Kana and Memcho.!~', 'Savanna Menzel', '伊駒ゆりえ', '2026-05-26T10:29:42.930034+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:56:34.487727+00:00'),
  ('7d70e5b3-b5e0-4810-b015-40aa0d47208e', '78c58160-3a52-40e0-9ade-717034c5347b', 'Rimuru Tempest', 'リムル・テンペスト', 'Satoru Mikami (三上悟), Slime-san, Sensei, Milord, Ruler of Monsters, King of Tempest, Rising Star, Rimu-chi, Great Phantom Thief Satoru', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123962-eL9yGV0NLMF7.png', 'main', '__Species:__  Human (past life) → Slime
__Kind:__  Reincarnated, Otherworlder

Rimuru Tempest, formerly known as Satoru Mikami, is the main protagonist of Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken. They are the founder and King of the monster country Tempest, situated in the Great Jura Forest, and the partner and sworn friend of Storm Dragon, [Veldora Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/128034/Veldora-Tempest).', 'Brittney Karbowski', '岡咲美保', '2026-05-27T16:16:42.555204+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:05:05.225839+00:00'),
  ('267a900f-95c4-4ca4-864b-7ee44e569273', '7cff199a-b592-41c4-9159-a8738db5486c', 'Sara', 'セーラ', 'Sera', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b353218-087PgAu6WPC0.png', 'main', NULL, 'Kaede Hondo', '本渡楓', '2025-10-23T00:47:20.517082+00:00', '2026-05-30T18:09:16.611833+00:00'),
  ('180ba743-b3b8-4eb8-8638-24154365662d', '82b395c5-f07f-4107-a4ef-1dd9eaf64f78', 'Bond', 'ボンド', 'Subject 8', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169679-EFPubVtZFYom.jpg', 'main', 'Bond is the recently adopted pet of the Forger Family. Formally known as Subject 8, Bond has been used for experiments that resulted in the dog gaining precognition abilities.', 'Tyler Walker', '松田健一郎', '2025-10-25T10:59:02.124706+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:38:26.75929+00:00'),
  ('42055cb2-adba-46e2-b9b9-468755fcf7ad', '1df4e060-79c6-42ea-96a6-59c863185b69', 'Reze', 'レゼ', 'Lady Reze', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b148740-ceAibPxLW8rR.png', 'main', 'Reze is a young girl who met [Denji](https://anilist.co/character/130102/Denji) in a phone cabin. She works at a local café and is a kind and gentle girl who seems to have a crush on Denji soon after meeting him. She laughs at his jokes and isn''t afraid to get close to and intimate with him.

~!‌‌‌‌‌‌‌‌She is secretly the Bomb Devil hybrid, owned by the Soviet Union and allied to the Gun Devil. Her true personality is manipulative and brutal, as she is shown killing many Devil Hunters without care or mercy. She does, however, not enjoy killing and prefers to avoid it, unless necessary for her mission. Her objective is to retrieve the Chainsaw Heart from Denji, but the feelings she developed for him quickly made things more complicated.!~  ', 'Alexis Tipton', '上田麗奈', '2026-05-26T05:36:35.988054+00:00', '2026-05-26T06:33:16.885223+00:00'),
  ('11278983-4855-4517-82af-983ef5bc40ca', 'e2dfcb41-d205-451b-93fe-3a101eafeae3', 'Eren Yeager', 'エレン・イェーガー', 'Eren Jaeger, Eren Jäger, Suicidal Maniac, Shi ni Isogi Yarou (死に急ぎ野郎)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b40882-dsj7IP943WFF.jpg', 'main', '__Initial Height__: 170 cm (5''7")
__Affiliation:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps. 

Eren was born to Carla and Grisha Yeager in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. He grew up in the town with his parents and foster sister [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881), who moved in with the Yeagers as a child. Eren spent most of his time with Mikasa and their mutual best friend [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494), whom the pair often defended from neighborhood bullies.  

Eren is a passionate, determined, hardheaded, and impulsive young man. When they were children, Armin showed him a book depicting the wonders of the outside world. Eren grew to share Armin''s curiosity of the world beyond the Walls and resolved to see it for himself. This dream inspired his admiration of the Survey Corps and his desire to join their ranks as soon as he became eligible for enrollment. 

When the Titans suddenly broke through Wall Maria into Shiganshina, Eren was forced to watch on as his mother became trapped under the rubble of their house and eaten by a titan. Forever changed from this event, Eren vows to kill every last titan.', 'Bryce Papenbrook', '梶裕貴', '2026-03-08T10:30:07.576692+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:35:57.864456+00:00'),
  ('6010b414-1ae5-4e2b-8346-633d92a45207', '1f075f7d-a0b6-4527-909b-2822584f03f8', 'Yuugure', 'ユウグレ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b368143-DZYy4GVqGiC8.png', 'main', 'An android in the future who pressures Akira into marriage. She looks exactly like Towasa. She has a wide range of weapons and high combat power that allows her to overwhelm even large numbers of opponents. She has a deep connection with Towasa, but keeps quiet about anything related to her, calling it "taboo."', 'Ginger Sue', '石川由依', '2025-12-19T14:16:15.670974+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:36:20.516505+00:00'),
  ('267e3b8d-b72c-4456-a013-46879af95f98', '0235fd16-36de-4dcf-99a6-1123a10ce2ab', 'Qifrey', 'キーフリー', 'Kieffrey', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129841-brgGFuOv1h0n.png', 'main', 'Qifrey is a witch and [Coco](https://anilist.co/character/129840/Coco)''s teacher. He runs an atelier and currently has four disciples.

He is a caring teacher who patiently teaches his students magic. This is especially true for Coco, who has no special abilities as a witch at first but he continues to encourage her until she can draw magic skillfully. He is protective of all his disciples, as seen from how he protects them from being taken by Esheath from the Magic Security Council. However, Qifrey is overly obsessed with his goal to locate the Brimmed Hats, with his gentle attitude oftentimes replaced by a buried hatred he has always hidden. It appears he had a personal agenda against the Brimmed Hats, as well.

~!The reason Qifrey has a grudge towards the Brimmed Hats is that they are responsible for taking away his memories and right eye as a child. He was later locked in a coffin, buried under a tree, and left there to die as it slowly filled with water. Thankfully, people from the Magic Security Council and Sage Beldarut found him and rescued him from his miserable condition, which later on he would become the pupil of Sage Beldarut. Qifrey also went to the Tower of Books in order to find an answer on how to solve the problem of his missing memories and right eye, but for that, he must use forbidden magic, and as such his issue remains unsolved.!~', 'Joshua Waters', '花江夏樹', '2026-05-17T19:16:49.065219+00:00', '2026-05-17T19:17:11.201469+00:00'),
  ('4e829264-21d5-43a7-a69e-5fb49ea723ae', '85983a9a-93b8-474c-a619-e2c14f4362da', 'Bond', 'ボンド', 'Subject 8', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169679-EFPubVtZFYom.jpg', 'main', 'Bond is the recently adopted pet of the Forger Family. Formally known as Subject 8, Bond has been used for experiments that resulted in the dog gaining precognition abilities.', 'Tyler Walker', '松田健一郎', '2025-10-20T07:16:21.139538+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:38:32.972234+00:00'),
  ('0f733828-188e-420d-9120-aa3d8eed3e2b', '85f69c5d-66f4-494b-8b5c-86c7cfdf28c1', 'Jin Kougasaki', '皇后崎迅', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b181340-ZWQTlkhmJsp3.png', 'main', 'A student in Shiki''s class and his roommate. His father is a Momotarou who previously attempted to kill Jin after he discovered his son was an oni, leaving Jin with scars and stitches all over his body. His father also killed his mother and sister for the same reason. As a result, Jin seeks little else but to eventually get powerful enough to kill his father, often brushing off Shiki and the others. His Blood Eclipse Release manifests as buzzsaws that pop out from his wounds.
', 'Khoi Dao', '西山宏太朗', '2025-11-01T07:09:10.260542+00:00', '2026-05-18T03:38:03.571946+00:00'),
