Rimuru Tempest, formerly known as Satoru Mikami, is the main protagonist of Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken. They are the founder and King of the monster country Tempest, situated in the Great Jura Forest, and the partner and sworn friend of Storm Dragon, [Veldora Tempest](https://anilist.co/character/128034/Veldora-Tempest).', 'Brittney Karbowski', '岡咲美保', '2026-05-27T16:16:55.98637+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:05:00.329126+00:00'),
  ('f960ba5d-3238-427f-85bc-51f5decdb4dc', 'ffb37244-ffa7-422f-8ca0-ae5b52b5e138', 'Xiaoyu Lü', '吕小鱼', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257000-eY9kheP1VYPj.png', 'main', NULL, 'Shuang Zhao', '赵爽', '2026-05-30T18:08:51.400594+00:00', '2026-05-30T18:08:51.400594+00:00'),
  ('cec545ec-4a25-484d-8498-fc0418507285', 'b6c15b73-3c08-43d4-b7e2-77e4bbb2396f', 'Hiraku Machio', '街尾火楽', 'Village Chief, Honeybun', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b293201-VoMIPmwpVgn9.jpg', 'main', '**Race:** Human

Hiraku Machio is the main protagonist of Isekai Nonbiri Nouka series. He was resurrected with a healthy body, the ability to speak the common tongue, and the All-Purpose Farming Tool (AFT) by God. Despite being unable to use magic, he cultivates the forest to create farmland and a village, with the help of the wolves Kuro and Yuki, the demon spider <a href= "https://anilist.co/character/300443/Zabuton">Zabuton</a>, and even humanoid species.', 'Blake Shepard', '阿部敦', '2026-05-26T06:35:05.546909+00:00', '2026-05-26T06:35:05.546909+00:00'),
  ('f784b405-fcbf-44cd-b91c-a328e56be46a', '1f075f7d-a0b6-4527-909b-2822584f03f8', 'Towasa Oumaki', '王真樹トワサ', '[]', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b368144-z0fGPB8AolGO.png', 'main', 'She is the only daughter of the Oumaki family, who adopted Akira. She is a genius scientist developing cutting-edge AI technology, and has attracted attention from around the world. However, because she creates such revolutionary technology, she has been subjected to extreme criticism and interference with her research from some people. She has a crush on Akira, and has been worrying about him lately.', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-19T14:16:16.093345+00:00', '2025-12-19T14:16:16.093345+00:00'),
  ('f793950c-c601-4ab6-9dd2-1b8024b7f8c0', '82b395c5-f07f-4107-a4ef-1dd9eaf64f78', 'Anya Forger', 'アーニャ・フォージャー', 'Test Subject 007, Anya Williams, Anya Levski, Anya Roche, Anya Klein, K-212, Princess Anya, Chihuahua Girl', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138100-4Li0tWRCa5bQ.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 99.5 cm (3''2")
__Occupation:__ First-Grade Student, Test Subject (Formerly)
__Affiliation:__ Eden Academy, Unknown Organization (Formerly)
__Relatives:__ <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger">Loid Forger</a> (Adoptive Father), <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138102/Yor-Forger">Yor Forger</a> (Adoptive Mother)

Anya Forger is the deuteragonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. She is a young girl who <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger">Twilight</a> finds at an orphanage. Believing her to be a smart child, he decides to adopt her for his mission. What he doesn''t know is that Anya is an esper who escaped from the Lab that gave her the power to read minds. Starving for excitement in her life after spending most of it so far in a lab, Anya actively sought to be the one adopted by Loid and then make sure <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger">Loid</a> and <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138102/Yor-Forger">Yor</a> got together, so she could have a spy and assassin for parents. Anya is the only Forger aware of just about everyone''s Secret Identities, but keeps it to herself out of fear that if her psychic powers are exposed she''ll be put in a lab again.', 'Megan Shipman', '種﨑敦美', '2025-10-25T10:59:00.886282+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:38:25.114667+00:00'),
