  ('6cdded15-c503-492b-939f-cfbbde22294e', '85f69c5d-66f4-494b-8b5c-86c7cfdf28c1', 'Naito Mudano', '無陀野無人', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b181339-wh2LH48Bw3tN.png', 'main', 'The teacher of Shiki''s class. A taciturn, strict man, he is a highly-skilled fighter respected as such by both the oni and the Momotarou. He often travels on roller skates instead of walking. His Blood Eclipse Release manifests as an umbrella.', 'Stephen Fu', '神谷浩史', '2025-11-01T07:09:10.60581+00:00', '2026-05-18T03:38:03.2757+00:00');

An actress who was called a prodigy child. She has a rather stubborn personality yet an empathic side to her. She easily succumbs to pressure and while she does put up a front to others, she has very self-deprecating thoughts when it comes to her abilities. She''s an honest and earnest person, who is very diligent and persistent even in the roughest of times. Also, she tends to place all responsibility on herself when it comes to others as she is the one who has the most experience in the show business world. She also hates bell peppers.
  
~!After the events of the Sweet Today Drama adaptation, she secretly develops a crush for [Aquamarine](https://anilist.co/character/183885/Hoshino-Aquamarine).!~

~!She longs for someone to look at her for who she is now and praise her efforts, someone to say that its okay for her to be here. And after the new B-Komachi''s first concert, that person becomes Aquamarine after he waves her respected colored glow stick. Only reinforcing Kana''s resolve to make Aquamarine fall for her.!~', 'Natalie Rial', '潘めぐみ', '2026-05-26T10:29:42.324789+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:56:34.847022+00:00'),
  ('46601454-eec8-4fde-92ce-9a313ae43bbe', '1418666b-f2d6-4005-9566-26aee59d63bc', 'Krista Lenz', 'クリスタ・レンズ', 'Christa, Cattle-Taming Goddess', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b62481-ZZDa7vn17lMU.png', 'main', '__Height__: 145 cm (4''8")
__Affiliations__: 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps

Ranked tenth in the trainee class, Krista is a very shy and kind, caring person, often being described as a "goddess" or "angel" by her peers. She is good friends with [Ymir](https://anilist.co/character/71479/Ymir).   ', 'Bryn Apprill', '三上枝織', '2026-05-28T15:56:54.149049+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:56:54.149049+00:00'),
  ('043ae304-d63f-4dac-bd66-3320aa01de25', '605a6989-fa03-4ac7-b277-864b3de7aff9', 'Kazuo Yamashita', '山下一夫', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143838-1bMajQ35FKh9.png', 'main', 'He is the CEO of the Yamashita coop.. He is a weak old man, however he is never scared to say his opinion out loud. ~!He is also known as The Kengan!~', 'Choo', 'チョー ', '2026-05-28T05:35:19.516646+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:03:04.622832+00:00'),
  ('8ac921db-4a1d-43de-a9b4-3dc1cbafa476', '68243365-8f06-4e25-bc5c-43e6d32e0d3e', 'Shiki', '識', 'Servant of the Devil, Undead King, Larva', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b247735-x7YhxlUh0Cnn.png', 'main', 'Shiki is a Lich and presently in servitude to Makoto Misumi. His origins and original name are unknown. What is easily ascertained is that he was a brilliant researcher in magic knowledge. Before his death he possibly came back as a lich or possibly, he turned himself into a lich; when and where is unknown. All that is known is that he’s been a lich for a very long time and with quite the reputation.', 'Ben Balmaceda', '津田健次郎', '2026-05-28T05:38:36.184821+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:05:31.138547+00:00'),
  ('828fbaf5-695e-4426-a8fc-00416cfe68a7', 'b6c15b73-3c08-43d4-b7e2-77e4bbb2396f', 'Loo', 'ルー', 'Loo Lulucy (ルールーシー＝ルー), Vampire Princess', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b293202-DoP0eWRKgYan.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Vampire
__Affiliation:__ Taiju Village, Kingdom of Galbart (Formerly)

Loo is a Female Vampire, who stumbles into Hiraku''s farm during his early days of living in the formidable forest of death. On the run, with no where to turn, she falls in love with <a href="https://anilist.co/character/293201/Hiraku-Machio">Hiraku</a> who by this time has not seen another person since coming to the world. She can change her body/age to suit her needs to survive. She is a skilled magician as well as a farmer who works at Hiraku''s farm. At first she viewed Hiraku''s farm (now a village) as a place she can hide from the nobles and now she views it as home. 
~!She and Hiraku had a kid named Alfred.!~', 'Luci Christian', '下地紫野', '2026-05-26T06:35:05.976609+00:00', '2026-05-26T06:35:05.976609+00:00'),
  ('d18c774a-8ba1-4255-be86-91f5aa1aa782', '82b395c5-f07f-4107-a4ef-1dd9eaf64f78', 'Loid Forger', 'ロイド・フォージャー', 'Tasogare (黄昏), Twilight, Twain Foney, Papa, Roid, Loi-Loi, Loidman, Robert, Lionel, Lawrence, Roland Spoofy, Twi-Guy, Skumring', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138101-7NCB0Md8zA6G.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 187 cm
