Loid Forger is the main protagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. He is the top spy of the Westalian Intelligence Bureau, who is only known by his code name Twilight. In order to investigate the activities of a highly ranked politician, <a href="https://anilist.co/character/180192/Donovan-Desmond">Donovan Desmond</a>, Twilight has assumed the identity of a psychiatrist named Loid Forger. Further, to appear like a normal family man and get close to his target, Loid then adopted a young orphan girl, <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger">Anya</a>, and entered a Marriage of Convenience with an Ostanian woman named <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138102/Yor-Forger">Yor Briar</a>... who unknown to Twilight are themselves a Telepath and Professional Killer respectively.', 'Alex Organ', '江口拓也', '2025-10-25T10:59:01.29011+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:38:25.490246+00:00'),
  ('cd96fc61-fdcb-4d03-adf7-6b48c270119a', '1f075f7d-a0b6-4527-909b-2822584f03f8', 'Amoru', 'アモル', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b374074-yT8UsgxpWVml.png', 'main', 'Akira and Yugure meet this girl during their journey. She is searching for a picture book that her parents once drew but that has been banned in the future world. Her dream is to become a picture book author like her parents.', 'Karlii Hoch', '富田美憂', '2025-12-19T14:16:16.462609+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:36:20.857286+00:00'),
