Yor Forger is the tritagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. She is a clerical employee at the Berlint City Hall. She is soft-spoken and mild-mannered, but has a strong sense of humor. She has a bad drinking habit and falls into a coma when she drinks. At home, she struggles to be a good wife and a kind mother. Although her cooking skills are not very good, she likes to keep clean and is good at cleaning.
While she works in the capital of Ostania''s city hall... or at least that''s her civilian cover. In truth, she is an infamous Professional Killer known as "Thorn Princess". After becoming overly fixated on the idea her cover might be blown after a coworker ribs her about not being married or even having a boyfriend, Yor suggests to <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger">Loid</a> a Marriage of Convenience, which he accepts, as he needs a mother for <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger">Anya</a> for his own mission.

~!As of Mission (Chapter) 44, it is revealed that Yor is part of Garden, a powerful paramilitary assassin organization operating within Ostania.!~', 'Natalie Van Sistine', '早見沙織', '2025-10-25T10:59:01.721921+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:38:26.096379+00:00'),
  ('0abd8759-864b-4b00-a97d-87c511359ded', '4eac21f7-c328-4f19-90fd-7f1fd6b580e3', 'Kyouka Uzen', '羽前京香', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162524-r8daVAJ32H4j.png', 'main', '__Species:__ Human
__Height:__ 167 cm (5''6")
__Peach Ability:__ Chains of Eternity, <i>"Slave"</i>
__Affiliation:__ Anti-Demon Corps (7th Unit Chief)

Kyouka is the chief of the 7th Unit of the Anti-demon Corps, an elite group of women who have received power from the Peaches. She is [Yuuki Wakura](https://anilist.co/character/170329)''s savior and becomes his master after she decided to make him her slave. She is a fierce militaristic, calm, and serious woman befitting the 7th Unit Chief. She often fights against the Shuuki more seriously than other chiefs. She cares for the people around her to the point where she will do anything to protect them. ', 'Roxanna George', '鬼頭明里', '2026-05-24T15:25:26.180369+00:00', '2026-05-24T15:25:46.750776+00:00'),
  ('9cc509b5-6d4e-49a5-9c17-510b3de888c5', 'c5c1e1da-2d3a-415a-814c-63a412fb128f', 'Yuru', 'ユル', '尤爾', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b270811-RA1UwUhCSFiF.png', 'main', 'A young man brought up in Higashi Village, surrounded by nature. Having lived as a hunter segregated from modern Japan, he became Sayuu-sama''s master after Asa''s attack.', 'Ben Stegmair', '小野賢章', '2026-05-17T19:17:16.087976+00:00', '2026-05-17T19:17:16.087976+00:00'),
  ('d1c98a10-f6ca-4bc6-bb6a-7515937bcd87', '85f69c5d-66f4-494b-8b5c-86c7cfdf28c1', 'Shiki Ichinose', '一ノ瀬四季', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174901-vsAAYYr9HU1T.png', 'main', 'Shiki is an oni whose powers manifest after an attack by the Momotarou results in the death of his adoptive father. Biologically, he is one of the eight children of Kishin and inherits the Fire elemental attribute. His Blood Eclipse Release manifests as various guns, a reflection of his past interest in them. The tremendous output of his power generates severe aftereffects, such as causing blood to rain from the sky.', 'Zeno Robinson', '浦和希', '2025-11-01T07:09:10.932827+00:00', '2026-05-18T03:38:02.978533+00:00'),
  ('fd63929c-dc5f-4b18-9047-b9ac7907fd22', '4358f771-c24f-49bb-b867-52e76a3fc437', 'Yuno', 'ユノ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123284-w6kIFYnTclMd.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7")

Yuno was left, along with Asta, in front of a church in a village called Hage when he was an infant. He grew up at the church and spends most of his day with Asta. Sometime later, a thug tries to take his necklace away from him and sell it for money. Fortunately, Asta steps in and tries to take it back. In the end, the thug decided to leave without the necklace after Asta keeps charging at him. Since then, Yuno stopped crying and decides to take Asta''s dream to be the Wizard King as his own as well.
', 'Micah Solusod', '島﨑信長', '2026-05-28T15:57:01.979581+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:01.979581+00:00'),
  ('803d191b-ac0c-466b-90ac-021b9d836f60', 'b6c15b73-3c08-43d4-b7e2-77e4bbb2396f', 'Tier', 'ティア', 'the Annhilation Angel', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b293203-InzHn5I2HjHl.png', 'main', '**Race:** Angel

Tier is one of the main characters of Isekai Nonbiri Nouka series. She is an angel with celestial magical powers and bird-like wings that allow her to fly. She is part of the Angel of Annihilation tribe, specializing in golem magic. Tier visits the forest in search of Loo, her frenemy, and ends up living there with <a href="https://anilist.co/character/293201/Hiraku-Machio">Hiraku</a> and <a href="https://anilist.co/character/293202/Loo">Loo</a>.', 'Monica Rial', '洲崎綾', '2026-05-26T06:35:06.391537+00:00', '2026-05-26T06:35:06.391537+00:00'),
  ('18173f54-4e5a-45f6-9631-c3005577db68', '3ed773b5-abae-4b93-a8d2-6c6e58ed48dd', 'Engine', 'エンジン', '["Enjin"]', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266438-3Veykti1lXgg.png', 'main', '__Affiliation:__ Cleaners
__Jinki:__ "Umbreaker"

Engine is from the Abyss and the man that saved Rudo when he fell out of the sky. He has a very bright and fun personality, but very little energy and seemingly is chill and laid-back. Despite his incredible abilities, he refers to himself as "your average janitor."

~!Jinki Ability: Umbreaker "Eigtht Tear" is an attack where Engine drops to the ground in a tear shape from a high altitude with his Jinki to cause a devastating area of effect attack.!~', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-20T07:16:20.361253+00:00', '2025-10-20T07:16:20.361253+00:00'),
  ('913e13cc-d272-40a2-9bb8-355d1b62755e', '0d24b476-7d4c-41b4-9540-37a7fcac3c8e', 'Irushia', 'イルシア', '"I", Dragon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234869-LVEOPvYW35KA.png', 'main', 'The hero of the story, who reincarnated as a dragon. They have vague memories of their past life, and hopes of making friends with the humans of this world. Their goal is to level up and evolve into a powerful dragon, both to allow them to communicate with humans, and more than that, to allow them to survive.

(Source: Official Site)', 'Shunichi Toki', '土岐隼一', '2026-03-08T10:36:56.445576+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:36:56.445576+00:00'),
  ('e3be7192-0ff6-432f-a499-e23c21cecb95', 'e2dfcb41-d205-451b-93fe-3a101eafeae3', 'Levi', 'リヴァイ', 'Levi Heichou (リヴァイ兵長), Captain Levi, Jinrui Saikyou no Heishi (人類最強の兵士), Humanity''s Strongest Soldier, Heishichou (兵士長)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b45627-CR68RyZmddGG.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3")

Squad Captain of the Special Operations Squad (known as Squad Levi) within the Survey Corps. He is known as humanity''s strongest soldier. 

Levi is abrasive, blunt, and has a strong respect for structure and discipline. He is a clean-freak, demanding spotless cleanliness of himself, his equipment, and his environment. Rumors say he was involved in underground crime in his life before coming a soldier. Despite his emotionless and unfriendly demeanor, Levi cares deeply for his squad and greatly values human life. ', 'Matthew Mercer', '神谷浩史', '2026-03-08T05:04:30.795453+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:35:59.009943+00:00'),
