Loid Forger is the main protagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. He is the top spy of the Westalian Intelligence Bureau, who is only known by his code name Twilight. In order to investigate the activities of a highly ranked politician, <a href="https://anilist.co/character/180192/Donovan-Desmond">Donovan Desmond</a>, Twilight has assumed the identity of a psychiatrist named Loid Forger. Further, to appear like a normal family man and get close to his target, Loid then adopted a young orphan girl, <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger">Anya</a>, and entered a Marriage of Convenience with an Ostanian woman named <a href="https://anilist.co/character/138102/Yor-Forger">Yor Briar</a>... who unknown to Twilight are themselves a Telepath and Professional Killer respectively.', 'Alex Organ', '江口拓也', '2025-10-20T07:16:20.748366+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:38:32.624157+00:00'),
