Rudo is the foster son of [Regto](https://anilist.co/character/266437/Regto). He was originally from the slums of the Sphere, but ended up sentenced to the Abyss after being falsely accused of murder. Due to being physically abused and abandoned by his real parents, Rudo is emotionally closed off and introverted and has permanent painful scars on his hands; having to keep them covered up by bandages and a pair of gloves Regto gifted to him to help sooth the excruciating pain. ', 'Bryson Baugus', '市川蒼', '2025-10-20T07:16:19.955909+00:00', '2026-03-08T10:36:26.029021+00:00'),
