', 'Trina Nishimura', '石川由依', '2026-05-26T11:11:38.353151+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:00.474905+00:00'),
  ('f301d6f2-8ff4-476b-b876-91a6204bb328', 'e8932035-6ac7-4694-bf57-0c8d986c9bee', 'Gabi Braun', 'ガビ・ブラウン', 'Mia (ミア)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125659-O37MZQWibV7g.png', 'main', '__Height__: 138 cm

Gabi Braun is an Eldian living in the Liberio internment zone and the cousin of [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun). She is friends with her fellow warrior candidates [Udo](https://anilist.co/character/125663), [Zofia](https://anilist.co/character/125664/Zofia), and [Falco Grice](https://anilist.co/character/125660). 

Gabi is very passionate and head-strong, expressing her emotions and opinions without inhibition. She is also brave, possessing boundless determination, and willing to put her life on the line to complete a goal for a perceived greater good. However, these attributes can also make her somewhat overbearing and domineering. This causes her to be tactless at times, forcing her opinions on others and taking charge regardless of whether it was asked for or not. She mostly shows this side around her fellow Warrior candidates, considering herself their de facto leader to an extent, and even threatening to ''punish'' them when they disagree with her. Nonetheless, she is friendly enough that they have no issue with spending their leisure time with her. Aside from her resolve and determination, Gabi is care-free even on the battlefield, making remarks about her cuteness and claiming her commander loves her too much to sacrifice her.

~!She is a Warrior candidate that is likely to inherit the Armored Titan.!~ 
', 'Lindsay Seidel', '佐倉綾音', '2026-05-28T15:57:01.432749+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:01.432749+00:00'),
  ('f9239080-1e54-4a3b-9794-9a8af740faf0', 'e8932035-6ac7-4694-bf57-0c8d986c9bee', 'Zeke', 'ジーク', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125661-FiqFvAtNlL0v.png', 'main', '__Height__: 183 cm

Zeke is the current inheritor of the Beast Titan, and is considered by [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun) to be the strongest Warrior, contrasting [Levi''s](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) title of "humanity''s strongest soldier".', 'Jason Liebrecht', '子安武人', '2026-05-28T15:57:02.016596+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:02.016596+00:00'),
  ('9d447d81-804c-468e-9ae1-62b39bd00a44', '8cf6fcab-05fe-411f-9d31-3a2df77fe282', 'Eren Yeager', 'エレン・イェーガー', 'Eren Jaeger, Eren Jäger, Suicidal Maniac, Shi ni Isogi Yarou (死に急ぎ野郎)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b40882-dsj7IP943WFF.jpg', 'main', '__Height__: 170 cm (5''7") - 183 cm (6''0")
__Affiliation:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps. 

Eren was born to Carla and Grisha Yeager in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. He grew up in the town with his parents and foster sister [Mikasa](https://anilist.co/character/40881), who moved in with the Yeagers as a child. Eren spent most of his time with Mikasa and their mutual best friend [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494), whom the pair often defended from neighborhood bullies.  

Eren is a passionate, determined, hardheaded, and impulsive young man. When they were children, Armin showed him a book depicting the wonders of the outside world. Eren grew to share Armin''s curiosity of the world beyond the Walls and resolved to see it for himself. This dream inspired his admiration of the Survey Corps and his desire to join their ranks as soon as he became eligible for enrollment. 

When the Titans suddenly broke through Wall Maria into Shiganshina, Eren was forced to watch on as his mother became trapped under the rubble of their house and eaten by a titan. Forever changed from this event, Eren vows to kill every last titan.', 'Bryce Papenbrook', '梶裕貴', '2026-05-26T10:29:10.992935+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:13.176959+00:00'),
  ('deb5500c-fdf3-45a9-b88d-d114c431d192', '8cf6fcab-05fe-411f-9d31-3a2df77fe282', 'Zeke', 'ジーク', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125661-FiqFvAtNlL0v.png', 'main', '__Height__: 183 cm

Zeke is the current inheritor of the Beast Titan, and is considered by [Reiner Braun](https://anilist.co/character/46484/Reiner-Braun) to be the strongest Warrior, contrasting [Levi''s](https://anilist.co/character/45627/Levi) title of "humanity''s strongest soldier".', 'Jason Liebrecht', '子安武人', '2026-05-28T15:57:15.003502+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:15.003502+00:00'),
  ('7d40c3c2-fb56-4fc9-99c3-2d1020315cb7', 'e8932035-6ac7-4694-bf57-0c8d986c9bee', 'Falco Grice', 'ファルコ・グライス', 'Ben (ベン)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125660-mrmpOJLjJIkv.jpg', 'main', '__Height__: 140 cm
__Position__: Warrior Candidate

Falco Grice is an Eldian Warrior candidate working for the Marley government and is the younger brother of [Colt Grice](https://anilist.co/character/125665/Colt-Grice). Falco is close friends with his fellow warrior candidates; [Udo](https://anilist.co/character/125663/Udo), [Zofia](https://anilist.co/character/125664/Zofia), and [Gabi](https://anilist.co/character/125659/Gabi-Braun).

While not as physically strong as his fellow soldiers, he makes up for it with his quick wit and improvisation. He is a very merciful and compassionate person, going out of his way to protect and save other people lives, even enemy soldiers. He is also very polite and respectful towards others, and is an empathetic person, being willing to hear people out and properly understand things from their points of view.

~!He is a candidate to inherit the power of the Armored Titan. He has the desire to become the Armored Titan in order to prevent Gabi Braun from inheriting it, as he has a crush on her and wants them to live a long life.!~', 'Bryson Baugus', '花江夏樹', '2026-05-28T15:57:01.718023+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:01.718023+00:00'),
  ('b427fbde-6622-450a-bcca-97191ca09642', '8cf6fcab-05fe-411f-9d31-3a2df77fe282', 'Gabi Braun', 'ガビ・ブラウン', 'Mia (ミア)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125659-O37MZQWibV7g.png', 'main', '__Height__: 138 cm

