  ('f05c2a89-df15-44de-801e-951cc848cd93', 'fed6441f-9808-40ef-b72c-db0dcfd6d77c', 'Mikasa Ackerman', 'ミカサ・アッカーマン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b40881-F3gr1PkreDvj.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7") - 176 cm (5''9½")
__Position:__ 104th Training Corps, Survey Corps
__Relatives:__ [Birth Mother](https://anilist.co/character/84341/Mikasa-no-Haha) (Deceased), [Birth Father](https://anilist.co/character/84339/Mikasa-no-Chichi) (Deceased), [Grisha Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62477/Grisha-Yeager) (Foster Father), [Carla Yaeger](https://anilist.co/character/62475/Carla-Yeager) (Foster Mother, Deceased), [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) (Foster Brother)

Mikasa is Eren Yaeger''s foster sister and mutual childhood friend of [Armin Arlert](https://anilist.co/character/46494), living with the two of them in Shiganshina District within the southern region of Wall Maria. 

When she was young, her parents were killed by human traffickers, and she was kidnapped. Eren discovered this and helped her escape her captors. Later, Eren gave her his scarf, which she constantly wears and shares an emotional attachment to. She was adopted by the Yaeger family soon after. Because of these past events, Mikasa shares an unbreakable bond with Eren and lives to protect him, constantly worrying for Eren''s well-being. After the Titans broke through Wall Maria and killed her and Eren''s mother, she chose to follow Eren into the military to try and keep him safe from danger. 

Even as a child, Mikasa possessed impressive fighting skill and strength, and that skill was only honed further during her training.  Mikasa is considered a genius among all the army trainees and is incredibly skilled at combat and agility, to the point that she was known as the greatest soldier among the 104th Training Corps and graduated in first place. Though being among the best of the best, she remains humble and refrains from displaying arrogance. Ultimately, Mikasa''s loyalty remains with Eren no matter the circumstance, with her only true desire being to live a peaceful life with him.
', 'Trina Nishimura', '石川由依', '2026-05-28T15:57:06.922604+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:06.922604+00:00'),
  ('15e1a71a-4c4c-42e8-8018-0b383b8df16e', '8cf6fcab-05fe-411f-9d31-3a2df77fe282', 'Armin Arlert', 'アルミン・アルレルト', 'Armin Arlelt', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46494-g7xYYuBtYPnO.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 163 cm (5''4")
__Position:__ 104th Trainees Squad, Survey Corps
__Relatives:__ [Grandfather](https://anilist.co/character/84313/Armin-no-Ojiisan)

Armin is a young boy who was born and raised in the Shiganshina District within the walls, being childhood friends with both [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager) and [Mikasa Ackerman](https://anilist.co/character/40881). After Wall Maria was breached, he chose to join Mikasa and Eren in joining the military, both to try to make a good and meaningful impact on the world, and to fulfill his dream of seeing the outside world.

Even when he was young, the naturally curious Armin has always had a deep fascination with the world beyond the Walls. As a child, he found and studied an illegal book about the outside world that was owned by his grandfather. He often shared the book and information contained in it with Eren Yeager, his best friend, and his dreams of seeing the world outside the walls. Armin was branded a heretic by other children for his unusual interest in the outside world and was thus frequently picked on. Too timid to defend himself, Armin would often rely on his friends Eren and Mikasa Ackerman to protect him from local bullies. This, coupled with his frail physique, was a deep shame for Armin, leading him to have poor self-esteem and to believe that he is a burden to others. Because of this, Armin has always been very eager to prove his worth, especially towards his close friends. 

Armin is known to be exceptionally loyal and selfless. He constantly worries for the safety of his friends, and he is always prepared to throw himself into dangerous situations to save them. Alongside his kindhearted nature and emotionally intelligence, Armin is a very analytical person. He likes to think deeply about situations and solve problems using his mind. These personality traits, in conjunction with his intelligence, good judgment, level headedness, ability to plan ahead, come up with creative ideas and to think outside the box, are what make him a great tactician. Although he may appear among the physically weakest of the 104th Training Corps, his incredible intelligence and strategic genius makes him an invaluable asset to any team.
', 'Jessie James Grelle', '井上麻里奈', '2026-05-26T10:29:10.66761+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:13.997461+00:00'),
  ('880262e2-7ce9-4b8d-ba43-39d8831c0a1c', '8cf6fcab-05fe-411f-9d31-3a2df77fe282', 'Jean Kirstein', 'ジャン・キルシュタイン', 'Jean Kirschtein, Jeanie, Horse Face', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46498-ritqAj9FW6jX.png', 'main', '__Height__: 175 cm (5''8")
__Relatives__: [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/131444/Jean-no-Haha)

Jean Kirschtein is a graduate of the 104th Cadet Corps, among whom he ranked 6th for his skills with ODM gear and ability to look at things through a more tactical lense. Jean hails from Wall Rose''s Trost District, and joined the military with hopes of living a peaceful life within the walls as part of the Military Police. However, he would later find himself joining the Survey Corps after being convinced both by his close friend [Marco Bott''s](https://anilist.co/character/62479/Marco-Bott) words, and after witnessing the death of several of his comrades.

Jean has a blunt personality. He holds no restraint when it comes to speaking his mind, even when he knows it would not be wise to do so or when it could spark conflict. Jean is also pragmatic: he has a strong aversion to exposing himself to dangerous situations. During his time as a cadet, Jean was extremely hot-headed, easily becoming frustrated and quick to resort to violence when pushed. Jean was also very cynical about defeating the Titans, believing that humanity has no chance against them and openly mocking more idealistic individuals like [Eren Yeager](https://anilist.co/character/40882/Eren-Yeager), and saw resisting the Titans as a hopeless cause. However, despite these things, and although he presents himself as self-centered, Jean places high value on the lives of his comrades, and is willing to risk his life to prevent countless more deaths from his comrades. Even with his shortcomings, Jean has shown himself to be a natural leader, being able to understand others and assess situations well because of his flaws, and proves capable of leading his fellow soldiers when they are left confused and without a plan. 

', 'Mike McFarland', '谷山紀章', '2026-05-28T15:57:15.921077+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:15.921077+00:00'),
  ('643c38a1-e3cd-435f-bac4-91c9612fbdff', '8cf6fcab-05fe-411f-9d31-3a2df77fe282', 'Connie Springer', 'コニー・スプリンガー', 'Conny', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n46486-izhPjzut6WCZ.png', 'main', '__Height__: 158 cm (5''2")  
__Relatives:__ [Mother](https://anilist.co/character/137287/Conny-no-Haha), Martin Springer (Brother), Sunny Springer (Sister)

Connie Springer is a graduate of the 104th Training Corps, having ranked 8th in class. He is known to be one of the quickest soldiers while using ODM gear and is skilled at making very sharp turns. He hails from the rural Ragako Village within Wall Rose, his greatest ambition being to make his family and village proud of him. Upon graduation, he chose to join the Survey Corps. 

Upbeat and naive, Connie is rather unfocused outside of combat, and enjoys goofing around and messing with his friends, but can also be a bit dense at times, as he can have some difficulty comprehending new developments as they appear. Connie always tries to remain optimistic, consistently caring for the well-being of his friends, family and village, and being willing to help in any way he can. However, this soft spot and the struggles he goes through as a member of the Survey Corps takes a toll on him, as he often responds to grief and loss with anger, irritation and hatred, causing him to at times make rash, impulsive decisions. He will do anything to protect his family, whether it be his biological family or his closest friends.', 'Clifford Chapin', '下野紘', '2026-05-28T15:57:15.616492+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:15.616492+00:00'),
  ('623f5ef2-da35-43eb-be2f-71d23ee13c58', 'd53b251b-eb4a-4fe0-9beb-f051cd13e4fb', 'Asta', 'アスタ', 'Bakasta', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123285-tKijiuQErDS0.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 155 cm (5''1")

An orphan who was left under the care of a church in the village of Hage. He dreams of becoming ​the Wizard King but is unable to use magic, so he trains to build up his physical strength. He is the wielder of a five-leaf clover anti-magic grimoire and is a 3rd Class Junior Magic Knight of the Clover Kingdom''s Black Bull and Royal Knights squads.', 'Dallas Reid', '梶原岳人', '2026-05-28T15:57:37.873376+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:37.873376+00:00'),
  ('74ff326d-8026-4e4f-9edb-c69e69cd2e81', 'd53b251b-eb4a-4fe0-9beb-f051cd13e4fb', 'Noelle Silva', 'ノエル・シルヴァ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123283-7nJHtKha0LSm.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 161 cm (5''3")

Noelle Silva is a member of the Black Bulls and was inducted into the squad around the same time as [Asta](https://anilist.co/character/123285). She is the second daughter of one of the Clover Kingdom''s royal families, House Silva, and the younger sister of the captain of the Silver Eagles, [Nozel Silva](https://anilist.co/character/124442). She likes sweets.

~!Her family disowned her due to her lack of control on her magic and having [their mother](https://anilist.co/character/124972) die while giving birth to her.!~', 'Jill Harris', '優木かな', '2026-05-28T15:57:38.177419+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:38.177419+00:00'),
  ('ea58d879-332a-4472-bc50-e7e1e2877000', 'd53b251b-eb4a-4fe0-9beb-f051cd13e4fb', 'Yuno', 'ユノ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123284-w6kIFYnTclMd.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''7")

Yuno was left, along with Asta, in front of a church in a village called Hage when he was an infant. He grew up at the church and spends most of his day with Asta. Sometime later, a thug tries to take his necklace away from him and sell it for money. Fortunately, Asta steps in and tries to take it back. In the end, the thug decided to leave without the necklace after Asta keeps charging at him. Since then, Yuno stopped crying and decides to take Asta''s dream to be the Wizard King as his own as well.
', 'Micah Solusod', '島﨑信長', '2026-05-28T15:57:38.498513+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:57:38.498513+00:00'),
  ('da0cfaab-6ea2-4104-830b-2b38bfde8773', 'db4b1751-5835-4eeb-ae70-4f4fb2ba5a66', 'Baki Hanma', '範馬刃牙', 'Champion, Chijō Saikyō no Gaki, 22067', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b10498-Ep1aY2liGmIA.png', 'main', 'Baki Hanma (範馬 刃牙, Hanma Baki) is the main character and protagonist of the Baki the Grappler franchise. He is the son of Yujiro Hanma and Emi Akezawa. ~!Baki is also the half-brother of Jack Hanma.!~

~!The main character, and son of Yujiro Hanma. He has been training in martial arts since the age of three, and has trained under various teachers and coaches throughout his life. At the age of thirteen, he decided to take his training into his own hands and left the coaches to perform more intense training in his father''s footsteps. He later meets with his father and becomes disillusioned as to his father''s true character, and afterwards, aims to defeat and kill him. His fighting style is called "Total Fighting" and includes techniques from many different martial arts. He fights Arudi Regan in round 1, Zool in round 2, Igari Kanji in round 3, and Retsu Kaioh in round 4 before facing his brother in round 5 which are the finals of the tournament. He eventually develops the ogre/demon face on his back when fighting his brother, but manages to suppress it. Unlike Yujiro, he chooses to control his killing intent and fight his battles fair and honorably no matter what the outcome.Many of Baki''s unusual training methods often earn him the admiration of many of the fighters of the underground arena for example Shadowboxing, or visualizing fighting an opponent, is a big part of Baki''s regimen sometimes his visions take an almost corporeal form and given he can easily remember and replicate any technique he sees this gives him a huge edge over his opponents as he can fight them and learn their weakness before actually fighting them. Baki has encounters with all the escaped convicts in the "Search of Our Strongest Hero" series, has just defeated Biscuit Oliva, and is now faced with a new challenge against the prehistoric man Pickle. He is currently waiting for his fight with Pickle after Retsu and Katsumi are defeated. He had a shadow boxing visualization fight with a T-Rex prior to the Katsumi/Pickle fight. He has been recently defeated by Pickle in the Korakuen area.!~

~!During Chapter 312 of Hanma Baki, Baki makes Yujiro forfeit his title of the "Strongest Creature Alive" after making him concede in their fight!~', 'Troy Baker', '島﨑信長', '2026-05-28T05:34:36.232259+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:58:57.448371+00:00'),
  ('a206e6ff-bb0b-46b8-b555-0d7c0e986c4f', '1edd3a36-c7f7-454c-9d52-06cf47d06172', 'Baki Hanma', '範馬刃牙', 'Champion, Chijō Saikyō no Gaki, 22067', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b10498-Ep1aY2liGmIA.png', 'main', 'Baki Hanma (範馬 刃牙, Hanma Baki) is the main character and protagonist of the Baki the Grappler franchise. He is the son of Yujiro Hanma and Emi Akezawa. ~!Baki is also the half-brother of Jack Hanma.!~

