  ('2c6ac87a-0a42-49a2-8015-16e844fa7201', '3b195c0f-88cb-4af9-92eb-21812329e793', 'Marcille Donato', 'マルシル・ドナトー', 'Marushiru', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127292-MAWgxbS0Cbrs.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3")

Marcille is mage who is part of [Laios](https://anilist.co/character/126818/Thorden-Laios)'' party. She is an elf from the Northern Continent.

~!She is actually half-elf and half tall-man. Her mother is an elf, and father was a tall-man who passed away when Marcille was young.!~

Marcille is kind, intelligent, principled, and loyal to her friends. However, she can also be very high-strung and has a difficult time dealing with things far outside her comfort zone (such as eating monsters). She has a lot of confidence in her magic ability due to her background, and can feel lonely when she''s unable to help the party. She was one of the best students at the Magic Academy, where she joined the research program specializing in dungeon-making; this is where she met [Falin](https://anilist.co/character/130508/Thorden-Falin), and is still her closest friend to this day. Marcille can also be a bit naive at times, believing that friendships alone can keep a party together.', 'Emily Rudd', '千本木彩花', '2026-05-28T15:59:49.980377+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:59:49.980377+00:00'),
  ('93554e15-842d-4b48-923c-a86a3999d18a', '4d0f8dc4-ffd1-4455-be8b-aa86760e94bb', 'Nezuko Kamado', '竈門禰豆子', '竈門禰?豆子, 카마도 네즈코', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127518-NRlq1CQ1v1ro.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 153 cm (5''0")

Transformed into a demon and left mute, Nezuko travels with her older brother [Tanjirou](https://anilist.co/character/126071) in a box on his back. She can change her size at will, and is a capable fighter when she needs to be, but has never killed or eaten any humans. Instead of gaining nourishment from humans, it seems that she recovers her energy by sleeping for long periods of times.

~!Eventually, it is discovered that Nezuko is not hurt by sunlight. At that time, she also has begun to be able to speak a little bit.!~

~!She later fully turns back into a human during the Infinity Castle arc.!~', 'Abby Trott', '鬼頭明里', '2026-05-28T15:59:57.09422+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:59:57.09422+00:00'),
  ('66fa7102-f342-44bb-8bbb-a28d1db8c460', '54a715e2-848e-41ae-b9b2-2c46c28a9b02', 'Inosuke Hashibira', '嘴平伊之助', 'Svinosuke, Inoko, The Boar, 하시비라 이노스케', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n129130-SJC0Kn1DU39E.jpg', 'main', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''4")
__Combat Style:__ Beast Breathing

Inosuke is usually seen wearing a grey boar mask, with a shirtless version of the Demon hunter uniform. Without the mask he has messy shoulder length black hair and large green eyes with long eyelashes. He is described as having a girly looking face which greatly contrasts with his muscular body.

Inosuke is extremely short-tempered and proud, and makes a big deal out of fighting opponents stronger than him claiming that''s his only hobby. He is a sore loser and is always trying to compete with Tanjiro and provoke him into fighting him, and usually failing. Due to growing up in the mountains by himself Inosuke has trouble interacting with others and only cares about himself most of the time. Though he''s often seen with 2 swords in hand, Inosuke is left-handed.', 'Bryce Papenbrook', '松岡禎丞', '2026-05-26T10:37:09.028775+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:01:50.025451+00:00'),
  ('8f17944c-a925-4483-bb2c-61c38dc36eae', 'bb26384b-8bf1-4e17-b723-8a6955235f05', 'Megumi Fushiguro', '伏黒恵', 'Sea Urchin Head', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126635-L0y3I92JSUkN.png', 'main', '__Species:__ Human
__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9")
__Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student
__Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High
__Grade:__ Grade 2 Sorcerer
__Cursed Technique:__ 10 Shadows

Megumi is the deuteragonist of the Jujutsu Kaisen series. He is a first-year student at Jujutsu High and also a descendant of the Zenin Family.

While outwardly stoic and calculating, Megumi wishes to help protect people he sees as good or kind. He believes that the world is unfair and that a Sorcerer is a tool to ensure kind people are given more chances to live. Claiming it to be his selfish and irrational desire, he does not see himself as a hero for doing this.', 'Robbie Daymond', '内田雄馬', '2026-05-26T10:34:28.80861+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:02:27.456038+00:00'),
  ('df160dc9-f681-44a1-96a8-c13d3d34bf30', 'c51c3312-5044-4507-8410-49ae8f17fde8', 'Megumi Fushiguro', '伏黒恵', 'Sea Urchin Head', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126635-L0y3I92JSUkN.png', 'main', '__Species:__ Human
__Height:__ 175 cm (5''9")
__Occupation:__ Sorcerer, Student
__Affiliation:__ Jujutsu High
