The main protagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen prequel series [Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical School](https://anilist.co/manga/105469/Tokyo-Toritsu-Jujutsu-Kodo-Senmon-Gakko). He was initially a Special Grade Cursed Victim haunted by his late childhood friend, [Rika Orimoto](https://anilist.co/character/208533/Orimoto-Rika). [Satoru Gojou](https://anilist.co/character/127691/Satoru-Gojou) mentored Yuuta and enrolled him at Tokyo Jujutsu High.', 'Kayleigh McKee', '緒方恵美', '2026-05-28T16:02:21.910747+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:02:21.910747+00:00'),
  ('bf23fd41-9001-4a11-b1c2-8be7a257e6d4', 'bb26384b-8bf1-4e17-b723-8a6955235f05', 'Satoru Gojou', '五条悟', 'Satoru Gojo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127691-9zqh1xpIubn7.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 190 cm (6''3")
__Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Teacher
__Affiliation:__ Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical College, Gojou Family
__Grade:__ Special Grade Sorcerer
