A beautiful girl who sits next to [Ayanokouji](https://anilist.co/character/123212/Ayanokouji-Kiyotaka). She is the opposite of Ayanokouji when it comes to friendship; she disregards it and thinks of making friends unnecessary, thus she does not communicate much with her classmates. She is not convinced that she was placed in the D class, therefore she aims to get promoted to the A class.
', 'Felecia Angelle', '鬼頭明里', '2026-05-28T15:59:28.461633+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:59:28.461633+00:00'),
  ('df7ed6b8-09b6-4dbe-a04c-00c25326d434', '3b195c0f-88cb-4af9-92eb-21812329e793', 'Senshi', 'センシ', 'Sen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127689-SC65fBVrUx8v.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 140 cm (4''7")

Senshi is a member of Laios'' party. He is a dwarf from the Eastern Continent.

Having spent 10 years studying monster cuisine and living a self-sufficient life inside the dungeon, Senshi loves cooking and is more than happy to share his knowledge and skills. He is dependable and strong, but can also be rather stubborn and set in his ways. He helps maintain the natural environment and ecology of the dungeon, and considers  himself part of it. He dislikes magic and treats it with a great deal of gravity and caution.', 'Seong-Won Cho', '中博史', '2026-05-28T15:59:50.556007+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:59:50.556007+00:00'),
  ('ed04ccdf-3030-47dc-b7c3-dd7aaec34d48', '4d0f8dc4-ffd1-4455-be8b-aa86760e94bb', 'Inosuke Hashibira', '嘴平伊之助', 'Svinosuke, Inoko, The Boar, 하시비라 이노스케', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n129130-SJC0Kn1DU39E.jpg', 'main', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''4")
__Combat Style:__ Beast Breathing

Inosuke is usually seen wearing a grey boar mask, with a shirtless version of the Demon hunter uniform. Without the mask he has messy shoulder length black hair and large green eyes with long eyelashes. He is described as having a girly looking face which greatly contrasts with his muscular body.

Inosuke is extremely short-tempered and proud, and makes a big deal out of fighting opponents stronger than him claiming that''s his only hobby. He is a sore loser and is always trying to compete with Tanjiro and provoke him into fighting him, and usually failing. Due to growing up in the mountains by himself Inosuke has trouble interacting with others and only cares about himself most of the time. Though he''s often seen with 2 swords in hand, Inosuke is left-handed.', 'Bryce Papenbrook', '松岡禎丞', '2026-05-28T15:59:57.430718+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:59:57.430718+00:00'),
  ('dafa10b2-6158-4f70-8ed2-a50a3eeb461f', '54a715e2-848e-41ae-b9b2-2c46c28a9b02', 'Zenitsu Agatsuma', '我妻善逸', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129131-FZrQ7lSlxmEr.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 164 cm (5''4")
