Zenitsu Agatsuma is one of the main protagonists of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba and along with [Inosuke Hashibira](https://anilist.co/character/129130/Inosuke-Hashibira), a traveling companion of [Tanjiro Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Tanjirou-Kamado) and [Nezuko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/127518/Nezuko-Kamado).', 'Aleks Le', '下野紘', '2026-05-26T10:37:08.731742+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:01:50.483307+00:00'),
  ('4e3e4337-46fe-4314-b8e8-782514fd2fd3', '1d8525b1-15fb-4b90-bccb-ac964ef332ea', 'Tanjirou Kamado', '竈門炭治郎', 'Gonpachiro Kamaboko, Monjiro, Santaro, Kentaro, Soichiro, Ponjiro, Gengo Shakariki, Tontaro Itadaki, Kanjiro Anago, Tangoro Hamado, Jangoro Amado, 카마도 탄지로', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126071-BTNEc1nRIv68.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5")
__Combat Style:__ Water Breathing & ~!Sun Breathing!~

Tanjirou is kind by nature and has been described by others as having very gentle eyes. He has a great deal of determination and will not give up once he has a goal to achieve, an example being finding a cure for [Nezuko](https://anilist.co/character/127518). Even though he is relatively strong on his own, he isn''t opposed to asking others for help when he needs it. He is very protective of his friends and even more so of his younger sister. His biggest attribute is his ability to empathize with anyone, even demons.

~!Eventually, he discovers that he is a legendary Sun Breathing user.!~', 'Zach Aguilar', '花江夏樹', '2026-05-28T16:02:01.861745+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:02:01.861745+00:00'),
  ('c7fa8d60-aeac-4c3f-b554-b8c3281f9161', 'bb26384b-8bf1-4e17-b723-8a6955235f05', 'Nobara Kugisaki', '釘崎野薔薇', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133700-f6sOO3TcgLV6.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 160 cm (5''3")
__Occupation:__ Jujutsu Sorcerer, Student
