Zenitsu Agatsuma is one of the main protagonists of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba and along with [Inosuke Hashibira](https://anilist.co/character/129130/Inosuke-Hashibira), a traveling companion of [Tanjiro Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/126071/Tanjirou-Kamado) and [Nezuko Kamado](https://anilist.co/character/127518/Nezuko-Kamado).', 'Aleks Le', '下野紘', '2026-05-28T16:01:43.47135+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:01:43.47135+00:00'),
  ('9c71dbf2-d397-4f2b-a7cc-ec71e617e224', '20faac60-26c4-4e48-b54e-afa819bbaea9', 'Tanjirou Kamado', '竈門炭治郎', 'Gonpachiro Kamaboko, Monjiro, Santaro, Kentaro, Soichiro, Ponjiro, Gengo Shakariki, Tontaro Itadaki, Kanjiro Anago, Tangoro Hamado, Jangoro Amado, 카마도 탄지로', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126071-BTNEc1nRIv68.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 165 cm (5''5")
__Combat Style:__ Water Breathing & ~!Sun Breathing!~

Tanjirou is kind by nature and has been described by others as having very gentle eyes. He has a great deal of determination and will not give up once he has a goal to achieve, an example being finding a cure for [Nezuko](https://anilist.co/character/127518). Even though he is relatively strong on his own, he isn''t opposed to asking others for help when he needs it. He is very protective of his friends and even more so of his younger sister. His biggest attribute is his ability to empathize with anyone, even demons.

~!Eventually, he discovers that he is a legendary Sun Breathing user.!~', 'Natsuki Hanae', '花江夏樹', '2026-05-26T10:37:05.691056+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:01:56.182781+00:00'),
  ('239c2715-8de1-4e97-8581-81c42e932609', 'f788247d-5295-44ef-a3f8-a51d3ca1a69d', 'Sakura Yamauchi', '山内桜良', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127118-XEvgt4yHSkQv.jpg', 'main', 'A high school student who suffers a pancreatic disease, having her lifespan cut in half. She has a diary called "Living with Dying" where she writes about her daily experiences, since her illness was first diagnosed. 

Despite her situation, she keeps her smile and even makes jokes about it.

~!She was later stabbed after being discharged from the hospital and sadly passed away.!~', 'Erika Harlacher', 'Lynn', '2026-05-28T16:02:10.483679+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:02:10.483679+00:00'),
  ('05c48900-57aa-49a8-8fab-a4a99682d95c', '1b0a6e0f-9f04-441f-b187-9032283f1303', 'Kaguya Shinomiya', '四宮かぐや', 'Muscle Queen, Auntie, Princess, Demon, Mistress Kaguya, Vice President', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120649-NPaWaIpWy60E.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 158 cm

The vice president of the student council of Shuchiin Academy, member of the wealthy Shinomiya family, she is a multi-talented genius who can do anything if she sets her mind to it. Due to the way she was raised, she instinctively looks down on others and thinks of ways to use them for her own benefit. Kaguya rarely interacted with other people before she joined the student council, but that has begun to change. She is an incredibly sheltered girl, resulting in her lacking in several pieces of what might be considered common sense. She still doesn’t understand love very well, and her main objective is to make [Miyuki Shirogane](https://anilist.co/character/121101) fall in love and confess to her.

Later in the series: ~!She confesses her love to Miyuki Shirogane and they start dating.!~

 ~!In a Oshi no Ko special chapter, it was revealed that she married Miyuki and changed her surname to Kaguya Shirogane!~', 'Aoi Koga', '古賀葵', '2026-05-28T16:02:39.970729+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:02:39.970729+00:00'),
  ('90fc66fb-86da-4d16-a38d-a0cc55188a08', '8a488687-c23e-4db4-9e00-3838d8d76060', 'Yuu Ishigami', '石上優', 'Captain, Treasurer Ishigami, Yu-kun, Yu-chin', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121102-tiQFxnSEIAwm.png', 'main', 'The treasurer of the student council of the Shuchiin Academy. He''s extremely valued by [Miyuki](https://anilist.co/character/121101), given that he single-handedly manages all the school''s funds. He''s also terrified of [Kaguya](https://anilist.co/character/120649), though no one else is sure why that is. Yuu keeps to himself and rarely speaks up, often getting into trouble when he does. He has a depressed outlook on life while having an inferiority complex. In contrast to his attitude, he is willing to help those in need and will sacrifice his pride if need be. Unlike his high school self, he had a much different outlook and demeanor during middle school.

Later in the series: 
~!Ishigami develops a crush on Tsubame that he inadvertently confesses his feelings for her at the school''s cultural festival. Ishigami does not realize that his actions were perceived as a confession by the rest of the student body and is therefore oblivious to the implications of having given Tsubame a heart-shaped gift (considered akin to a confession in Shuchiin tradition). After some convincing by Kaguya, Tsubame decides to seriously consider Ishigami''s confession, with her original intention being to let him down as gently as possible. It isn''t until Ishigami watches Tsubame''s performance of the traditional play that gave rise to the aforementioned tradition that he realizes his actions had unintended meaning. Even then, Ishigami''s thickheaded nature prevented him from recognizing the full meaning of his actions: a straight confession!~

~!On the day of the third years'' graduation ceremony, Tsubame finally has an answer for Ishigami''s proposal. Despite Ishigami doing his best to convince Tsubame to accept him, Tsubame ultimately rejects Ishigami. Tsubame promises Ishigami that the two of them will remain friends and Ishigami sees her off with a smile and a gift of flowers. Afterwards, Ishigami breaks into tears, finally learning what heartbreak is like.!~', 'Austin Tindle', '鈴木崚汰', '2026-05-28T16:02:47.868817+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:02:47.868817+00:00'),
  ('920b4756-486f-4669-b21d-b0d56fdf2f57', '2ab6a9fc-55d4-455f-adf5-7eb6bf7bd85c', 'Honami Ichinose', '一之瀬帆波', 'Class Rep Ichinose', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123216-N9tQZf2XIKu6.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 159 cm (5''2")

If there was one sentence to describe Honami, it would be that she is genuinely kind-hearted, benevolent, and a pacifist to the core who is against using underhanded means and violence. One of her main traits is her unselfish and supportive personality, combined with her excellent social skills and her being naturally people-oriented. Honami is also a charismatic and energetic person, and extends her sweet and benign character even to those of the lower classes, unlike many other upper-class students.
', 'Kristi Rothrock', '東山奈央', '2026-05-28T15:59:39.055904+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:59:39.055904+00:00'),
  ('8d903e37-dcda-4bc4-b958-d09275a3f685', '3b195c0f-88cb-4af9-92eb-21812329e793', 'Laios Thorden', 'ライオス・トーデン', 'Laius, Laios Touden', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126818-vWeIwxSERSHd.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 185 cm (6''1")

Laios is the leader of his party and Falin''s older brother. He is a tall-man from the Northern Continent.

Laios is a monster fanatic and a strong fighter. His deep knowledge and passion for monsters helps him to excel in combat and dungeon exploration. However, social skills are where he often falters; he struggles to pick up social cues, resulting in a lack of awareness and tact. This has caused him a lot of trouble throughout his life, a shortcoming that he is painfully aware of and insecure about. Despite this, Laios is extremely kindhearted, accepting, and friendly.', 'Damien Haas', '熊谷健太郎', '2026-05-28T15:59:49.668193+00:00', '2026-05-28T15:59:49.668193+00:00'),
  ('daa39448-b6ea-46b9-ba8b-064144a78df9', '26bdbb4a-bf21-4cb1-b512-7fb29a89f0c8', 'Inosuke Hashibira', '嘴平伊之助', 'Svinosuke, Inoko, The Boar, 하시비라 이노스케', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n129130-SJC0Kn1DU39E.jpg', 'main', '**Height:** 164 cm (5''4")
