  ('4a975141-84ab-4055-9a49-cf99db379f60', 'ed05f752-ad27-4ad2-a1c1-227539658346', 'Bishamon', '毘沙門', 'Vaisravana, Veena, Bisha, Bishamonten', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88239-aiUFUPNjmAh7.jpg', 'main', '__Race:__ God
__Occupation:__ Goddess of Fortune and Goddess of War

Bishamon is one of the Seven Gods of Fortune and also officially a Goddess of War and Warriors. She is intent on keeping order among the gods. Due to her past with [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato), she is bent on vengeance and decided to destroy anything he held dear to himself. 

Despite being a goddess, Bishamon is shown to be quite generous towards her Shinki. She willingly accepts any wandering and troubled spirit, useful or not, and adds them to her family. Due to her failure in the past involving Shinki, Bishamon decides to be more distant from them, depicting herself as a fierce goddess and making sure that they are not worried about her, which only resulted to them being more insecure and lonely.

In the anime, Bishamon''s hair is depicted as blonde, as opposed of the silver hair in the manga.', 'Elizabeth Maxwell', '沢城みゆき', '2026-05-27T17:33:55.997023+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:03:58.105996+00:00'),
  ('b6570bf2-5698-4439-845c-5a462cbb09ea', '7aaada85-8b09-4e49-9639-9477cd7e9e3b', 'Naoki Azuma', '東直樹', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266371-8ytjDeW2vHba.jpg', 'main', ' He is the class representative and has an older brother named Junya.', 'Ciarán Strange', '永瀬アンナ', '2026-05-28T16:04:33.381276+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:04:33.381276+00:00'),
  ('a39f8eb6-a1be-462b-ade7-b798cb095714', 'ed05f752-ad27-4ad2-a1c1-227539658346', 'Hiyori Iki', '壱岐ひより', 'Hiyorin', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b84679-GdMxvYy36M9H.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Hanyou (Half Phantom, Half Human)
__Height:__ 162,5 cm (~5''4")

Hiyori Iki is a Half-Phantom who can leave her human body, being like this since she "saved" [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677/Yato) from an incoming bus. Despite being raised to be completely lady-like in a rich household, Hiyori is a huge martial arts fan and has a fixation on a martial artist called Touno, whom she adores and copies her attacks from. She often becomes inspired and acts on his words.

Hiyori is a very pure, kind-hearted, and brave girl who will go out of her way to help someone in danger, even strangers, regardless of the severe consequences, including suffering from blight. She has a strong moral compass and is not above calling people out if she feels their actions are wrong. Hiyori is also extremely perceptive of those around her, but despite that she can be a bit air-headed too. 

She also has a strong liking to Yato''s smell and even called it her favorite smell on one occasion, but she becomes rather embarrassed by how much she likes it and dodges the subject whenever it is brought up. ', 'Bryn Apprill', '内田真礼', '2026-05-27T17:33:56.275602+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:03:57.492797+00:00'),
  ('78d60a8c-11bb-474d-807b-0816e54b865f', 'ed05f752-ad27-4ad2-a1c1-227539658346', 'Yukine', '雪音', 'Sekki, Yukki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b84681-vFMPNxeDkoqt.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Shinki
__Height:__ 147 cm (4''10")

While wandering about as a spirit, Yukine was picked up by [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677) and made into a Shinki. When called "Sekki" he transforms into a katana.

~!He died at a young age, making him miss his normal life as a middle schooler. He acts like his age, and was once stealing money from people with the excuse that it''s okay since he''s dead. After being "saved" by [Hiyori](https://anilist.co/character/84679/Iki-Hiyori), he becomes more obedient and respects Yato and Hiyori. When he was alive he had trouble with his father as seen by Yato when he first obtains Yukine.!~

In a katana form, he finds Yato''s sweaty hands so disgusting that he calls him "Drippy."', 'Micah Solusod', '梶裕貴', '2026-05-27T17:33:57.156491+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:03:57.798709+00:00'),
  ('905e4cf4-95ba-4d9b-833b-f8c775ad0d56', 'ed05f752-ad27-4ad2-a1c1-227539658346', 'Kazuma', '兆麻', 'Chouki (兆器)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88240-Q1aOkqfeFQpV.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Shinki

Kazuma is a calm, serious, and sensible person. He is one of [Bishamon''s](https://anilist.co/character/88239/Bishamon) Shinki and cares about her deeply. When he is called by his shinki name, "Chouki", Kazuma transforms into a cherry blossom-shaped earring with the ability to navigate and track others. 
~!He is a Blessed Regalia.!~', 'Eric Vale', '福山潤', '2026-05-27T17:33:56.566306+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:03:58.445243+00:00'),
