  ('3ff7e461-5a74-4ca0-8c0a-c5ce81520abf', '638eb16b-aeb0-4c34-9dc1-b6660361224f', 'Xiaoyu Lü', '吕小鱼', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257000-eY9kheP1VYPj.png', 'main', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-30T18:08:56.015451+00:00', '2026-05-30T18:08:56.015451+00:00'),
  ('63437a61-b714-4ddf-85e9-3685be707096', '9d643c5d-1539-4964-8a12-7ee311c4771f', 'Yukine', '雪音', 'Sekki, Yukki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b84681-vFMPNxeDkoqt.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Shinki
__Height:__ 147 cm (4''10")

While wandering about as a spirit, Yukine was picked up by [Yato](https://anilist.co/character/84677) and made into a Shinki. When called "Sekki" he transforms into a katana.

~!He died at a young age, making him miss his normal life as a middle schooler. He acts like his age, and was once stealing money from people with the excuse that it''s okay since he''s dead. After being "saved" by [Hiyori](https://anilist.co/character/84679/Iki-Hiyori), he becomes more obedient and respects Yato and Hiyori. When he was alive he had trouble with his father as seen by Yato when he first obtains Yukine.!~

In a katana form, he finds Yato''s sweaty hands so disgusting that he calls him "Drippy."', 'Yuuki Kaji', '梶裕貴', '2026-05-28T16:04:09.408676+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:04:09.408676+00:00'),
  ('4e830d33-dfa3-49ad-8057-38834c0ccd31', '7827aec1-541e-499c-a941-dcdc4993b3c3', 'Kaoruko Waguri', '和栗薫子', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268676-aQmqvqj0DNoJ.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 148 cm

An ace student at Kikyo Private Academy. Kaoruko is incredibly intelligent and kind, but often acts airheaded as well. She greatly enjoys eating sweets, meeting [Rintaro](https://anilist.co/character/268677/Rintarou-Tsumugi) in his family''s cake shop and quickly befriending him. Despite later learning that he attends Chidori High—a school at bitter odds with her own—she continues to be close with him.

~!Later, Rintaro confesses to Kaoruko and shortly after she returns his feelings, revealing that she has had feelings for him for much longer than what Rintaro remembers as their initial meeting.!~', 'Bijou Vann', '井上ほの花', '2026-05-28T16:05:10.780378+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:05:10.780378+00:00'),
