  ('58bfc527-8a77-4a2f-9609-3baebe854d2f', '68243365-8f06-4e25-bc5c-43e6d32e0d3e', 'Mio', '澪', 'Black Calamity', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138139-RyExQ4tdSsLG.png', 'main', 'She is previously referred to​ as the Black Spider of Calamity and is a unique existence in the Goddess'' World. She is presently in servitude of [Makoto](https://anilist.co/character/138137/Misumi-Makoto). She can be single-minded and straightforward in her loyalty to Makoto to the point that it reaches a dangerous level. She has no qualms about destroying anyone who intends to do harm to Makoto. ', 'Kara Edwards', '鬼頭明里', '2026-05-28T05:38:35.585216+00:00', '2026-05-28T16:05:30.802799+00:00'),
