  ('8c9282f1-5110-424b-a873-b13043be10cc', '914add98-7408-4566-8c5b-60d90bc668bc', 'Frieren', 'フリーレン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b176754-PCnpqIOkjhFk.png', 'main', 'Frieren is the protagonist of _Sousou no Frieren_ and [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965)''s master. She was the Mage of the Hero Party and traveled alongside Hero [Himmel](https://anilist.co/character/184311/Himmel), Warrior [Eisen](https://anilist.co/character/184312/Eisen), and Priest [Heiter](https://anilist.co/character/184310/Heiter) in a 10-year journey to defeat the Demon King. 

She was a magic prodigy at a young age, with an impressive quantity of mana, which caught the interest of [Flamme](https://anilist.co/character/219733/Flamme), a human wizard who taught her everything there is to know about magic and mana control until she passed away. Frieren persists in collecting magic knowledge no matter how trivial it may be.', 'Mallorie Rodak', '種﨑敦美', '2026-05-29T18:27:19.251098+00:00', '2026-05-29T18:27:19.251098+00:00'),
  ('01ccbdfb-9fbd-4ec4-a0ab-a7d123c1861c', '914add98-7408-4566-8c5b-60d90bc668bc', 'Fern', 'フェルン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b183965-uGFohBjlFoTp.png', 'main', 'Fern is the young mage apprentice of [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) and accompanies her as a member of her party. She is an orphaned war refugee originally from the Southern Lands, later adopted by  [Heiter](https://anilist.co/character/184310/Heiter) and placed under Frieren''s care.', 'Jill Harris', '市ノ瀬加那', '2026-05-29T18:27:19.544703+00:00', '2026-05-29T18:27:19.544703+00:00'),
  ('e3f61d89-6e8c-43b7-ac9d-b9bd4cecf02a', '7ff0c7a5-3309-4e6a-9b13-7ad257d4756e', 'Momon', 'モモン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/79455.jpg', 'main', 'Momon was a stuffed animal who Eclair sewed, but the Phoenix Stone power''s gave him life, after this he always stays with Eclair.', 'Tiffany Grant', 'かないみか', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.940344+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.940344+00:00'),
  ('6db4199f-4ad3-4f6a-93f1-158b2e4407d5', '914add98-7408-4566-8c5b-60d90bc668bc', 'Stark', 'シュタルク', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b184313-CQl6GSt4RSny.jpg', 'main', 'Stark is a warrior who fights alongside [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) and [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965/Fern). After his village was attacked by demons, he fled and became [Eisen](https://anilist.co/character/184312/Eisen)''s apprentice. At Eisen''s instruction, he joined Frieren''s party as their vanguard.', 'Jordan Dash Cruz', '小林千晃', '2026-05-29T18:27:19.854235+00:00', '2026-05-29T18:27:19.854235+00:00'),
  ('1edea50d-4bfa-411c-aec8-6055e1b6c791', '544fc60e-dd35-4054-8f06-8af76efb3738', 'Frieren', 'フリーレン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b176754-PCnpqIOkjhFk.png', 'main', 'Frieren is the protagonist of _Sousou no Frieren_ and [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965)''s master. She was the Mage of the Hero Party and traveled alongside Hero [Himmel](https://anilist.co/character/184311/Himmel), Warrior [Eisen](https://anilist.co/character/184312/Eisen), and Priest [Heiter](https://anilist.co/character/184310/Heiter) in a 10-year journey to defeat the Demon King. 

She was a magic prodigy at a young age, with an impressive quantity of mana, which caught the interest of [Flamme](https://anilist.co/character/219733/Flamme), a human wizard who taught her everything there is to know about magic and mana control until she passed away. Frieren persists in collecting magic knowledge no matter how trivial it may be.', 'Mallorie Rodak', '種﨑敦美', '2026-05-29T18:27:25.59779+00:00', '2026-05-29T18:27:25.59779+00:00'),
  ('9e97df83-750f-4150-84e2-7d21c482a63a', '544fc60e-dd35-4054-8f06-8af76efb3738', 'Stark', 'シュタルク', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b184313-CQl6GSt4RSny.jpg', 'main', 'Stark is a warrior who fights alongside [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) and [Fern](https://anilist.co/character/183965/Fern). After his village was attacked by demons, he fled and became [Eisen](https://anilist.co/character/184312/Eisen)''s apprentice. At Eisen''s instruction, he joined Frieren''s party as their vanguard.', 'Jordan Dash Cruz', '小林千晃', '2026-05-29T18:27:26.215513+00:00', '2026-05-29T18:27:26.215513+00:00'),
  ('77b66b09-72d9-4183-a3fb-aa6a848df4ff', '544fc60e-dd35-4054-8f06-8af76efb3738', 'Fern', 'フェルン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b183965-uGFohBjlFoTp.png', 'main', 'Fern is the young mage apprentice of [Frieren](https://anilist.co/character/176754/Frieren) and accompanies her as a member of her party. She is an orphaned war refugee originally from the Southern Lands, later adopted by  [Heiter](https://anilist.co/character/184310/Heiter) and placed under Frieren''s care.', 'Jill Harris', '市ノ瀬加那', '2026-05-29T18:27:25.918941+00:00', '2026-05-29T18:27:25.918941+00:00'),
  ('9ab8783b-340b-4b26-8dbb-6dd30e58afe7', '76e46c3a-de33-4a1b-923a-38a7c6e76697', 'Natsu Dragneel', 'ナツ・ドラグニル', 'Salamander (サラマンダー), Dragon Slayer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5187-y1OEdRu9sPN2.png', 'main', 'A mage from the Fairy Tail Guild who wields fire dragon slayer magic.

Natsu has a carefree and reckless nature and, despite his constant brawls with the other members of the guild, is a fiercely loyal and protective friend. He has a particularly close and competitive relationship with [Gray Fullbuster](https://anilist.co/character/4839/Fullbuster-Gray) and [Erza Scarlet](https://anilist.co/character/5189/Scarlet-Erza). With the former, he has had a constant rivalry from a young age and although they often denounce each other as not being friends, they regularly watch each others'' back even when they are enraged with one another. He has had the same sort of relationship with Erza - the two both being scared of her since a young age - and they seemed to have a fairly good relationship in the past as, according to Erza, they used to shower together. He befriends people rather quickly too, considering [Lucy](https://anilist.co/character/5186/Heartfilia-Lucy) a friend and willing to team up with her only after a few days of knowing her.

[Igneel](https://anilist.co/character/40157/Igneel), a dragon, found him in the forest and ended up taking care of him. He taught Natsu how to speak, read, and use magic. But one day Igneel disappeared without a trace. Because of this, Natsu''s goal in life is to find him. 

~!Natsu is also among the five Dragon Slayers sent to the future from four hundred years past, having an additional purpose in the assistance of the defeat of [Acnologia](https://anilist.co/character/49003/Acnologia).!~

~!He is the younger brother of [Zeref Dragneel](https://anilist.co/character/37720/Zeref), having originally died 400 years ago, being subsequently revived as his brother''s most powerful Etherious: E.N.D.!~', 'Todd Haberkorn', '柿原徹也', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.223891+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.223891+00:00'),
  ('c6f6197e-01f6-43d0-910d-b5c1bf0a4090', '76e46c3a-de33-4a1b-923a-38a7c6e76697', 'Sonya', 'ソーニャ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b229702-1yvCNMwS8MXv.png', 'main', 'Sonya is in Animus'' entourage. She has blue eyes and light brown hair. When she was little, Sonya got close to death but Animus saved her. The dragon bestowed upon her dragon slaying magic. He had the ability to take over her body.', 'Aoi Yuuki', '悠木碧', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.536196+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.536196+00:00'),
  ('7fa6206c-e388-41c5-9ded-1521a9469039', '7ff0c7a5-3309-4e6a-9b13-7ad257d4756e', 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'ルーシィ・ハートフィリア', 'Luigi, Lu-chan, Blondie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5186-izgXf2S86K9u.png', 'main', 'A mage from the Fairy Tail guild who wields Celestial Spirit magic.

Lucy is cheerful, clever, and often gets swept along by her disruptive guildmates when they go overboard. Empathetic, caring, and more likely to write novels than wage battles, Lucy becomes most emboldened to challenge enemies when she needs to fight for her friends. She is said to be a noisy and somewhat fussy person, and there are times when she can be naive and too easily forgiving, greedy for validation as well as overly confident at inopportune moments. However, despite any failings and instances of self-doubt, she doesn''t allow herself to feel down for too long - her optimism is boundless.

In July of Earth Land year X784, Lucy is a normal 17-year-old Fioran who wishes to join the infamous mage guild, Fairy Tail - although they have a reputation for being thoroughly destructive, she admires their strength and numbers. After a fateful meeting with two members of the guild in the town of Hargeon, [Natsu Dragneel](https://anilist.co/character/5187/Dragneel-Natsu) and his flying blue cat, [Happy](https://anilist.co/character/5188/Happy), she travels with them back to Fairy Tail, located in Magnolia, to begin the adventure of a lifetime.

~!Lucy''s surname is quickly revealed to be quite significant, for it distinguishes her as a member of the Heartfilia family, who head a powerful and wealthy organization called the Heartfilia Konzern. The Heartfilia''s connection to Celestial Sprit Magic becomes a key point later on.!~', 'Cherami Leigh', '平野綾', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.732801+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.732801+00:00'),
  ('bab09bb1-6a7e-439d-8093-6c24af7083fc', '06fee875-fbf5-4880-a536-4ce89ea5f4ca', 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'ルーシィ・ハートフィリア', 'Luigi, Lu-chan, Blondie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5186-izgXf2S86K9u.png', 'main', 'A mage from the Fairy Tail guild who wields Celestial Spirit magic.

Lucy is cheerful, clever, and often gets swept along by her disruptive guildmates when they go overboard. Empathetic, caring, and more likely to write novels than wage battles, Lucy becomes most emboldened to challenge enemies when she needs to fight for her friends. She is said to be a noisy and somewhat fussy person, and there are times when she can be naive and too easily forgiving, greedy for validation as well as overly confident at inopportune moments. However, despite any failings and instances of self-doubt, she doesn''t allow herself to feel down for too long - her optimism is boundless.

In July of Earth Land year X784, Lucy is a normal 17-year-old Fioran who wishes to join the infamous mage guild, Fairy Tail - although they have a reputation for being thoroughly destructive, she admires their strength and numbers. After a fateful meeting with two members of the guild in the town of Hargeon, [Natsu Dragneel](https://anilist.co/character/5187/Dragneel-Natsu) and his flying blue cat, [Happy](https://anilist.co/character/5188/Happy), she travels with them back to Fairy Tail, located in Magnolia, to begin the adventure of a lifetime.

~!Lucy''s surname is quickly revealed to be quite significant, for it distinguishes her as a member of the Heartfilia family, who head a powerful and wealthy organization called the Heartfilia Konzern. The Heartfilia''s connection to Celestial Sprit Magic becomes a key point later on.!~', 'Cherami Leigh', '平野綾', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.743247+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.743247+00:00'),
  ('5d3e2bc6-1f46-4eb2-91f3-683a77b9463a', '76e46c3a-de33-4a1b-923a-38a7c6e76697', 'Gray Fullbuster', 'グレイ・フルバスター', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4839-p2SBgjdTxHxk.png', 'main', '__Occupation:__ Mage 
__Affiliation:__ Fairy Tail Guild 
__Team:__ Team Natsu 
__Magic:__ Ice-Make, Ice Magic, ~!Ice Devil Slayer Magic!~

Gray Fullbuster is a member of the Fairy Tail guild. He is an 18 year-old ice mage, practicing ice alchemy, the art of molding ice. Due to his training history, he is most comfortable in little clothing and often forgets to wear clothes or quickly takes it off, thus often being accused of being an exhibitionist. He and [Natsu](https://anilist.co/character/5187) have a friendly rivalry, and can often be seen fighting one another. [Lucy](https://anilist.co/character/5186) believes the nature of his magic is the reason that he and Natsu constantly bicker. His member stamp is on the right side of his chest.   

~!Gray''s adeptness and strength as an ice mage is quickly shown in the story. During the Lullaby of Death arc, he teams with Natsu and [Erza](https://anilist.co/character/5189) to defeat the demon awakened from the evil spirit from the Lullaby of Death. Members of the League praise his quickness at molding ice. Later in the story, he defeats [Juvia](https://anilist.co/character/9719), one of the Elemental Four of Phantom Lord. This victory may have been partly influenced by Juvia''s liking to Gray. Juvia comments on Gray''s skill, shocked that he was able to freeze both her boiling water and the rain. After Phantom Lord''s defeat, Juvia secretly spies on Gray, bringing a packed lunch for Gray while he and the guild are rebuilding the headquarters.!~  

In certain panels, Gray''s necklaces looks quite similar to the Rave Stone which is a crucial part of another one of [Mashima](https://anilist.co/staff/96882)''s stories, "Rave Master." Mashima has stated he doesn''t remember the name. He takes off his clothes because [Ul](https://anilist.co/character/8293) made him do it as one of her teachings and now it''s a force of habit.', 'Newton Pittman', '中村悠一', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.113081+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.113081+00:00'),
  ('89bb40a7-2739-4936-b468-64810b524e4e', '76e46c3a-de33-4a1b-923a-38a7c6e76697', 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'ルーシィ・ハートフィリア', 'Luigi, Lu-chan, Blondie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5186-izgXf2S86K9u.png', 'main', 'A mage from the Fairy Tail guild who wields Celestial Spirit magic.

Lucy is cheerful, clever, and often gets swept along by her disruptive guildmates when they go overboard. Empathetic, caring, and more likely to write novels than wage battles, Lucy becomes most emboldened to challenge enemies when she needs to fight for her friends. She is said to be a noisy and somewhat fussy person, and there are times when she can be naive and too easily forgiving, greedy for validation as well as overly confident at inopportune moments. However, despite any failings and instances of self-doubt, she doesn''t allow herself to feel down for too long - her optimism is boundless.

In July of Earth Land year X784, Lucy is a normal 17-year-old Fioran who wishes to join the infamous mage guild, Fairy Tail - although they have a reputation for being thoroughly destructive, she admires their strength and numbers. After a fateful meeting with two members of the guild in the town of Hargeon, [Natsu Dragneel](https://anilist.co/character/5187/Dragneel-Natsu) and his flying blue cat, [Happy](https://anilist.co/character/5188/Happy), she travels with them back to Fairy Tail, located in Magnolia, to begin the adventure of a lifetime.

~!Lucy''s surname is quickly revealed to be quite significant, for it distinguishes her as a member of the Heartfilia family, who head a powerful and wealthy organization called the Heartfilia Konzern. The Heartfilia''s connection to Celestial Sprit Magic becomes a key point later on.!~', 'Cherami Leigh', '平野綾', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.828779+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.828779+00:00'),
  ('10e1de0b-4c52-4a5a-8835-f6d13f523cf4', '742e0c8d-ad3f-41ce-ad81-9643ac782471', 'Lucy Heartfilia', 'ルーシィ・ハートフィリア', 'Luigi, Lu-chan, Blondie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5186-izgXf2S86K9u.png', 'main', 'A mage from the Fairy Tail guild who wields Celestial Spirit magic.

Lucy is cheerful, clever, and often gets swept along by her disruptive guildmates when they go overboard. Empathetic, caring, and more likely to write novels than wage battles, Lucy becomes most emboldened to challenge enemies when she needs to fight for her friends. She is said to be a noisy and somewhat fussy person, and there are times when she can be naive and too easily forgiving, greedy for validation as well as overly confident at inopportune moments. However, despite any failings and instances of self-doubt, she doesn''t allow herself to feel down for too long - her optimism is boundless.

In July of Earth Land year X784, Lucy is a normal 17-year-old Fioran who wishes to join the infamous mage guild, Fairy Tail - although they have a reputation for being thoroughly destructive, she admires their strength and numbers. After a fateful meeting with two members of the guild in the town of Hargeon, [Natsu Dragneel](https://anilist.co/character/5187/Dragneel-Natsu) and his flying blue cat, [Happy](https://anilist.co/character/5188/Happy), she travels with them back to Fairy Tail, located in Magnolia, to begin the adventure of a lifetime.

~!Lucy''s surname is quickly revealed to be quite significant, for it distinguishes her as a member of the Heartfilia family, who head a powerful and wealthy organization called the Heartfilia Konzern. The Heartfilia''s connection to Celestial Sprit Magic becomes a key point later on.!~', 'Cherami Leigh', '平野綾', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.905236+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:02.905236+00:00'),
  ('dbca4a37-95cb-4620-bdfd-05bf53931596', '7ff0c7a5-3309-4e6a-9b13-7ad257d4756e', 'Erza Scarlet', 'エルザ・スカーレツト', 'Titania, Elsa, Elsa Scarlett', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5189-GR1xdok9SFsN.jpg', 'main', 'An S-class mage from the Fairy Tail Guild who uses requip magic, which allows her to summon weapons and equip armor stored in another dimension. She is the strongest active female member.

Erza is a very strict, intimidating, and impatient person with a strong sense of justice. She has been a member of Fairy Tail since she was a kid, and shows great loyalty and dedication to [Makarov](https://anilist.co/character/5333) and the guild.

~!Erza used to be a nameless child slave where she was forced to help build a tower called the R-system. Over time Erza made friends with other slaves, one of them being a boy her age named [Jellal](https://anilist.co/character/22751), who gave her the name "Scarlet" because of the color of her hair. She was eventually able to break free and escape-- this was also the time when her magic awakened.

After she escaped, she sought to find Fairy Tail, which she had heard about from a fellow slave named [Rob](https://anilist.co/character/56775) who cared for her like a grandpa.!~

~!She has an artificial eye, given to her by [Porlyusica](https://anilist.co/character/31192), used to replace her right eye which had become blind due to an injury.!~', 'Colleen Clinkenbeard', '大原さやか', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.024058+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.024058+00:00'),
  ('344e7c10-a2d8-4172-a44c-246aa2cb60e3', '76e46c3a-de33-4a1b-923a-38a7c6e76697', 'Wendy Marvell', 'ウェンディマベル', 'Sky Sorceress, Sky Goddess, Sky Dragon Slayer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b28886-unO1rEi3zdyF.jpg', 'main', 'Wendy is the sky dragon slayer. She has the ability to heal and manipulate air.', 'Brittney Karbowski', '佐藤聡美', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.396877+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.396877+00:00'),
  ('6d4664db-2a40-43a9-9589-c870155a7306', '742e0c8d-ad3f-41ce-ad81-9643ac782471', 'Gray Fullbuster', 'グレイ・フルバスター', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4839-p2SBgjdTxHxk.png', 'main', '__Occupation:__ Mage 
__Affiliation:__ Fairy Tail Guild 
__Team:__ Team Natsu 
__Magic:__ Ice-Make, Ice Magic, ~!Ice Devil Slayer Magic!~

Gray Fullbuster is a member of the Fairy Tail guild. He is an 18 year-old ice mage, practicing ice alchemy, the art of molding ice. Due to his training history, he is most comfortable in little clothing and often forgets to wear clothes or quickly takes it off, thus often being accused of being an exhibitionist. He and [Natsu](https://anilist.co/character/5187) have a friendly rivalry, and can often be seen fighting one another. [Lucy](https://anilist.co/character/5186) believes the nature of his magic is the reason that he and Natsu constantly bicker. His member stamp is on the right side of his chest.   

~!Gray''s adeptness and strength as an ice mage is quickly shown in the story. During the Lullaby of Death arc, he teams with Natsu and [Erza](https://anilist.co/character/5189) to defeat the demon awakened from the evil spirit from the Lullaby of Death. Members of the League praise his quickness at molding ice. Later in the story, he defeats [Juvia](https://anilist.co/character/9719), one of the Elemental Four of Phantom Lord. This victory may have been partly influenced by Juvia''s liking to Gray. Juvia comments on Gray''s skill, shocked that he was able to freeze both her boiling water and the rain. After Phantom Lord''s defeat, Juvia secretly spies on Gray, bringing a packed lunch for Gray while he and the guild are rebuilding the headquarters.!~  

In certain panels, Gray''s necklaces looks quite similar to the Rave Stone which is a crucial part of another one of [Mashima](https://anilist.co/staff/96882)''s stories, "Rave Master." Mashima has stated he doesn''t remember the name. He takes off his clothes because [Ul](https://anilist.co/character/8293) made him do it as one of her teachings and now it''s a force of habit.', 'Ryan Reynolds', '中村悠一', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.796951+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.796951+00:00'),
  ('4b4e0d24-70ac-4f6a-94e2-2aae83d5fc8e', '76e46c3a-de33-4a1b-923a-38a7c6e76697', 'Happy', 'ハッピー', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5188-1jTaic3aJ7Ds.jpg', 'main', 'Happy is a cat with some magical power, which may be the reason for his ability to speak. He can temporarily grow wings on his back and fly, and is capable of carrying only one person in this form. Happy apparently can fly at incredible speed (As it took Eligor less than a hour to reach Clover when Happy caught up with him in mere seconds with Natsu in tow) This is also the only kind of transportation that does not make Natsu sick. When asked why, Natsu got angry and exclaimed that Happy was a friend, not a means of transportation, ironically Natsu later gets sick when Gray gives him a piggyback ride when he''s injured. He''s very close to Natsu and becomes friends with Lucy quickly. The three form a team at the start of the manga. Happy is a full-fledged member of Fairy Tail, and has a member stamp on his back. It''s also unknown if Happy even though being a mage and a member of Fairy Tail, can use his magic offensively or not.  Happy has a very cheerful nature. Even when facing danger, he maintains a smile. Along with Lucy, he is one of the saner members of Fairy Tail and often acts as the mediator between Natsu and Gray.  Happy''s original name was going to be named Freyr, after a Norse god. But Hiro Mashima felt it didn''t fit him, so he change the name to Happy to fit the character.   ~!Happy is actually a magical creature that comes from Edolas. These creatures are called Exceed, and are sent to Earthland to kill the Dragon Slayers. When their mission was changed to "kidnap the Dragon Slayers", Happy''s memory got erased. Later it was revealed that this was not the case but that they were sent there to try to save their lives from a future foreseen by the queen of the Exceed. The "mission" was a misunderstanding by Charle who has the same ability as the queen and did not understand what her visions meant.!~', 'Tia Ballard', '釘宮理恵', '2026-05-29T19:00:04.019193+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:04.019193+00:00'),
  ('ee589b0b-0dcf-4368-abee-18f57fbf46c3', '06fee875-fbf5-4880-a536-4ce89ea5f4ca', 'Wendy Marvell', 'ウェンディマベル', 'Sky Sorceress, Sky Goddess, Sky Dragon Slayer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b28886-unO1rEi3zdyF.jpg', 'main', 'Wendy is the sky dragon slayer. She has the ability to heal and manipulate air.', 'Brittney Karbowski', 'Brittney Karbowski', '2026-05-29T19:00:04.258594+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:04.258594+00:00'),
  ('0e78c7c4-0b77-40ff-bc29-f841c4eb0296', '0fde1041-2a0e-4d9f-83db-3981c85e2ffc', 'Thorfinn', NULL, NULL, 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/9/309871.jpg?s=faa6eee1fc55878afbc1625baf0c9f3e', 'main', NULL, 'Stahl, Laura', 'Uemura, Yuuto', '2026-05-30T15:58:01.410449+00:00', '2026-05-30T15:58:01.410449+00:00'),
  ('6b8e0666-8284-4aab-9ed8-cc2dcfe9df0f', '307a431b-9813-4c43-ab68-5daab0a3914a', 'Thorfinn', NULL, NULL, 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/9/309871.jpg?s=faa6eee1fc55878afbc1625baf0c9f3e', 'main', NULL, 'Haimoto, Mike', 'Uemura, Yuuto', '2026-05-30T15:58:09.348157+00:00', '2026-05-30T15:58:09.348157+00:00'),
  ('e66c2481-1927-4672-aeb3-4f3f1299149d', '06fee875-fbf5-4880-a536-4ce89ea5f4ca', 'Natsu Dragneel', 'ナツ・ドラグニル', 'Salamander (サラマンダー), Dragon Slayer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5187-y1OEdRu9sPN2.png', 'main', 'A mage from the Fairy Tail Guild who wields fire dragon slayer magic.

Natsu has a carefree and reckless nature and, despite his constant brawls with the other members of the guild, is a fiercely loyal and protective friend. He has a particularly close and competitive relationship with [Gray Fullbuster](https://anilist.co/character/4839/Fullbuster-Gray) and [Erza Scarlet](https://anilist.co/character/5189/Scarlet-Erza). With the former, he has had a constant rivalry from a young age and although they often denounce each other as not being friends, they regularly watch each others'' back even when they are enraged with one another. He has had the same sort of relationship with Erza - the two both being scared of her since a young age - and they seemed to have a fairly good relationship in the past as, according to Erza, they used to shower together. He befriends people rather quickly too, considering [Lucy](https://anilist.co/character/5186/Heartfilia-Lucy) a friend and willing to team up with her only after a few days of knowing her.

[Igneel](https://anilist.co/character/40157/Igneel), a dragon, found him in the forest and ended up taking care of him. He taught Natsu how to speak, read, and use magic. But one day Igneel disappeared without a trace. Because of this, Natsu''s goal in life is to find him. 

~!Natsu is also among the five Dragon Slayers sent to the future from four hundred years past, having an additional purpose in the assistance of the defeat of [Acnologia](https://anilist.co/character/49003/Acnologia).!~

~!He is the younger brother of [Zeref Dragneel](https://anilist.co/character/37720/Zeref), having originally died 400 years ago, being subsequently revived as his brother''s most powerful Etherious: E.N.D.!~', 'Luci Christian', '柿原徹也', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.040602+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.040602+00:00'),
  ('aa612345-56d8-4e54-b135-a2ae33748b2e', '742e0c8d-ad3f-41ce-ad81-9643ac782471', 'Natsu Dragneel', 'ナツ・ドラグニル', 'Salamander (サラマンダー), Dragon Slayer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5187-y1OEdRu9sPN2.png', 'main', 'A mage from the Fairy Tail Guild who wields fire dragon slayer magic.

