Gray Fullbuster is a member of the Fairy Tail guild. He is an 18 year-old ice mage, practicing ice alchemy, the art of molding ice. Due to his training history, he is most comfortable in little clothing and often forgets to wear clothes or quickly takes it off, thus often being accused of being an exhibitionist. He and [Natsu](https://anilist.co/character/5187) have a friendly rivalry, and can often be seen fighting one another. [Lucy](https://anilist.co/character/5186) believes the nature of his magic is the reason that he and Natsu constantly bicker. His member stamp is on the right side of his chest.   

~!Gray''s adeptness and strength as an ice mage is quickly shown in the story. During the Lullaby of Death arc, he teams with Natsu and [Erza](https://anilist.co/character/5189) to defeat the demon awakened from the evil spirit from the Lullaby of Death. Members of the League praise his quickness at molding ice. Later in the story, he defeats [Juvia](https://anilist.co/character/9719), one of the Elemental Four of Phantom Lord. This victory may have been partly influenced by Juvia''s liking to Gray. Juvia comments on Gray''s skill, shocked that he was able to freeze both her boiling water and the rain. After Phantom Lord''s defeat, Juvia secretly spies on Gray, bringing a packed lunch for Gray while he and the guild are rebuilding the headquarters.!~  

In certain panels, Gray''s necklaces looks quite similar to the Rave Stone which is a crucial part of another one of [Mashima](https://anilist.co/staff/96882)''s stories, "Rave Master." Mashima has stated he doesn''t remember the name. He takes off his clothes because [Ul](https://anilist.co/character/8293) made him do it as one of her teachings and now it''s a force of habit.', 'Newton Pittman', '中村悠一', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.659601+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.659601+00:00'),
  ('63167342-4ea6-47eb-9d5f-d616d5922716', '76e46c3a-de33-4a1b-923a-38a7c6e76697', 'Erza Scarlet', 'エルザ・スカーレツト', 'Titania, Elsa, Elsa Scarlett', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5189-GR1xdok9SFsN.jpg', 'main', 'An S-class mage from the Fairy Tail Guild who uses requip magic, which allows her to summon weapons and equip armor stored in another dimension. She is the strongest active female member.

Erza is a very strict, intimidating, and impatient person with a strong sense of justice. She has been a member of Fairy Tail since she was a kid, and shows great loyalty and dedication to [Makarov](https://anilist.co/character/5333) and the guild.

~!Erza used to be a nameless child slave where she was forced to help build a tower called the R-system. Over time Erza made friends with other slaves, one of them being a boy her age named [Jellal](https://anilist.co/character/22751), who gave her the name "Scarlet" because of the color of her hair. She was eventually able to break free and escape-- this was also the time when her magic awakened.

After she escaped, she sought to find Fairy Tail, which she had heard about from a fellow slave named [Rob](https://anilist.co/character/56775) who cared for her like a grandpa.!~

~!She has an artificial eye, given to her by [Porlyusica](https://anilist.co/character/31192), used to replace her right eye which had become blind due to an injury.!~', 'Colleen Clinkenbeard', '大原さやか', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.713504+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:03.713504+00:00'),
