  ('293bea95-3c75-4a22-ad34-efcd1f233440', '06fee875-fbf5-4880-a536-4ce89ea5f4ca', 'Charlés', 'シャルル', 'Carla, Charles, Charlé', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b22723-tAU59GCaf2H4.png', 'main', 'Charlés is an Exceed with the same type of magic as Happy.  Wendy found her as an egg and they have been together ever since. They are very close, and Charlés sees it as her duty to protect Wendy from danger.

