~!Charlés, like all Exceeds, came from the parallel world Edolas. She is the Exceed''s princess, daughter of Queen Shagotte. As such, she possesses the same power as her mother: precognition.!~  

~!After a year of training, she learns and perfects the ability to use Transformation Magic, making her appear as a young girl around Wendy''s age. In this form, Charlés''s magic and precognition abilities are increased, as well as her overall hand-to-hand combat proficiency.!~', 'Jad Saxton', '堀江由衣', '2026-05-29T19:00:04.547546+00:00', '2026-05-29T19:00:04.547546+00:00'),
