A third-year student and one of the "Two Great Onee-samas" of Kuou Academy along with [Rias](https://anilist.co/character/50389). Called the ultimate "Queen" by other members. Born between a human mother and fallen angel father, after the death of her mother, she became Rias'' servant. She is a friend close enough to call Rias by her name in private, yet calls her Buchou in presence of others and displays a master-servant relationship in public. She persistently refuses to use her power of light, inherited from her father, but starts using it after being convinced by [Issei](https://anilist.co/character/50387).', 'Teri Rogers', '伊藤静', '2026-05-31T04:50:33.441643+00:00', '2026-05-31T04:50:33.441643+00:00'),
