  ('8056e958-9680-4f60-b29b-775f3e7c184d', '1fb904ab-1a36-45dd-9acd-4a9122c2c1b7', 'Gasper Vladi', 'ギャスパー・ヴラディ', 'Gya-kun, Gyasuke', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b51349-BwumMUZiq8kw.jpg', 'main', '__Rank/Role:__ Low-class devil (Former human/vampire)/Bishop 
__Sacred Gear:__ Forbidden Balor View 

A half-vampire male cross-dresser who has the ability to stop the time of those he sees but he is unable to control it. He is sealed by Rias as ordered by the elders till she has grown up enough to control him. He still is unable to have a full command on his powers but can improve a lot by drinking Ise''s blood.', 'Alison Viktorin', '佐倉綾音', '2026-05-31T04:50:35.283516+00:00', '2026-05-31T04:50:35.283516+00:00'),
  ('2c50e65a-c152-4c87-9395-d72de836702e', '24112eda-031c-4c29-a0e0-8b738abf7f5a', 'Koneko Toujou', '塔城小猫', 'Shirone', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b51343-pt1UDTRvAXfY.png', 'main', '__Rank:__ Low-class devil (Former nekomata)/Rook
__Power:__ Youjutsu

A 10th grade student. Originally about to be executed by the devils after her sister, [Kuroka](https://anilist.co/character/88080/Kuroka-), kills her own master. The Satan, [Lucifer](https://anilist.co/character/58343/Sirzechs-Lucifer), protected her, and left her under his sister''s, [Rias](https://anilist.co/character/50389/Rias-Gremory)'' care - becoming her servant. She refused to use the power of youjutsu because she didn''t want to become like her sister. She overcame her power along with [Akeno](https://anilist.co/character/51347/Akeno-Himejima) after [Issei](https://anilist.co/character/50387/Issei-Hyoudou) made her overcome her own powers. She doesn''t show any emotion at all, and says harsh things and hits Issei when he is doing or thinking something perverted. She shows the most concern for her comrades when they are in trouble.

~!At the end of Volume 5 she has warmed up significantly to Issei and even begins sitting on his lap and sneaking into his bed.  After this, she gradually develops romantic feelings towards him.!~', 'Jad Saxton', '竹達彩奈', '2026-05-31T04:50:35.004561+00:00', '2026-05-31T04:50:35.004561+00:00'),
  ('9a34a94c-85b1-465d-931a-25a47ebe73d2', '24112eda-031c-4c29-a0e0-8b738abf7f5a', 'Rias Gremory', 'リアス・グレモリー', 'Buchou (部長), President, Ria, Crimson-Haired Ruin Princess, Princess of Destruction, Princess of Gremory, Devil Princess, Switch Princess, Heiress of the House of Gremory, Red Dragon Emperor''s Legal Wife', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b50389-gIhJkyk8xj1P.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 172 cm (5''8")
__Rank/Role:__ Top-class devil(Pure devil)/King
__Power:__ Power of destruction

A 12th grade student and the prettiest girl in the academy. Comes from the old noble of pure devils, the house of Gremory, a top-class devil who is called a genius nicknamed "Crimson Ruin Princess". Her brother is in fact one of the Yondai-Maou, [Lucifer](https://anilist.co/character/58343). Both of them possess the power of destruction. She revives [Issei](https://anilist.co/character/50387) as her servant after finding him dead, killed by a fallen-angel and possessing a rare Sacred Gear. Kind and soft to her servants, becomes a totally different person when training or fighting.

~!She begins to develop romantic feelings for Issei in Volume 2 of the light novel and moves in with him at the volume''s end.  In Volume 10, he confesses that he loves her and she returns his feelings. They begin dating after that.!~', 'Jamie Marchi', '日笠陽子', '2026-05-31T04:50:35.636607+00:00', '2026-05-31T04:50:35.636607+00:00'),
  ('42c33dc0-5643-45ca-a7aa-8258abe2d6f3', '24112eda-031c-4c29-a0e0-8b738abf7f5a', 'Irina Shidou', '紫藤イリナ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b51339-vtfi7nIFPwYS.png', 'main', '__Rank:__ Angel (Former Human)
__Weapon:__ Excalibur Mimic

She is Xenovia''s partner and Issei''s childhood friend. After finding out that the God in the Bible is dead, she still follows the teaching and is under the direct command of Michael. She also has a crush on Issei and was shocked to find out he turned into a devil. They are still friends despite that flaw.', 'Kristi Kang', '内田真礼', '2026-05-31T04:50:35.317226+00:00', '2026-05-31T04:50:35.317226+00:00'),
