  ('c7bb7cb5-eb2d-4e91-b837-c4cb1d47df25', '58afe155-cd5f-434d-bc90-a80477311205', 'Rick Gladiatol', 'リック・グラディアートル', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315381-B9nqRaqBUIg7.png', 'main', 'At the age of 30, he left his job as a guild clerk to pursue his dream of becoming an adventurer. After undergoing two years of "terrifying beyond hellish training" from his seniors from the Orichalcum Fist party, the strongest on the continent, he showed remarkable growth. The days of continuous death and resurrection during training have left him deeply traumatized.', 'Aaron Campbell', '佐藤拓也', '2026-05-31T08:04:12.325134+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:04:12.325134+00:00'),
  ('9903d297-e471-4498-b341-b6b2a9cc3f74', '58afe155-cd5f-434d-bc90-a80477311205', 'Reanette Elfelt', 'リーネット・エルフェルト', 'Lynette Elfelto', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315382-o7axWJnuUP0o.png', 'main', 'Reanette is a dark elf and Rick''s assistant and companion who once achieved the legendary 9999 consecutive victories in an underground arena. She now wears a maid outfit and takes care of all the housework for "Orichalcum Fist". She meets Rick through a certain incident and invites him to join her party.', 'Dani Chambers', '大西沙織', '2026-05-31T08:04:12.981621+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:04:12.981621+00:00'),
  ('86640879-dee3-4508-8e87-68cd89c4d92d', '58afe155-cd5f-434d-bc90-a80477311205', 'Broughston Ashorc', 'ブロストン・アッシュオーク', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315383-mXbiPjKKWfad.png', 'main', 'Broughston is a warrior-monk orc who became an adventurer, and is known as "The Sage Beast" because of his monstrous physique and intelligence. He currently leads "Orichalcum Fist," and Rick looks up to him as his mentor. Despite his gigantic size, he is skilled in support magic, including healing magic, and can even resurrect the dead if they have died shortly after.', 'Brian Mathis', '三宅健太', '2026-05-31T08:04:13.346768+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:04:13.346768+00:00'),
  ('27162000-e7b4-45fd-9e81-322c64394121', '58afe155-cd5f-434d-bc90-a80477311205', 'Mizett Eldwarf', 'ミゼット・エルドワーフ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315384-vLMqYeJ2rPLs.png', 'main', 'The young-looking half-elf, half-dwarf, (but over 50 years of age). He continues to develop weapons that cannot be made with the scientific technology of this world, and people say that he has access to technology from 1000 years into the future, earning him the nickname "The Thousand-year Workshopper". He is an invincible womanizer.', 'Mark Allen Jr.', '豊永利行', '2026-05-31T08:04:13.663153+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:04:13.663153+00:00'),
  ('528055da-dd2a-4185-a36c-2013fa556550', '58afe155-cd5f-434d-bc90-a80477311205', 'Alicerette Draqul', 'アリスレート・ドラクル', 'The Demon Child of Devastation', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315385-xCtKJhOe0670.png', 'main', 'A pure-blooded vampire girl. Nicknamed the "The Demon Child of Devastation", she is the continent''s strongest super-genius offensive magician. Rick has been killed numerous times during training while she innocently toys around, unleashing tremendous offensive magic that carves into mountains and the earth. She is a glutton, which is difficult to believe given her appearance.', 'Kelly Greenshield', '久野美咲', '2026-05-31T08:04:13.959954+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:04:13.959954+00:00'),
