Pilots the Franxx Chlorophytum with Mitsuru.', 'Leah Clark', '石上静香', '2026-05-31T08:08:55.744984+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:08:55.744984+00:00'),
  ('719dc47b-edf4-42a0-86c4-c8561e2bf667', '2f9dd806-948e-4be0-99d6-10f114f448a8', 'Mitsuru', 'ミツル', 'Code:326', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124389-iJY8frLNdK7Y.jpg', 'main', 'Mitsuru pilots the FRANXX Chlorophytum with Ikuno, and is part off Plantation 13.

