  ('a44095f9-905f-495f-80b4-abdb1fb16dfb', '89a857dc-00a2-4146-aa2e-a98f51ffbce2', 'Dororo', 'どろろ', '露々, Roro', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18130-qD7dREeDAkLE.png', 'main', '~!__Gender__: Female!~

After seeing his swordsmanship, Dororo decides to follow Hyakkimaru. Dororo was a thief before meeting Hyakkimaru.

~!Dororo''s bandit father Hibukuro was wounded by a samurai official and later died. Her mother froze to death while fleeing in the snow, but before she died she drew a map on Dororo''s back to locate money hidden by her father at Bone Cape.

Hyakkimaru learns that Dororo is female with the latter continuously insisting she is a boy, though this is because her parents raised her as one.!~', 'Chaney Moore', '鈴木梨央', '2026-05-31T08:09:17.035847+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:09:17.035847+00:00'),
