  ('5488bae6-f35c-4be6-a388-1d289ffc311f', 'd54694d8-896d-4a09-a5f1-3d2f4daa0287', 'Lian Xie', '谢怜', '謝憐, His Royal Majesty the Crown Prince (太子殿下), Flower Crown Martial God (花冠武神), His Highness Who Pleased the Gods (太子悦神), Shei Ryen (シエイ・リェン), Fang Xin (芳心剑), State Perceptor Fang Xin (国师芳心剑), Hua Xie (花谢), General Hua (花将军)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b149589-dC9wt4beVBUU.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 178 cm
__Weapons:__ Ruoye, Fang Xin

Xie Lian is the main protagonist of the Chinese web novel _Heaven Official''s Blessing_.

He was widely known throughout the Xian Le nation as the beloved yet strange prince. Never showing interest in what was considered normal for a prince, he simply declared, "I want to save the common people!" Through practice, hard work, and insight beyond his years, he perfected his cultivation and ascended to the Heavens at the age of 17. He owns a special silk band called Ruoye.

After multiple unfortunate events, he was twice banished from the Heavens. 800 years later, he returns for the third time with an immense crash.
', 'Howard Wang', '姜广涛', '2026-05-31T08:20:06.550507+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:20:06.550507+00:00'),
  ('b841ee75-953f-41dc-9c72-1ccce82dfb3a', 'd54694d8-896d-4a09-a5f1-3d2f4daa0287', 'Cheng Hua', '花城', 'Lang San (三郎), Xueyu Tanhua (血雨探花), Xiaohua (小花), Hua Chengzhu (花城主), San Ran (サンラン)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b149594-mWkRlJYUZGPG.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 190 cm - 185 cm (San Lang)

Hua Cheng is the deuteragonist and main love interest in Heaven Official''s Blessing.

One of the Four Great Calamities, Hua Cheng is the most famed of the three Devastation-class Demons in the Ghost World, thus he is entitled the Ghost King. When he first emerged, he challenged 33 gods and won, making his name as the scourge of the Heavenly Officials overnight.

~!His most famous moniker, Crimson Rain Sought Flower, was attained during his early days as a supreme. After he annihilated Qi Rong''s lair and causing blood rain to fall, he found a lone white flower struggling under the heavy rainfall. Until the downpour ceased, Hua Cheng stood by this flower and shielded it from the rain with his red umbrella.!~

~!Just like any other ghost, Hua Cheng''s only weakness is his ashes. Hua Cheng''s ashes were modelled into a diamond ring that he entrusted to [Xie Lian](https://anilist.co/character/149589/Xie-Lian). When asked if his ashes were sufficiently protected, he stated that if the hiding place of his ashes were to be destroyed, then he would no longer have any reason to exist and might as well disappear.!~
', 'James Cheek', '马正阳', '2026-05-31T08:20:06.550507+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:20:06.550507+00:00'),
  ('51a2e939-9b3e-4a36-b79a-12477e42e12f', '37dea0b8-ef43-423b-b050-0248a115d5eb', 'Lian Xie', '谢怜', '謝憐, His Royal Majesty the Crown Prince (太子殿下), Flower Crown Martial God (花冠武神), His Highness Who Pleased the Gods (太子悦神), Shei Ryen (シエイ・リェン), Fang Xin (芳心剑), State Perceptor Fang Xin (国师芳心剑), Hua Xie (花谢), General Hua (花将军)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b149589-dC9wt4beVBUU.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 178 cm
