  ('2fdfde8b-160d-4d35-848b-468d612f0e0c', '7efe65e0-0a23-47c5-92c6-dc1669d4dff9', 'Papi', 'パピ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/63267-tPKf1DM3ucxq.jpg', 'main', '__Species:__ Harpy

Papi is the second girl to move in with Kimihito after she abducts him and almost dropped him while flying. She has difficulty with words which makes it difficult for Kimihito to understand what she is saying. She''s childish, both physically and mentally, despite being as old as Miia.', 'Brittney Karbowski', '小澤亜李', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00'),
  ('bc1c55fb-5f98-499e-b893-60af897823cf', '7efe65e0-0a23-47c5-92c6-dc1669d4dff9', 'Centorea Shianus', 'セントレア・シアヌス', 'Cerea', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b65007-SFsdhgGf5myf.png', 'main', '__Species:__ Centaur

Centorea, also known as "Cerea", is the third resident of Kimihito Kurusu''s home. She is very prim and proper, referring to herself as a self-proclaimed knight.
As one of the noble creatures, Cerea is incredibly honorable and chivalrous, while being unerringly loyal to Kimihito. Also, she is somewhat archaic in speech and behavior. Centaurs have strict rules about only letting one''s master ride on their backs. She has been shown to be just as possessive of Kimihito as Miia, the difference is that Cerea hides it much better and can seemingly be ashamed of it.
Due to her horse physiology and nature, Cerea''s favorite food are carrots. She tries to hide her big appetite for the vegetable because people make fun of her for it.', 'Molly Searcy', '相川奈都姫', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00'),
  ('0a54f3a5-e395-40a6-a4f9-fe98ab1410cc', '7efe65e0-0a23-47c5-92c6-dc1669d4dff9', 'Meroune Lorelei', 'マーラウン・ロリライ', 'Mero', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/76864-lFhPIbnvUeWo.jpg', 'main', '__Species:__ Mermaid

Meroune Lorelei, or Mero for short, is a mermaid bound to a wheelchair. While she is the the fourth girl to officially move in with Kimihito, she is technically the fifth girl to move in with him because Suu is supposed to be the fourth, but she lives there illegally so she doesn''t count. Mero has a very warm personality. According to Centaurea, she gets a vibe of royalty from her. As a young girl she had a fascination with the "tragic love" story of Hans Andersen''s "The Little Mermaid", and wants to experience it in real life, even to the point of turning into sea foam (She wants to be a lover instead of a bride).   (Source: Monster Musume wikia)', 'Maggie Flecknoe', '山崎はるか', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00'),
  ('b0b042b7-6a71-4364-a38a-01ecdd3b41f1', '7efe65e0-0a23-47c5-92c6-dc1669d4dff9', 'Suu', 'スー', 'Slime Girl', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/73075-hEhQLQwYK9sy.jpg', 'main', '__Species:__ Slime

A humanoid-like monster who tends to cling onto Kurusu and loves to copy Papi. She can also copy speech word-for-word in the same pitch and tone as others. Can shape-shift to become like other humanoid beings but leaves her distinct traits to distinguish her from the person she copied.   ~!In chapter 13, Suu apparently learns how to speak and confesses her love to Kimihito (Master) in front of the others surprising everyone especially Miia. !~', 'Monica Rial', '野村真悠華', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00'),
  ('1de3f704-f41e-4b02-adf1-78ae3e8559f4', '7efe65e0-0a23-47c5-92c6-dc1669d4dff9', 'Lala', 'ララ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/122640-ZVaqviMx9UgO.jpg', 'main', '__Species:__ Dullahan

Lala is the seventh resident of Kimihito''s house. ~!She is the second "D", which she initially denied, telling everyone she''s merely there to warn Kimihito Kurusu of his impending death.!~', 'Carli Mosier', '加隈亜衣', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:09.34058+00:00'),
  ('26c3f362-63bb-4e98-afd7-fc598b5b7f03', 'f341f90e-d90a-48fd-aa9c-d363d1a79880', 'Korisu Morino', '杜乃こりす', 'Nero Alice (ネロアリス), Korisun (こりすん)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b191858-VcAmTDFM9lQH.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 128 cm

Korisu is a quiet and reserved girl, and the youngest member of Enormeeta. She has a large collection of old toys that are precious to her.

Her theme is Alice in Wonderland.', 'Shiori Sugiura', '杉浦しおり', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00'),
  ('c1c8385e-72bc-49cb-a01a-b089262878a9', 'f341f90e-d90a-48fd-aa9c-d363d1a79880', 'Kiwi Araga', '阿良河キウィ', 'Leopard (レオパルト), Leopolt', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b190374-mqGruyIYBjmo.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 149 cm

She became a member of Enormeeta to beat up magical girls, because she hated that they got more attention than her on social media. Although Kiwi was initially hostile towards [Utena](https://anilist.co/character/175746), after undergoing shock training, she became docile and developed a crush on Utena. Now she is content with Utena''s acknowledgement alone. Kiwi frequently fantasizes about going to a love hotel with Utena. Despite appearances she is decent enough academically to help Utena avoid her grades deteriorating.

She and [Magia Sulfur](https://anilist.co/character/191859) instinctively have it out for each other. They immediately devolve to insults and fighting at every opportunity — even in their civilian forms, despite not recognizing each other due to recognition inhibition.', 'Aoi Koga', '古賀葵', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00'),
  ('bd16e536-a016-4e81-827c-8ddb935bdf94', 'f341f90e-d90a-48fd-aa9c-d363d1a79880', 'Utena Hiiragi', '柊うてな', 'Magia Baiser (マジアベーゼ), Magia Böse', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175746-JlJnFu7so79j.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 154 cm

Utena is a shy and introverted girl who longingly admires magical girls, collects their memorabilia, and talks passionately about them. Her obsession with Tres Magia even reached to the point where she wished to fight alongside them, but that ultimately led to her being tricked by [Venalita](https://anilist.co/character/301180). At times, she can be simple-minded.', 'Fuuka Izumi', '和泉風花', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00'),
  ('07aed07d-1e62-4dde-a69c-ef425fc10567', 'f341f90e-d90a-48fd-aa9c-d363d1a79880', 'Nemo Anemo', '姉母ネモ', 'Leberblume (ルベルブルーメ)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b255889-p212OLFZ385a.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 151 cm
__Favorite Food:__ Takoyaki
__Least Favorite Food:__ Shiitake Mushrooms
__Something That Made Her Happy Recently:__ Pulled Three SSRs In A Social Game

Nemo is a snarky and crude girl. She is also quite arrogant, since she has a habit of taunting her opponents. She is also childhood friends with [Akoya Matama](https://anilist.co/character/255890). They have good teamwork when fighting together. However, they also argue often. In spite of this, they may have romantic feelings for each other.', 'Minami Tsuda', '津田美波', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00'),
  ('6577b724-e24b-46fe-a455-86b2a9224e25', '330bd971-da94-4fe4-9cb9-a96928271f79', 'Aosagi', '青サギ', 'Gray Heron', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b314611-Qc7qUG1ifiTx.png', 'main', NULL, 'Robert Pattinson', '菅田将暉', '2026-05-31T08:39:57.604199+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:39:57.604199+00:00'),
  ('967b1782-0c99-4a75-ad0e-a126cb5e1dcf', 'f341f90e-d90a-48fd-aa9c-d363d1a79880', 'Matama Akoya', '阿古屋真珠', 'Loco Musica (ロコムジカ), Loco (ロコ), Utaboshi Pearl', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b255890-QaJpYLkOCpwz.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 155 cm
__Favorite Food:__ Sweet Rolled Omelettes
__Least Favorite Food:__ Coriander
__Recent Ambition:__ To Have A Video Of Her Singing Go Viral On Social Media

Matama is a cheerful girl. However, she is also quite narcissistic and very sensitive to criticism. She fears both [Lord Enorme](https://anilist.co/character/288448) and [Magia Baiser Utena](https://anilist.co/character/175746), finding them both similar in that they use sexual harassment as punishment. She is terrible at singing except when engaging in exhibitionism, a fact discovered when Utena made her perform in the nude on threat of [Nemo](https://anilist.co/character/255889) being harmed.', 'Yuuka Aisaka', '相坂優歌', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:36.762558+00:00'),
  ('4ff9eb65-794b-46dd-b882-95ee5add355e', 'ec16a08f-1209-45b2-aee4-89a36c22f4e9', 'Aine Chidorigafuchi', '千鳥ヶ淵愛音', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89665-0SxdYxWpzRVf.jpg', 'main', 'She is one of prominent members of Ataraxia''s Amaterasu who is famed for mastering Heart Hybrid Gear much quicker than her comrades, specifically [Kizuna](https://anilist.co/character/89664/Hida-Kizuna). ~!It is later revealed that she is also known as Aines Synclavia the lost princess of Vatlantis Empire before her amnesia.!~', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:30:59.65036+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:59.65036+00:00'),
  ('bfd81ae4-ae4d-4d8b-8138-690ef38dcd9c', 'ec16a08f-1209-45b2-aee4-89a36c22f4e9', 'Hayuru Himekawa', '姫川ハユル', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89666-4WJARPOBNsKo.png', 'main', 'Hayuru is the ace of Japan and an esteemed member of the Amaterasu. She is a member of Ataraxia''s Morals Committee and an extremely strict woman.

Hayuru is a beautiful young woman with long eyelashes and blue eyes. She has long black hair with hime-style which is decorated with red ribbons, that keep her hairstyle into twin-tails. She has a slender figure yet Hayuru does have well-developed bust and voluptuous buttocks. Furthermore, she wears the usual academic uniform. In privacy, she sometimes wears a headdress with cat ears.

Her Neros looks like a device that gives the image of a sharp bladed tool. An armament that looks similar to a Japanese katana is fixed at the waist, while eight long and slender mechanical parts float on her back. In other words, she looks somewhat like a samurai from the Edo period, which is reflected by her personality.', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:30:59.65036+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:59.65036+00:00'),
  ('f66b3f51-3488-4bf4-b985-94549e6045cc', 'ec16a08f-1209-45b2-aee4-89a36c22f4e9', 'Kizuna Hida', '飛弾傷無', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89664-m4GDCQE7FWeH.jpg', 'main', 'He´s the second child of Hida Nayuta, younger brother and lover of Hida Reiri, adopted older brother to Hida Setsuna as well as the first-person who obtains HHG on Earth/Lemuria and the only male HHG pilot on Lemuria. After being expelled from Ataraxia by his mother, he lived as a regular student until he was called back by his sister after she learns his secret abilities and made him the captain of Amaterasu.', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:30:59.65036+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:59.65036+00:00'),
  ('c4c95130-034c-4f56-b995-3bc1ed03352e', 'ec16a08f-1209-45b2-aee4-89a36c22f4e9', 'Yurishia Farandole', 'ユリシア・ファランドール', 'World Strongest', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89667-RHg4WJtTfLe0.png', 'main', 'Yurishia is a beautiful young woman with typical features of Caucasian descent, having blonde hair, blue eyes, and white skin. She looks more mature compared to her age. Kizuna described her as glamorous and perfect.

Her Heart Hybrid Gear looks like a protector with beautiful material. The sleek surface reflects the surrounding light and gold lines of light is running inside it. It has a small surface area which makes one feel uneasy whether it could really accomplish its role as a protector.

There are also weapons integrated on the back and around the waist. The two large units stretching out from the back, the Differential Frames (Offensive Mobile Particle Engine) divides the energy they produce for propulsive power and the particle cannon. The units have a mobile style where Yurisia can move them freely using her will, leaving no blind spot for her.', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-31T08:30:59.65036+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:30:59.65036+00:00'),
