  ('9facaea2-e2de-4290-a624-052567c4ff08', 'e6f59c62-33a1-48fa-aa90-890c8105430e', 'Licht Bach', 'バッハ・リヒトー', 'Legendary Red Baron, The Blitzkrieg Baron', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141532-2AXEveTbFfPU.jpg', 'main', 'He was presented at Nana''s restaurant as a degenerate lower number, beyond that, fortunately for Hina, he is one of the Legendary Red Barons possessing a powerful force for justicing his path.

His "Count" is, initially, -999.

~!Even though Nana stated that his Count stands for how many girls have turned him down, his count becomes -1000 after Hina calls him a liar and says that she hates him.

His "Ballot" count is 5700 and stands for how many heads he had cut off. In chapter 10, it states that he is actually hiding his true power. During his battle, his count increases by 10 times, reaching the amount 57000.

It is revealed in later chapters that Licht''s real name was Sakai Rihito (坂井離人), Sakai Tokikaze''s childhood friend and adopted brother. It is also shown he was shorter and even more perverted than he is 300 years later, even so he still cares about how people feel.

After he became the Red Baron, his appearance was slowly changed and his awareness was slowly controlled by the power and he went berserk, he cut off Mizuka''s left arm and killed his childhood friend, Tokikaze, which has caused him to be in regret for 300 years.!~', 'Eric Vale', '中島ヨシキ', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00'),
  ('6def21d3-7c8b-434b-8e4d-7d3ddd4578e6', 'e6f59c62-33a1-48fa-aa90-890c8105430e', 'Hina', '陽菜', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141533-w7BKIR6ZxHST.jpg', 'main', 'She is a solitary girl who lived before with her mom on the mountains. Now she had been traveled around this world looking for The Legendary Red Baron.

Her "Count" is, initially, 441.

~!Her Count stays for how many hundreds of kilometers her mother walked. 44100 km, accordingly.

In chapter 2, her Count is increased to 760 after Licht wins the game of "The Startheft Bout" for her.!~', 'Sarah Wiedenheft', '本泉莉奈', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00'),
  ('13229624-ca77-40c0-b42e-8aae08cd6a20', 'e6f59c62-33a1-48fa-aa90-890c8105430e', 'Jail Murdoch', 'ジェイル＝マードック ', 'Lieutenant', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144530-fPcuEyXsxTGr.jpg', 'main', 'He is a part of the Althea Royal Guard army, having the rank of squad leader with the title of Lieutenant. 

His "Count" is 900.

~!Jail maintains his true count hidden so as not to be promoted to a higher rank, so that he can continue with field missions. His original count is 12500, later decreasing to 12498, due to the events of the series. Later, the possession of his second glove is revealed, containing the count of 45,000, thus showing how great his conviction is.!~', 'David Matranga', '梅原裕一郎', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00'),
  ('a669fbf4-ab12-4a00-87a9-a2bcf9846c4a', 'e6f59c62-33a1-48fa-aa90-890c8105430e', 'Lyne Mei', 'リィン＝メイ', 'Lynn May, Sergeant-Major', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144531-eaALk6t0Elzi.jpg', 'main', 'Lyne Mei is the secondary female character of Plunderer. She is a sergeant, who protects Hoemmh which is located at the side of a hill. 

Amiable to a fault, Lyne is always eager to help others, and boosting her count is not the sole motivator. She is genuinely a good person, if not a little daft because of her sweet nature. She is easily misled because of how quick she is to want to do good. Lyne is also short-tempered when anyone called her weight to be too heavy.

She is unafraid to use physical force to protect others and fulfill her duties as a soldier.

', 'Elizabeth Maxwell', '小澤亜李', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00'),
  ('9c2f24df-0b31-48d0-a2fd-9dafbd8ea32e', 'e6f59c62-33a1-48fa-aa90-890c8105430e', 'Pele Poporo', 'ペレ＝ポポロ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144532-F8PIOWITp6oX.png', 'main', 'Pele is friends with Lyne.

~!It was later revealed that Pele Poporo isn''t his real name, his real name and true identity was Gespenst Zerlegen the Pierce Baron, and the founder of Special Service faction.!~', 'Austin Tindle', '市川蒼', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:18.897266+00:00'),
  ('e9eb4910-8d8b-488c-b477-2fea448a1797', '2c091adf-7076-4954-bc56-ebbab5d925ed', 'Haruhiro', 'ハルヒロ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89313-uSvLfoxddA1K.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Human
__Height:__ 170cm, 172cm (Volume 8)
__Class:__ Thief

The main viewpoint character and Thief of the group. Haruhiro is the most well-rounded character of the series as he is neither arrogant in his nature nor humble. He is generally helpful and always willing to help out his party members. ~!He is later forced to become the group''s leader after Manato''s death. Eventually,​ he starts to pay more attention to his teammates'' feelings, slowly improving as a leader.!~', 'Ricco Fajardo', '細谷佳正', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00'),
  ('7d9f042f-fb8b-43d5-a33e-11a51cf37334', '2c091adf-7076-4954-bc56-ebbab5d925ed', 'Yume', 'ユメ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89314-uTnztcUOdui0.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Human
__Height:__ 159cm
__Class:__ Hunter

Brave and energetic, Yume is the Hunter of the group. She also has a tendency to try and protect Shihoru because of her shy and timid nature. She has a good friendship with Haruhiro and they seem to get along well.', 'Jeannie Tirado', '小松未可子', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00'),
  ('61fc376f-feac-442b-8874-94e1e7204639', '2c091adf-7076-4954-bc56-ebbab5d925ed', 'Mary', 'メリイ', 'Merry', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89424-8m6l2xYz6EVb.png', 'main', '__Class:__ Priest

~!Joining shortly after Manato''s death, Mary effectively replaces him as the Priest of the party. Initially, there is a lot of friction between Mary and the rest of the team. She was actually a lot like Manato, but after a tragic incident that led to the death of some of her friends, she became cold and aloof. However, after Haruhiro tells her about their own situation, she slowly opens to her new party.!~', 'Jad Saxton', '安済知佳', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00'),
  ('c7814ef1-f8c8-43f5-89a4-4227548336cd', '2c091adf-7076-4954-bc56-ebbab5d925ed', 'Ranta', 'ランタ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89315-vPk7tQMpAEJF.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Human
__Height:__ 168cm, 170cm (Volume 11)
__Class:__ Dark Knight

The Dark Knight of the group. He is brash, impulsive, and somewhat perverted, which leads him to constantly arguing with Haruhiro. Ranta is the troublemaker of the group constantly causing problems and making rash decisions for he has a slight hint of arrogance in his character.', 'Orion Pitts', '吉野裕行', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00'),
  ('5882aff2-ab3a-4afa-bc2f-e5e6e97c0656', '2c091adf-7076-4954-bc56-ebbab5d925ed', 'Shihoru', 'シホル', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89316-kQi4arsp455S.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Human
__Height:__ Unknown
__Class:__ Mage

The Mage of the group. She is shy, only opening up to Yume and Manato which led to a one-sided crush on him. Yume is constantly trying to get her to interact more with the group.

~! Shihoru becomes completely heart broken because of Manato''s death !~', 'Sarah Wiedenheft', '照井春佳', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00'),
  ('b62efa53-c301-4882-b99e-821a1b19dcef', '2c091adf-7076-4954-bc56-ebbab5d925ed', 'Manato', 'マナト', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89317-IK3uBl1On6o9.png', 'main', '__Class:__ Priest

Manato chose to become a Priest and ultimately assumed the role of the group''s initial leader. He saw the positives in people and with that he was able to effectively strategize battle plans when the group began hunting goblins for the first time. As they progressed as a team, they began mapping out abandoned towns while hunting bigger goblin parties. ~!However, while resting the group was ambushed by more goblins than they were accustomed to. Effectively moving his party to retreat, a goblin archer was able to successfully hit Manato square in the back as they ran away successfully. He died soon after. In a conversation after his death, Haruhiro mentioned that aside from missing his leadership and strategist plans, Manato was also a defensive tank like Moguzo and a front line attacker like Ranta.!~', 'Justin Briner', '島﨑信長', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00'),
  ('082f762d-cf6d-4797-8323-bd0a1ce17d22', '2c091adf-7076-4954-bc56-ebbab5d925ed', 'Moguzo', 'モグゾー', 'Mogzo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89318-drYFPAhqIhsV.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Human
__Height:__ 186cm
__Class:__ Knight

Moguzo is the tallest and heaviest member of the group and hence chose to become a member of the Warrior guild. He wears the most ironclad armor and wields a wide blade broadsword that comes up to shoulder height. Although he is the most physically imposing, he challenges Shihoru for being the most soft spoken. On several occasions he will allow his friends to sleep in and will take their turn at cooking breakfast in the morning. He somewhat remembers doing this before and finding joy out of it. He also would carve wooden figurines of noteworthy quality in his spare time.', 'Jarrod Greene', '落合福嗣', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:38.478367+00:00'),
  ('59c80bd9-ccde-4bac-a853-1270e5e5a40b', 'bb3e48cb-0fc6-484b-aad8-7b100f5ffa83', 'Akihito Narihisago', '鳴瓢秋人', 'Sakaido (酒井戸)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143399-px9n0OzJKvot.jpg', 'main', '__Occupation:__ Homicide detective (formerly) / Mizuhanome pilot / Brilliant Detective (Sakaido persona) 
__Affiliations:__ Kura 
__Height:__ 178 cm (5''10") 

He was once a happy man with a family. Two years ago, his daughter was assaulted and later bashed to death by the serial killer, [the Challenger](https://anilist.co/character/164167/Denshin-Katsuyama). This later spiraled Ayako''s severe depression, and despite Narihisago''s best efforts, committed suicide out of grief soon afterwards. Disdained and vengefully driven, Narihsiago shot the Challenger out of vengeance after finding out his true identity, unintentionally saving [Kiki Asukai](https://anilist.co/character/160111/Kiki-Asukai). After this decisive victory, Narihisago was sentenced to prison for Katsuyama''s murder.

Two years later however, having killed someone, he now is capable of entering ID-Wells and retrieving information about serial killers using their murderous intent. Once he enters the wells, he is known as Sakaido "the brilliant detective", with no prior memory of his real identity, he assists in investigating and analyzing the serial killer''s subconsciousness. Over the next year, he would go on to aid in the capture of at least four serial killers, among them being "[the Face-lifter](https://anilist.co/character/164168/Hitoshi-Sonoda)", "Tongue-tearer", "Arm-twister" and "Thigh-severer".', 'Jessie James Grelle', '津田健次郎', '2026-05-31T08:31:54.982598+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:54.982598+00:00'),
  ('9f08785d-3ec7-46d1-b8e6-369fe9f99a15', 'bb3e48cb-0fc6-484b-aad8-7b100f5ffa83', 'Hunetarou Momoki', '百貴船太郎', 'Funetaro Momoki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145224-2fgrkTANtyU0.png', 'main', 'A former colleague of [Akihito Narihisago](https://anilist.co/character/143399/Akihito-Narihisago), he heads the Kura division that operates the Mizuhanome System.', 'Christopher Wehkamp', '細谷佳正', '2026-05-31T08:31:54.982598+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:54.982598+00:00'),
  ('9cc66dfe-068b-47ab-aba0-c77371baa19e', 'bb3e48cb-0fc6-484b-aad8-7b100f5ffa83', 'Tamotsu Fukuda', '富久田保津', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b154397-tPaDD3hiqkgH.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 190 cm (6''2")

