  ('8a4f5ae6-3f40-4f9a-aaeb-e3ab0c5edb49', 'bb3e48cb-0fc6-484b-aad8-7b100f5ffa83', 'Koharu Hondoumachi', '本堂町小春', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145228-DdQJYGcqjZB3.jpg', 'main', '
Koharu Hondoumachi is one of the protagonists of ID:Invaded. She assists [Matsuoka](https://anilist.co/character/145232/Kokuryuu-Matsuoka) in tracking down serial killers in the field.

~!After incidents involving [Tamotsu Fukuda](https://anilist.co/character/154397/Fukuda-Tamotsu) and [Haruka Kazuta](https://anilist.co/character/161511/Haruka-Kazuta), she becomes one of the brilliant detectives under the name Miyo Hijiriido.!~
', 'Monica Rial', '市道真央', '2026-05-31T08:31:54.982598+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:31:54.982598+00:00'),
  ('f61aeb4e-0f1e-4f2d-b594-e500d7f1e7ef', '326f5993-beee-4e86-a409-b24f36d485ab', 'Ikoma', '生駒', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89472-Ayu4lT9Crbl5.png', 'main', 'A headstrong and passionate young Steam Smith and inventor from Hinomoto who makes a living in Aragane Station making iron and steam engines. He and his good friend Takumi developed a weapon called "Tsuranuki Zutsu" in order to defeat the Kabane. Everyone makes light of him now, but he looks forward to a day when he will be triumphant.

