', 'Sara Ornelas', '日笠陽子', '2026-05-31T08:35:30.037955+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:35:30.037955+00:00'),
  ('aae44be8-2fd1-4cc6-a598-b8392426058b', 'bfcbf494-dd75-4952-ab9a-cad7b7f344a2', 'Jibril', 'ジブリール', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87887-3QKmvQM5LTwY.png', 'main', '__Race:__ Flügel

Jibril is the youngest and strongest of the Flügel race. Her love toward knowledge starts even before the declaration of the Ten Oaths. She is against the book sharing law, and left her homeland to win the main library of the human world from the previous king in a game.

~!Unlike [Steph](https://anilist.co/character/82527), Jibril is happy to become the siblings underling, and is shown growing feelings toward [Sora](https://anilist.co/character/82523).!~', 'Amelia Fischer', '田村ゆかり', '2026-05-31T08:35:30.037955+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:35:30.037955+00:00');

(Source: Official Site)', 'Dani Chambers', '高尾奏音', '2026-05-31T08:38:34.356938+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:38:34.356938+00:00'),
  ('7f03d2ad-8067-42ce-805b-d331775a61dc', 'c6a40d02-7088-4374-b160-7a66fa6b3d72', 'Red', 'レッド', 'Gideon Ragnason (ギデオン・ラグナソン)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196218-4DH68aU0IEOI.png', 'main', 'A D-rank adventurer from the nearby settlement of Zoltan, Red gathers and sells herbs to make a living and hopes to one day open his own herb shop and live a quiet life. He is blessed with the sign of the ''Guide'' to protect and guide heroes on their journey, and was once a member of such a party.

(Source: Official Site)', 'Aaron Campbell', '鈴木崚汰', '2026-05-31T08:38:34.356938+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:38:34.356938+00:00'),
  ('582c34a7-2bd9-4975-9dc1-15721840054d', 'ed670575-9b02-460f-814a-d54963b4be61', 'Ainsworth, Elias', NULL, NULL, 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/4/278307.jpg?s=7fa0279f052643e48d23cd3d9b85175b', 'main', NULL, 'Mathis, Brian', 'Takeuchi, Ryouta', '2026-05-31T08:41:04.210205+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:41:04.210205+00:00'),
  ('1e35a9be-4a65-4856-86fd-bd2d2b726738', 'ed670575-9b02-460f-814a-d54963b4be61', 'Gabriel', NULL, NULL, 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/5/457341.jpg?s=17868c211f9fb312b70c06d02f96af4c', 'main', NULL, 'Ewulu, Cassie', 'Igarashi, Hiromi', '2026-05-31T08:41:04.210205+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:41:04.210205+00:00'),
