  ('2bae0505-1657-42b7-b833-f6e11d4d406e', '9149d09a-0226-4895-922e-ad2a35bd5434', 'Hatori, Chise', NULL, NULL, 'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/15/330649.jpg?s=ccd6ca58329ac6032953c1dbd3368c06', 'main', NULL, 'Chambers, Dani', 'Tanezaki, Atsumi', '2026-05-31T08:41:04.118358+00:00', '2026-05-31T08:41:04.118358+00:00'),
  ('a7878776-808a-4a20-95a5-969aff9608ad', 'bc428a79-6799-4750-b5d7-09e3c5500b9e', 'Ayato Amagiri', '天霧綾斗', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89058-y1gv0HgwNjJi.jpg', 'main', 'He transfers to Seidoukan Academy to investigate his sister''s disappearance and to figure out what he is supposed to do (~!he later says that it is to protect Julis!~). <br>
Ayato sports a friendly, polite, and helpful personality with a penchant for ending up in awkward situations. He is indiscriminate as to who he is being friendly to and is helpful to a fault, as well as being a bit naive. However, underneath the soft facade lies a person with an indomitable will who always tries to do the right thing, regardless of the potential trouble that he will get himself into.', 'Atsushi Tamaru', '田丸篤志', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00'),
  ('2a7a5b57-a9ee-4d10-acc5-5d00a48f50b4', 'bc428a79-6799-4750-b5d7-09e3c5500b9e', 'Julis Alexia von Riessfeld', 'ユリス＝アレクシア・フォン・リースフェルト', 'Glühende Rose', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b85151-IxmQrAsrlmiT.png', 'main', 'Julis is the fifth ranking student of Seidoukan Academy and is Lieseltania''s First Princess. Her full name is Julis-Alexia Marie Florentia Renate von Riessfelt. She wields a rapier-type lux called Aspera Spina which she uses during the Phoenix tournament and bears the image of a flower for her power - control over flames.

She warms to [Ayato](https://anilist.co/character/89058/Amagiri-Ayato), unlike the other students with whom she is distant. She starts to like Ayato and often find herself arguing with [Saya](https://anilist.co/character/89060/Sasamiya-Saya) and [Kirin](https://anilist.co/character/89059/Toudou-Kirin) and even [Claudia](https://anilist.co/character/89061/Enfield-Claudia) for his attention.', 'Ai Kakuma', '加隈亜衣', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00'),
  ('9b4119f8-bbd1-403f-8ece-548a5f09a854', 'bc428a79-6799-4750-b5d7-09e3c5500b9e', 'Kirin Toudou', '刀藤綺凛', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89059-7rHDP4oX9agO.png', 'main', 'Kirin is the top-ranking student of Seidoukan Academy. She is a shy and quiet girl who becomes the academy''s top student as a 13 year-old and has not lost to anyone until Ayato challenges her a second time. She does not have a personal lux but rather carries a katana (Senbakiri) around as a weapon which often makes her greatly marveled by others as she tops the former No. 1 spot just by using a katana.', 'Ari Ozawa', '小澤亜李', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00'),
  ('a31a6c17-6608-4954-a8b1-0a686cb15cb5', 'bc428a79-6799-4750-b5d7-09e3c5500b9e', 'Claudia Enfield', 'クローディア・エンフィールド', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89061-NNF7JPp6eIMT.png', 'main', 'Claudia is the second highest ranking student of Seidoukan Academy and its Student Council President. She recommended [Ayato](https://anilist.co/character/89058)''s transfer to the academy. She has held the position of President since junior high.', 'Nao Touyama', '東山奈央', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00'),
  ('d43017a0-8b3a-44de-855f-c7fee3a3642b', 'bc428a79-6799-4750-b5d7-09e3c5500b9e', 'Saya Sasamiya', '沙々宮紗夜', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89060-HWHDapQ8Pu60.jpg', 'main', 'Saya is Ayato''s childhood friend. She moved abroad six years ago due to her father''s career. She seems to be an air-headed stoic who has trouble waking up in the morning and is directionally-challenged. She uses a 38th generation Lux grenade launcher Helnekrom but later switches to a type 41 Gleaming Form - twin particle guns Waidenholt and Type 34 wave Motion heavy artillery Ark Van Ders for the Phoenix. Like Kirin, she enters the Phoenix for her father''s sake.', 'Shiori Izawa', '井澤詩織', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.265799+00:00'),
  ('b484d3ea-23fc-4924-8c82-c14b0be489d7', '20f8667a-a388-4b13-8f58-ba0ef3f76a9f', 'Claudia Enfield', 'クローディア・エンフィールド', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89061-NNF7JPp6eIMT.png', 'main', 'Claudia is the second highest ranking student of Seidoukan Academy and its Student Council President. She recommended [Ayato](https://anilist.co/character/89058)''s transfer to the academy. She has held the position of President since junior high.', 'Erika Harlacher', '東山奈央', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00'),
  ('d4686dc4-b0f9-485d-9c20-f8643e9db1d6', '20f8667a-a388-4b13-8f58-ba0ef3f76a9f', 'Saya Sasamiya', '沙々宮紗夜', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89060-HWHDapQ8Pu60.jpg', 'main', 'Saya is Ayato''s childhood friend. She moved abroad six years ago due to her father''s career. She seems to be an air-headed stoic who has trouble waking up in the morning and is directionally-challenged. She uses a 38th generation Lux grenade launcher Helnekrom but later switches to a type 41 Gleaming Form - twin particle guns Waidenholt and Type 34 wave Motion heavy artillery Ark Van Ders for the Phoenix. Like Kirin, she enters the Phoenix for her father''s sake.', 'Sarah Williams', '井澤詩織', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00'),
  ('d7f7756f-e8e3-4edb-a67e-6df75983ee88', '20f8667a-a388-4b13-8f58-ba0ef3f76a9f', 'Kirin Toudou', '刀藤綺凛', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89059-7rHDP4oX9agO.png', 'main', 'Kirin is the top-ranking student of Seidoukan Academy. She is a shy and quiet girl who becomes the academy''s top student as a 13 year-old and has not lost to anyone until Ayato challenges her a second time. She does not have a personal lux but rather carries a katana (Senbakiri) around as a weapon which often makes her greatly marveled by others as she tops the former No. 1 spot just by using a katana.', 'Brianna Knickerbocker', '小澤亜李', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00'),
  ('5c079cd7-82d0-4951-86e0-c7a952a138f8', '20f8667a-a388-4b13-8f58-ba0ef3f76a9f', 'Ayato Amagiri', '天霧綾斗', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89058-y1gv0HgwNjJi.jpg', 'main', 'He transfers to Seidoukan Academy to investigate his sister''s disappearance and to figure out what he is supposed to do (~!he later says that it is to protect Julis!~). <br>
Ayato sports a friendly, polite, and helpful personality with a penchant for ending up in awkward situations. He is indiscriminate as to who he is being friendly to and is helpful to a fault, as well as being a bit naive. However, underneath the soft facade lies a person with an indomitable will who always tries to do the right thing, regardless of the potential trouble that he will get himself into.', 'Erik Scott Kimerer', '田丸篤志', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00'),
  ('8757a5e5-4de9-408d-8b54-63b1fb4ba2c4', '20f8667a-a388-4b13-8f58-ba0ef3f76a9f', 'Julis Alexia von Riessfeld', 'ユリス＝アレクシア・フォン・リースフェルト', 'Glühende Rose', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b85151-IxmQrAsrlmiT.png', 'main', 'Julis is the fifth ranking student of Seidoukan Academy and is Lieseltania''s First Princess. Her full name is Julis-Alexia Marie Florentia Renate von Riessfelt. She wields a rapier-type lux called Aspera Spina which she uses during the Phoenix tournament and bears the image of a flower for her power - control over flames.

She warms to [Ayato](https://anilist.co/character/89058/Amagiri-Ayato), unlike the other students with whom she is distant. She starts to like Ayato and often find herself arguing with [Saya](https://anilist.co/character/89060/Sasamiya-Saya) and [Kirin](https://anilist.co/character/89059/Toudou-Kirin) and even [Claudia](https://anilist.co/character/89061/Enfield-Claudia) for his attention.', 'Kira Buckland', '加隈亜衣', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:02.865669+00:00'),
  ('16b91924-ebaf-470a-b669-fa13db2e5d35', 'fc2cd20d-4cc8-4144-87d5-08ad89490324', 'Sofia Mertesacker', 'ソフィア・メルテザッカー', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b142384-L1TFYHLdNSdV.jpg', 'main', 'She is a voluptuous second-year exchange student from the US who is a member of the Swords of Salvation, when speaking Japanese she would add some English words into her sentence, she also uses common western expressions. During her spare time, she does volunteer work for her church.', 'Alexis Tipton', 'Machico', '2026-05-31T12:05:57.583014+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:57.583014+00:00'),
  ('019bafbc-9919-4a6a-9881-9aaad06a1301', 'a17583cc-e3a4-4831-92ac-687da5e9c7fd', 'Glenn Radars', 'グレン レーダス', 'The Fool', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/121638-ZqD3QJgOJR9M.jpg', 'main', 'Glenn is lazy, and constantly bored by everything, with his primary focus being sleeping. He becomes the substitute teacher in [Sistine](https://anilist.co/character/121639/Fibel-Sistine)''s class, after the retirement of her favorite teacher. While he may seem incompetent, he is actually very skilled in magic, but not in the traditional sense. Glenn used to be as passionate about magic as Sistine, but became disillusioned by it due to [Sara Silvers](https://anilist.co/character/191611/Silvers-Sara)'' death and his past as the infamous military assassin known as "The Fool." He developed his own type of magic, called "The Fool''s World" which negates the activation of all magic within a certain radius, including his own. However, this does not nullify spells that have already been cast. While nullifying the enemies'' magic he then beats them using superior hand-to-hand combat skills. He cannot use combat magic coherently due to it being far away from his area of expertise, but he has an in-depth understanding of the concept of all types of magic, which makes him a good instructor.', 'Jessie James Grelle', '斉藤壮馬', '2026-05-31T12:05:30.865991+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:30.865991+00:00'),
  ('a4e8998d-88aa-4a1c-9e71-74647b0b0960', 'a17583cc-e3a4-4831-92ac-687da5e9c7fd', 'Sistine Fibel', 'システィーナ フィーベル', 'Sisti, White Cat', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/121639-ptCs3mEtYCoL.jpg', 'main', 'Sistine admires magic greatly and wishes to discover the secret of the Flying Castle, which no one knows. She maintains a strict, no-nonsense demeanor throughout, and often scolds [Glenn](https://anilist.co/character/121638/Radars-Glenn) for his lackadaisical attitude. She initially hates Glenn, believing him to be as incompetent as he looked due to his lack of enthusiasm. When he actually starts doing his job, however, she begrudgingly begins to respect Glenn as a highly effective teacher. Her personality and appearance resembles [Sara Silvers](https://anilist.co/character/191611/Silvers-Sara), whom Glenn was very close to. As the series progresses, it seems as though Sistine has developed feelings for Glenn, but is too shy to speak of them. She is called "Sisti" by [Rumia](https://anilist.co/character/121640/Tingel-Rumia), and "White Cat" by Glenn.', 'Rachael Messer', '藤田茜', '2026-05-31T12:05:30.865991+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:30.865991+00:00'),
  ('c66f3965-489b-40c8-8783-17462033795a', 'a17583cc-e3a4-4831-92ac-687da5e9c7fd', 'Rumia Tingel', 'ルミア ティンジェル', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/121640-xYH4xEMQDdHO.jpg', 'main', 'Rumia is [Sistine](https://anilist.co/character/121639/Fibel-Sistine)''s best friend who lives with her family. She is close to [Glenn](https://anilist.co/character/121638/Radars-Glenn), who often treats her well, in contrast to the teasing that Sistine faces from him. ~!Rumia''s real identity is the Princess Ermiana El Kel Alzano, the "cursed" princess who was supposed to die three years ago. She possesses a high level of spiritual essence, marking her a primary target pose by greedy scientists. She remembered Glenn being the one who saved her life when he was the infamous assassin named "The Fool" three years ago.!~', 'Monica Rial', '宮本侑芽', '2026-05-31T12:05:30.865991+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:30.865991+00:00'),
  ('8647b1f1-7027-4ba4-91ce-91c78de532ca', 'caa507d0-8eb2-478b-a53d-19996f3b8883', 'Stella  Vermillion', 'ステラ・ヴァーミリオン', 'Crimson Princess', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88264-v9VFbSWtQq2C.png', 'main', 'Stella Vermillion is an A-rank Apprentice Knight and princess of the Vermillion Kingdom.

Stella initially appears to be feisty, hot-blooded, and quick to anger possibly due to her sheltered upbringing. However, later she is shown to be anything but bitter, and is even willing to admit her mistakes and be friendly with others. Despite this, she exhibits frequent bouts of jealousy especially when it comes to [Ikki](https://anilist.co/character/88265).

Stella gets agitated whenever anyone says that she is strong because she is an "A Rank" and do not see all her hard work, but Ikki Kurogane was the only one to see Stella''s hard work which was one of the reasons Stella started developing feelings for him.', 'Luci Christian', '石上静香', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00'),
  ('a9db5dd0-902d-451d-bc6f-c61d64f36ba0', 'caa507d0-8eb2-478b-a53d-19996f3b8883', 'Ikki Kurogane', '黒鉄一輝', 'Worst One. Failure Knight, Another One, Uncrowned Sword King, Kuro-bou, Seven Stars Sword King, The Heir of Ryouma, Sword God', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88265-2MlVZH85EPpR.png', 'main', 'Ikki Kurogane is an F-rank Apprentice Knight who strives to become a real Mage Knight. He is a young man of average height with dark brown hair and brown eyes.

A noble young man with a caring personality. Ikki can be very cruel under certain circumstances. When it comes dealing women of his age and the whole academy in general Ikki is really clumsy because he has no prior experience with them outside of respect towards a superior or as a knight. This really shows when he confronts Stella on that subject.

~!At the end of volume 19 Ikki and Stella get married in the Vermillion Kingdom!~', 'Clint Bickham', '逢坂良太', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00'),
  ('21218237-fbb1-441b-9177-dff0ffd20c36', 'caa507d0-8eb2-478b-a53d-19996f3b8883', 'Shizuku Kurogane', '黒鉄珠雫', 'Lorelei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89340-EtOtef39IHr7.png', 'main', '**Ranking:** A-Rank

Ikki Kurogane''s younger sister. Unlike her older brother, she was well-respected as a child and was even forgiven due to her talent as a Blazer and was the only person in their family who didn''t despise or look down on Ikki for being an F-Rank Blazer and was saddened after he left.

', 'Juliet Simmons', '東山奈央', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00'),
  ('c66ab9eb-2942-4758-9325-fb40b05a01ee', 'caa507d0-8eb2-478b-a53d-19996f3b8883', 'Nagi Arisuin', '有栖院凪', 'Alice', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/126840-pmsaPfps6tK7.jpg', 'main', 'Kurogane Shizuku''s close friend and roomate. Alice likes to give Ikki advice from time to time, and is very interested in how he is developing over time. Alice identifies as a woman, and prefers the name Alice to "Nagi". Her friends call her Alice as well. 

Alice''s Device is Darkness Hermit and her Noble Art is Shadow Bind. Her device allows Alice to create shadow portals that enable her to travel from one place to another. It also immobilizes opponents by pinning them down by their shadow.', 'Chris Patton', '浅沼晋太郎', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00'),
  ('27708f12-2551-48b5-a8a8-6a232cb5f2a1', 'caa507d0-8eb2-478b-a53d-19996f3b8883', 'Touka Toudou', '東堂刀華', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143398-ktoGOYxyGim6.jpg', 'main', 'Touka Toudou is the current student council president of Hagun Academy and is considered to be the strongest student in the school.', 'Stephanie Wittels', '金元寿子', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:44.684753+00:00'),
  ('6000e700-73ea-4fb9-82c3-4effd9afd7dc', 'fc2cd20d-4cc8-4144-87d5-08ad89490324', 'Moroha Haimura', '灰村諸葉', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88049.jpg', 'main', 'Main character of the series. Was an Ancient Dragon in his past life, and a very powerful sword user. ', 'Clifford Chapin', '石川界人', '2026-05-31T12:05:57.583014+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:57.583014+00:00'),
