  ('5532fa49-649c-4806-86f4-665a5dc0381d', 'fc2cd20d-4cc8-4144-87d5-08ad89490324', 'Haruka Momochi', '百地春鹿', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b142383-ZFcklBA736cH.jpg', 'main', 'Haruka is a second-year student and a member of the Swords of Salvation squad, though as a Shirogane she is more utilized for her speed than her fighting ability.', 'Bryn Apprill', '内田真礼', '2026-05-31T12:05:57.583014+00:00', '2026-05-31T12:05:57.583014+00:00'),
