  ('e5e12b27-ffe9-4c95-8cd1-cf6404d3d868', 'b83b2a3c-a15d-4e44-847a-9bce425fada9', 'Rin Nanakura', '七倉凛', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140039-cAGR64s5lOBe.png', 'main', 'Rin Nanakura is the main protagonist of Pseudo Harem. She is a part of Kouban High''s drama club and uses her acting skills to tease her fellow club member, [Eiji Kitahama](https://anilist.co/character/140040), with various personas in hopes of making him fall for her.

She has a friendly personality, although she is somewhat shy about her feelings for her crush, leading her to adopt a pseudo-personality for his enjoyment. She can also make others laugh and enjoy laughing herself.

Rin is a highly skilled actress who can imitate various personality types of girls for Eiji, including cheeky, tsundere, "cool," and cute. She''s also a hard worker.', 'Saori Hayami', '早見沙織', '2026-05-31T17:25:05.748641+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:05.748641+00:00'),
  ('291b7d14-4054-4c64-aaf3-88310cd89ec9', 'b83b2a3c-a15d-4e44-847a-9bce425fada9', 'Eiji Kitahama', '北浜英二', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140040-THXGShpmDQwl.jpg', 'main', 'Eiji Kitahama is the love interest of [Rin Nanakura](https://anilist.co/character/140039). While attending Kouban High, he meets Rin at his drama club. Rin decides to fulfill his wish of having a harem.', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto', '岡本信彦', '2026-05-31T17:25:05.748641+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:05.748641+00:00'),
