A proud virgin who believes that there can''t be sex without love. As he stays on Seiran Island and dodges the "SS" committee, he launches the "NLNS (No Love, No Sex)" campaign in order to rebel against the island''s deranged laws and customs.', 'Zack Maher', '柳晃平', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.556874+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.556874+00:00'),
  ('b0e19978-8841-4574-a6fb-52ae922f8afc', '3a36db9a-00b9-4c67-82d1-32f6084ddbb1', 'Asane Tachibana', '橘麻沙音', 'Asa-chan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308853-lYKUS42fgaW5.png', 'main', 'Junnosuke''s sister who understands him the most. She dislikes normal men but loves her older brother and women, especially older and perverted women. Most of the time Asane is relaxed but as soon as she sees a woman who is her type, she loses control of herself completely. Her dream is to have a threesome with her brother and his girlfriend.', 'Chloe Eves', '小秋あこ', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.556874+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.556874+00:00'),
