Contrary to her young and loli appearance, Hinami is a third-year student. She is very kind and has a big heart, and hates constantly being referred to as a loli or a child. She also carries a chair around with her to help her reach high places due to her small stature.', 'Amber May', '小澤みのり', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.556874+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.556874+00:00'),
