  ('9be8be91-6823-4e7c-9e2f-fab80c24b198', '7b8b27d5-49d6-4c33-9ce2-2ede837c0a2e', 'Nanase Katagiri', '片桐奈々瀬', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308859-rp3DWYLkp28l.png', 'main', 'The most charismatic and popular "slut" of the school. There are a lot of rumors of Nanase being an uncontrollable sex queen, but in reality Nanase is a virgin and people base everything on her looks. She often uses this to her advantage when attempting to escape.', 'Shizuka Ishigami', '石上静香', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.564036+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.564036+00:00'),
  ('940f4971-25ed-49e0-837a-8f762410c094', '7b8b27d5-49d6-4c33-9ce2-2ede837c0a2e', 'Fumino Kotoyose', '琴寄文乃', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308862-yBHTTLNHe2Gv.png', 'main', 'A mysterious girl who can often be seen aiding the NLNS with her sniping skills from a distance. Is not very talkative due to not interacting with people very often, but is a very earnest girl who has tremendous respect for those who have a strong conviction.

~!She is the illegitimate child of Governor Hitoura, which is the reason everyone belives she is the key to breaking the Perverted Ordinance.!~', 'Ui Fuyukawa', '冬川羽衣', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.564036+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:25:21.564036+00:00'),
  ('cb73ba8d-3e0a-4299-8a87-14c079cfc273', '1195890f-7cd7-43ca-8446-9da6030089d9', 'Haruko Amaya', '天谷春恋', 'Haru-nee', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13390-D3OmKY9pZrLO.png', 'main', 'Called the strongest maiden in Tenbi by Kodama Himegami and the Vice-President of the student council. She is the childhood friend of Takeru Ooyama and has romantic feelings for him often not caring when her body is revealed in front of him. She shares a room with Takeru Ooyama, Kodama Himegame and Inaho Kushiya.  She wields one of the eight (8) legendary maken, "Murakumo" meaning "Gathering Clouds". Her maken allows her to turn her element into photons around the blade. Murakumo''s seal cannot be broken unless it reacts to opponents on par with its power. However, Haruko was able to unleash a little of the maken''s power through her anger. ', 'Monica Rial', '下屋則子', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.895184+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.895184+00:00'),
  ('d6ffffa8-a4fd-40b9-85d4-c8898995babf', '1195890f-7cd7-43ca-8446-9da6030089d9', 'Kodama Himegami', '姫神コダマ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13391-yl62yFPi5khJ.png', 'main', 'Wields shikigami that follow her around and call her ojou-sama. She needs element to survive, it has not fully been stated what exactly she is. But she has said to herself that she can''t leave the tenbi area because the element doesn''t flow as fully elsewhere.    ~!Which is why she went out to get a stone full of element so she could travel to the training grounds for the summer vacation.   She stated that Takeru Ohyama is her mortal enemy after she saw the mark on his chest. Although its has yet to be confirmed if she still feels that way as she has kissed him on a few occasions leaving the cast a bit bewildered and annoyed. She can give her shikigami life and bring them into the real world so everyone can see them, giving them a human body in which they can fight with. It is hinted that she has a weakness for cute things, specifically rare and inexpensive stuff animal toys when she forgave the Finians when they tricked her because if she forgave them, she can have the rare king penguin stoffed toy. She is also deathly afraid of ghosts and other supernatural beings. Even becoming scared of a scary story that the story-teller openly admit that he made up the half rest of the story.!~  (Source: Wikipedia)', 'Elizabeth Maxwell', '矢作紗友里', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.895184+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.895184+00:00'),
  ('a082f457-961c-4422-89b7-cb69c015f150', '1195890f-7cd7-43ca-8446-9da6030089d9', 'Takeru Ooyama', '大山タケル', 'Take-chan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13389-qJp8nAWczqMp.png', 'main', 'A perverted high school student. He hates his father believing him to be the reason his mother died. He wields a power known as "blood pointer" which allows him to drain "element" from the people around him through his mouth. He has periodically used this ability throughout the series without knowing it. After the battle with the Venus unit he has begun to undergo training to understand this power and use it. He is the childhood friend of Haruko Ayama.   His maken is known as "Overblow", which lets him cause his opponent''s maken to gain incredible power and overflow with element causing it to go out of control and force the user to not be able to use it. However, when his opponent is able to contain the overflow of element or has perfect control over his maken, it would only provide his opponent greater power or even make the maken evolve into something greater.   (Source: Wikipedia)', 'Ian Sinclair', '前野智昭', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.895184+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.895184+00:00'),
  ('8c0c2d69-2b70-4240-8d42-c0b859247b9c', '1195890f-7cd7-43ca-8446-9da6030089d9', 'Inaho Kushiya', '櫛八イナホ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13392-tZwjkMmGb2n3.png', 'main', 'Self proclaimed fiancée of Takeru Ooyama. She feels strongly for Takeru Ooyama, and although he doesn''t remember her much she has decided to wait until he fully does.     Her maken, "Kamudo", takes the shape of a gauntlet that when brandished, greatly increases her strength and speed as demonstrated in chapter 7 when she used it to protect Takeru and the cat (later named Monji) he had saved by breaking a huge rock falling on them and then rushing in front of them to deflect the broken fragments. However, overusing it puts enough stress on her to knock her unconscious.', 'Tia Ballard', '野水伊織', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.895184+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.895184+00:00'),
  ('2187c84a-77fd-4b5e-85a3-695877a9f799', '69ab1563-abdd-468e-b1d3-e1c645a2e382', 'Haruko Amaya', '天谷春恋', 'Haru-nee', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13390-D3OmKY9pZrLO.png', 'main', 'Called the strongest maiden in Tenbi by Kodama Himegami and the Vice-President of the student council. She is the childhood friend of Takeru Ooyama and has romantic feelings for him often not caring when her body is revealed in front of him. She shares a room with Takeru Ooyama, Kodama Himegame and Inaho Kushiya.  She wields one of the eight (8) legendary maken, "Murakumo" meaning "Gathering Clouds". Her maken allows her to turn her element into photons around the blade. Murakumo''s seal cannot be broken unless it reacts to opponents on par with its power. However, Haruko was able to unleash a little of the maken''s power through her anger. ', 'Monica Rial', '下屋則子', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.949411+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.949411+00:00'),
