  ('ce23e0f2-2f51-4b4d-9b1a-dd067cee5a21', '10f3ee97-d8d3-4c6f-bb54-6b0a042172ec', 'Ilya Ilyukhin', 'イリヤ・イリューヒン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268375-2GQBfW9gzOYj.png', 'main', 'Ilya Ilyukhin is a transfer student from Bulgaria (Russia in the manga from chapter 2 onwards).

In anime episode 4/manga chapter 8: ~!her true gender is revealed as female when she undresses at a ryokan.!~', 'Juliet Simmons', '高橋李依', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00'),
