  ('e2700c80-2b65-4aff-9ed4-21fd0740bd23', 'b9a72599-cd7d-43ed-bbaa-1377b0b985c2', 'Aki Nijou', '二条秋', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19604-beWfPSimqZtM.png', 'main', 'The school nurse. She is also the staff-advisor (sort of a "teacher overseer") of Maken-Ki. She was in the Maken-Ki of the school before it became an all-girl''s school. She has absurdly huge breasts, possibly the largest of the cast, which attracts the attention of all male students and the envy of girls around her.', 'Hitomi Harada', '原田ひとみ', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.962676+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.962676+00:00'),
