  ('c41e7846-f1c8-493f-85db-e4178cd79207', '39362d04-acea-43a8-8868-087cafd62077', 'Takeru Ooyama', '大山タケル', 'Take-chan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13389-qJp8nAWczqMp.png', 'main', 'A perverted high school student. He hates his father believing him to be the reason his mother died. He wields a power known as "blood pointer" which allows him to drain "element" from the people around him through his mouth. He has periodically used this ability throughout the series without knowing it. After the battle with the Venus unit he has begun to undergo training to understand this power and use it. He is the childhood friend of Haruko Ayama.   His maken is known as "Overblow", which lets him cause his opponent''s maken to gain incredible power and overflow with element causing it to go out of control and force the user to not be able to use it. However, when his opponent is able to contain the overflow of element or has perfect control over his maken, it would only provide his opponent greater power or even make the maken evolve into something greater.   (Source: Wikipedia)', 'Ian Sinclair', '前野智昭', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.96453+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:23.96453+00:00'),
  ('f03c1701-32cc-49e7-a566-608d443ebde2', 'f7a63420-9497-48d9-9835-e2be7fc79f33', 'Haruko Amaya', '天谷春恋', 'Haru-nee', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13390-D3OmKY9pZrLO.png', 'main', 'Called the strongest maiden in Tenbi by Kodama Himegami and the Vice-President of the student council. She is the childhood friend of Takeru Ooyama and has romantic feelings for him often not caring when her body is revealed in front of him. She shares a room with Takeru Ooyama, Kodama Himegame and Inaho Kushiya.  She wields one of the eight (8) legendary maken, "Murakumo" meaning "Gathering Clouds". Her maken allows her to turn her element into photons around the blade. Murakumo''s seal cannot be broken unless it reacts to opponents on par with its power. However, Haruko was able to unleash a little of the maken''s power through her anger. ', 'Noriko Shitaya', '下屋則子', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00'),
  ('f99f3009-6555-4d13-8106-f7f82c6948a7', '10f3ee97-d8d3-4c6f-bb54-6b0a042172ec', 'Mongfa Bai', '白夢華', 'バイ・モンファ', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268374-IUHWF8exOlFj.png', 'main', 'Bai has a calm and easy-going personality. To her students, she is more like an older sister than a teacher. She is a strong person at school, but when she goes home, she can be a bit childish and a bit of a screw-up. She also has a clumsy side. She is a teacher from China.', 'Maggie Flecknoe', '金元寿子', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00'),
  ('8f730635-805c-4781-bccd-9438d4412c5e', '10f3ee97-d8d3-4c6f-bb54-6b0a042172ec', 'Karin Istel', 'カリン・イステル', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268378-C79U4gOgMzN4.png', 'main', 'Karin is sometimes self-conscious, but she has a cheerful personality and is well-liked by everyone around her. She is also active as a model and is gaining popularity in Japan. She is a transfer student from Germany.', 'Marika Kouno', '高野麻里佳', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00'),
