  ('6548164b-fade-4fca-bdf1-7876d2f92709', 'f7a63420-9497-48d9-9835-e2be7fc79f33', 'Syria Ootsuka', 'シリア大塚', 'Celia Ootsuka', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b39893-vylLpWJjxkfV.png', 'main', 'She is an American "idol" superstar and is the Venus Unit: Defense Member. She is shown as someone with amazing strength and is well-known through her singing/dancing career as an "idol" as well as a professional wrestler.   Her jingu is an internal-type named "Inverse". Its ability is to "reverse" situations at her will. Her ability is not limited to reversing forces, but could even reverse the will of her opponent (as seen when she reversed Takeru''s will to attack him during their battle).  ~! Celia however, is originally male. "Inverse" even gives him the ability to change his gender and physical appearance at will including the reason why his eyes have a heart shaped pupil when a girl. She possesses the ability to become either male or female including characteristics and emotions. Celia is aiming to become a real woman, and is referred to as an okama.!~  -Wikipedia', 'Mariya Ise', '伊瀬茉莉也', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00'),
  ('bbbe2c91-c9bf-446e-9853-7a4b75a8dc1d', 'f7a63420-9497-48d9-9835-e2be7fc79f33', 'Aki Nijou', '二条秋', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19604-beWfPSimqZtM.png', 'main', 'The school nurse. She is also the staff-advisor (sort of a "teacher overseer") of Maken-Ki. She was in the Maken-Ki of the school before it became an all-girl''s school. She has absurdly huge breasts, possibly the largest of the cast, which attracts the attention of all male students and the envy of girls around her.', 'Hitomi Harada', '原田ひとみ', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00'),
  ('4dacca1c-5707-447d-9b87-9a06bf603ce3', 'f7a63420-9497-48d9-9835-e2be7fc79f33', 'Azuki Shinatsu', '志那都アズキ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b47903-0hsXXHHQYhRs.png', 'main', 'She is one of the four students to be selected to show how to duel on the first day. She uses air magic, which she uses shoes to allow her to be in mid-flight. Also she is a member of the Maken-ki club which calms down disturbances in the co-ed school.', 'Misuzu Togashi', '富樫美鈴', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00'),
  ('dd7ab200-eb01-4d24-877f-1c14ab04e0b6', 'f7a63420-9497-48d9-9835-e2be7fc79f33', 'Inaho Kushiya', '櫛八イナホ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13392-tZwjkMmGb2n3.png', 'main', 'Self proclaimed fiancée of Takeru Ooyama. She feels strongly for Takeru Ooyama, and although he doesn''t remember her much she has decided to wait until he fully does.     Her maken, "Kamudo", takes the shape of a gauntlet that when brandished, greatly increases her strength and speed as demonstrated in chapter 7 when she used it to protect Takeru and the cat (later named Monji) he had saved by breaking a huge rock falling on them and then rushing in front of them to deflect the broken fragments. However, overusing it puts enough stress on her to knock her unconscious.', 'Iori Nomizu', '野水伊織', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:24.461788+00:00'),
  ('b4070b12-6c97-490b-9e21-740b7c460c90', '19a5ce53-86b0-4d67-9d9f-ec159d7359a3', 'Michio Kaga', '加賀道夫', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268339-N7MpnVcrrW4o.jpg', 'main', NULL, 'Taku Yashiro', '八代拓', '2026-05-31T17:26:59.379643+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:59.379643+00:00'),
  ('1aab7c56-784f-4cf6-951a-461b11d45650', '19a5ce53-86b0-4d67-9d9f-ec159d7359a3', 'Roxanne', 'ロクサーヌ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141842-COxvdfYzbbRi.jpg', 'main', 'She is a beast warrior that was enslaved so her family could afford taxes. She willingly let her family sell her as a slave and was bought by a big slave company. Roxanne is only level six at her first appearance. She is a wolf girl as well to top it off with beautiful, chestnut colored hair and dog-like ears that flop around, with a small trail of hair going down her neck to the top of her back. She was a highly recommended slave among the batch as she is easy to control and would listen to her master''s orders no matter what.', 'Shiori Mikami', '三上枝織', '2026-05-31T17:26:59.379643+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:59.379643+00:00'),
  ('c2d00eec-5dc1-49f8-9149-d914cdee1449', '6572f9f9-075f-4f27-a5be-2af3b85659ef', 'Michio Kaga', '加賀道夫', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268339-N7MpnVcrrW4o.jpg', 'main', NULL, 'Taku Yashiro', '八代拓', '2026-05-31T17:26:59.422649+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:59.422649+00:00'),
  ('9316c6d3-b9f0-4f26-a778-86867cc492a6', '6572f9f9-075f-4f27-a5be-2af3b85659ef', 'Roxanne', 'ロクサーヌ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141842-COxvdfYzbbRi.jpg', 'main', 'She is a beast warrior that was enslaved so her family could afford taxes. She willingly let her family sell her as a slave and was bought by a big slave company. Roxanne is only level six at her first appearance. She is a wolf girl as well to top it off with beautiful, chestnut colored hair and dog-like ears that flop around, with a small trail of hair going down her neck to the top of her back. She was a highly recommended slave among the batch as she is easy to control and would listen to her master''s orders no matter what.', 'Shiori Mikami', '三上枝織', '2026-05-31T17:26:59.422649+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:26:59.422649+00:00'),
  ('afbbaea4-bcc9-438c-a0bb-f5ff018dc46f', 'd9b64d5b-c5ec-42bf-9c7e-1cc76ccbfc3e', 'Kurena Kukumila', 'クレナ・ククミラ', 'Gunslinger', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174873-FNf08aPYTVXY.jpg', 'main', '__Height:__ 160 cm

Kurena Kukumila is a platoon leader of Eighty-Sixth Strike Package''s Spearhead Squadron. She is the squadron''s long-range specialist. Her Personal Name is Gunslinger. Having survived four years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, she is considered one of the most elite Processors alive.
', 'Erica Mendez', '鈴代紗弓', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00'),
  ('7d72444d-393e-4b13-a4bd-b75c40721a80', '9e4472c0-0e09-4948-b493-0bd8e53429cf', 'Lancelot', 'ランスロット', 'Prince of the Lake, Lance, Yousei (妖精), Fairy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b265209-NAHBUq0SX3Vb.png', 'main', 'Lancelot is the son of [Ban](https://anilist.co/character/77605/Ban) and [Elaine](https://anilist.co/character/86681/Elaine). He is also a Holy Knight of Liones, and one of the Four Knights of the Apocalypse.', 'Aleks Le', '内山昂輝', '2026-05-31T19:37:10.416059+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:10.416059+00:00'),
  ('69c7fb5d-1e88-4d04-9a44-22f5fdfed1ca', '10f3ee97-d8d3-4c6f-bb54-6b0a042172ec', 'Asahi Kashiwagi', '柏樹朝', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268373-5nH8siwb5HAg.png', 'main', 'He is an ordinary high school boy who can be found anywhere. One day, however, he suddenly finds himself caught in a love storm with five transfer students.', 'Jeremy  Gee', '逢坂良太', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00'),
  ('eb63e34f-1310-4924-92ab-1f7f75801b2a', '10f3ee97-d8d3-4c6f-bb54-6b0a042172ec', 'Aoi Izumisawa', '和泉沢愛生', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268376-OgfGyjvXyZXK.png', 'main', 'Aoi is a cheerful and honest yet reticent girl with a knack for household work. She is also a bright, energetic and straightforward girl who transferred to the Asahi''s class. Being a modest person, she is the leader of the class. She is also a jealous type.', 'Natalie Rial', '伊藤美来', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00'),
  ('87a373e7-565e-4f78-9318-256d2fc4a528', '10f3ee97-d8d3-4c6f-bb54-6b0a042172ec', 'Amelia Irving', 'アメリア・アーヴィング', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268377-uUfT6YTasbaB.png', 'main', 'Amelia is an innocent, but also clumsy and selfish girl. She expresses her affection directly and tends to go out of control. She has a personality that makes it difficult for her to speak her mind, making her a "tsundere". She is a transfer student from the United States. ', 'Brittney Karbowski', '竹達彩奈', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:28:38.307697+00:00'),
  ('3f1386fb-b438-4648-a49d-2ee87d77072b', '35262705-66fd-49ad-908a-61fa0c90a92f', 'Shinei Nouzen', 'シンエイ・ノウゼン', 'Shin, Reaper, Undertaker', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141060-ZJFvHqBBSvhN.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 175 cm

Shinei Nouzen is the field commander of Spearhead Squadron. His Personal Name is Undertaker.
Having survived five years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, he is considered one of the most elite Processors alive. Among the Eighty-Six, he is known as the Reaper of the Eastern Front. His ability to hear the voices of the Legion allows him to locate the Legion without the use of detection systems like radar.

Born on May 19th in Republic Year 351, Shin lived with his family in the First Sector of the Republic before the war with the Giadian Empire began. It is implied he lived a sheltered life, surrounded by "only kindness and affection". He also appeared to have developed his extrasensory ability early on, hearing "voices that spoke without words" from his family.

~!He would often play with the daughter of his father''s colleague, [Henrietta von Penrose](https://anilist.co/character/210923/von-Penrose-Henrietta), whom Shin called Rita.!~', 'Billy Kametz', '千葉翔也', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.97972+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.97972+00:00'),
  ('58cbf751-675f-4ee3-9750-90349659eb81', '35262705-66fd-49ad-908a-61fa0c90a92f', 'Vladilena Milizé', 'ヴラディレーナ・ミリーゼ', 'Lena, Handler One, 鮮血の女王', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141061-jqIhB9jmClQ3.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 160 cm

Vladilena Milizé, more commonly known as Lena by her friends and as Handler One to her subordinates, is an elite Republic commissioned officer who rose to the rank of Major at the young age of 16. She is the commander of [Shinei Nouzen](https://anilist.co/character/141060/Nouzen-Shinei) and the Spearhead Squadron, whom she communicates with via the long-distance communication device known as the Para-RAID. 

~!After the Spearhead Squadron''s departure, she becomes known for demanding orders and highly competent leadership, earning the nickname of Bloody Regina among the Processors.!~ ', 'Suzie Yeung', '長谷川育美', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.97972+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.97972+00:00'),
  ('91f76583-fa9a-447e-949c-296a5fda4340', 'd9b64d5b-c5ec-42bf-9c7e-1cc76ccbfc3e', 'Shinei Nouzen', 'シンエイ・ノウゼン', 'Shin, Reaper, Undertaker', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141060-ZJFvHqBBSvhN.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 175 cm

Shinei Nouzen is the field commander of Spearhead Squadron. His Personal Name is Undertaker.
Having survived five years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, he is considered one of the most elite Processors alive. Among the Eighty-Six, he is known as the Reaper of the Eastern Front. His ability to hear the voices of the Legion allows him to locate the Legion without the use of detection systems like radar.

Born on May 19th in Republic Year 351, Shin lived with his family in the First Sector of the Republic before the war with the Giadian Empire began. It is implied he lived a sheltered life, surrounded by "only kindness and affection". He also appeared to have developed his extrasensory ability early on, hearing "voices that spoke without words" from his family.

~!He would often play with the daughter of his father''s colleague, [Henrietta von Penrose](https://anilist.co/character/210923/von-Penrose-Henrietta), whom Shin called Rita.!~', 'Billy Kametz', '千葉翔也', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00'),
  ('deb31726-cf79-4c71-bcda-5165003ab896', 'd9b64d5b-c5ec-42bf-9c7e-1cc76ccbfc3e', 'Anju Emma', 'アンジュ・エマ', 'Snow Witch', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174875-PvSTadcuATtH.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 170 cm

Anju Emma is a platoon member and later platoon leader of the Eighty-Sixth Strike Package''s Spearhead Squadron. She serves as their support fire and artillery provider. Her Personal Name is Snow Witch. Having survived four years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, she is considered one of the most elite Processors alive.
', 'Maureen Price', '早見沙織', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00'),
  ('0f212c9a-029c-43e7-a608-c98a4893eeb3', 'd9b64d5b-c5ec-42bf-9c7e-1cc76ccbfc3e', 'Theoto Rikka', 'セオト・リッカ', 'Laughing Fox, Theo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174874-19TPZgyNwDtj.jpg', 'main', '__Height:__ 165 cm 

Theoto Rikka is a platoon leader of the Eighty-Sixth Strike Package''s Spearhead Squadron and the artist of the squadron member''s Personal Marks. His Personal Name is Laughing Fox. Having survived four years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, he is considered one of the most elite Processors alive.
', 'Casey Mongillo', '藤原夏海', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00'),
  ('878f6f07-cec2-40c5-909b-9825b73a87f7', 'd9b64d5b-c5ec-42bf-9c7e-1cc76ccbfc3e', 'Frederica Rosenfort', 'フレデリカ・ローゼンフォルト', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b161718-kWIdyUGRk0wj.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 130cm

A girl Shin and his team met at Ernst''s residence after being provided shelter by the Federacy. She is assigned as the Mascot to the Spearhead Squadron. She has an intelligence and a manner of speech well beyond her young age of ten.

~!She is the last empress of the Federal Empire of Giad, having been secretly rescued by Ernst during the coup against the nobility. Her royal bloodline imparts her the gift of seeing the past and present of people she has known.

She was protected by Kiriya Nouzen, a distant relative of Shin from the Nouzen clan and is on the lookout for him after he was assimilated by the Legion as a Black Sheep, having failed to protect his princess. Shin''s personality constantly reminds her of Kiri and she treats him as a surrogate big brother.!~', 'Kimberley Anne Campbell', '久野美咲', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00'),
  ('0ab2fc73-88f2-4b61-85d9-286629e22441', 'd9b64d5b-c5ec-42bf-9c7e-1cc76ccbfc3e', 'Raiden Shuga', 'ライデン・シュガ', 'Wehrwolf', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174872-HrQxhw9BbfyI.jpg', 'main', '__Height:__ 185 cm

Raiden Shuga is the vice captain of Spearhead Squadron. As a First Lieutenant, he holds the position of operations commander of the Eighty-Sixth Strike Package and its 1st Armored Division should Shin be deemed unfit to command. His Personal Name is Wehrwolf. Having survived four years on the Eastern Front and the Special Reconnaissance Mission, he is considered one of the most elite Processors alive. As he spent three years with Shin prior to joining Spearhead Squadron, Raiden is the closest person to him in the squadron.', 'Jonah Scott', '山下誠一郎', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00', '2026-05-31T17:31:34.995191+00:00'),
  ('93057048-a7bb-426b-beae-afec843f5e66', '5040d00f-8524-49d8-b69f-6d27ca1b473b', 'Sitan', '斯坦', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268286-AuOBQJHBk2oi.png', 'main', NULL, 'Jinwen Chen', '陈锦闻', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00'),
  ('7e788cf1-c17f-4a8e-be37-e7986818ebb4', '5040d00f-8524-49d8-b69f-6d27ca1b473b', 'Dora', '朵拉', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268285-is0BUJ8ueUsd.png', 'main', NULL, 'Wenxiao He', '贺文潇', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00'),
  ('0e42049b-966f-4ad0-a4ee-587ebbcdd7b6', '5040d00f-8524-49d8-b69f-6d27ca1b473b', 'Miaowu', '喵呜', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268288-aDyseHwdZ7gr.png', 'main', NULL, 'Yumeng Zhang', '张雨濛', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00'),
  ('b8281586-0ed3-4074-97d1-421935e56281', '5040d00f-8524-49d8-b69f-6d27ca1b473b', 'Ajie', '阿杰', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268284-VVb02jotaYwe.png', 'main', NULL, 'Weiyi Yun', '云惟一', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00'),
  ('733065cb-3d02-4d14-9b45-89773c34cc65', '5040d00f-8524-49d8-b69f-6d27ca1b473b', 'Hana', '哈娜', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268287-1Fpssvt8waDS.png', 'main', NULL, 'Jinger Wang', '王婧儿', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:28.48427+00:00'),
  ('d9e8529b-80c3-4842-8023-b10e6a50115d', '479769d9-d48c-4a9c-8318-2662e34fe71a', 'Al Wayne', 'アル・ウェイン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b276597-fXMJOsrnlb6h.jpg', 'main', 'Dedicated and hard-working, Al is a diligent farmer who always prefers farming the most above anything else. He is quite an oddball since he thinks of himself as a typical farmer; even his surrounding people notice that his skills are not just of "farmer". This farmer craze drives him to the extreme to the point where he''d rather die if he were to offer a job other than farming.

He is a kind and helpful person as he always tries to help people if they''re in need. Even with his high stats and valuable skills, he never acts arrogant, wanting to keep a low profile as he does not want to stand out much for anything.', 'Antonio  Lasanta', '榎木淳弥', '2026-05-31T18:42:46.14119+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:46.14119+00:00'),
  ('ccbdcaf4-4369-4217-a923-077487d61772', '479769d9-d48c-4a9c-8318-2662e34fe71a', 'Fal Meigis', 'ファル・イース・メイギス', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b276598-PvvRpGyO4IAh.jpg', 'main', 'She is the crown princess of Meigis. While a knight-class man was abducting her, Al Wayne saved her, causing her to be infatuated with him.

As a crown princess, Fal is a dignified beauty who puts her citizens and beloved before her. She treats everyone with equality and compassion. Nevertheless, she is a qualified future queen for her wisdom. But, while being such a person, she is unusually stubborn and does not tolerate discrimination.', 'Luci Christian', '田中美海', '2026-05-31T18:42:46.14119+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:46.14119+00:00'),
  ('3765f0c3-cdc4-4b81-b44c-9a6a0eaf241b', '479769d9-d48c-4a9c-8318-2662e34fe71a', 'Helen Lean', 'ヘレン・リーン', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b276599-AtSYaz9AeHqi.jpg', 'main', 'Helen is a kind and friendly person who gets along well with others. As a result of the trauma from Ouroboros''s attack on her village and the curse he placed on her, Helen suffered amnesia save for her name. After recovering her memory, she became consumed with despair until Al delivered a message from her brother''s ghost urging her to live. After making peace with her grief, she decides to use the power she inherited from Ouroboros to protect others and starts to adventure herself in addition to her receptionist job.', 'Elissa Cuellar', '大久保瑠美', '2026-05-31T18:42:46.14119+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:46.14119+00:00'),
  ('e5f1cf0e-9c72-432e-9013-1c988ed34eb0', '479769d9-d48c-4a9c-8318-2662e34fe71a', 'Ruri', 'ルリ', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b276600-wTt9Ja1odxfN.jpg', 'main', 'Ruri is the descendant of the hero, who is on a journey to become a full-fledged hero.

Despite being a descendant of the Hero, Ruri failed to manifest his power and was frequently bullied by others as being a failure. Despite encouragement from her parents to walk her own path, Ruri considered herself a disappointment and struggled with her self-esteem. After encountering Al and being reminded of what it means to be a hero, Ruri finally found the confidence to tap into her ancestor''s power as well as falling in love with Al.', 'Kristen McGuire', '諏訪彩花', '2026-05-31T18:42:46.14119+00:00', '2026-05-31T18:42:46.14119+00:00'),
  ('2f183e80-b162-46b6-b763-2a217c67e9a5', 'acc5effb-4627-4704-a837-dd8792d09ce9', 'Mingfei Lu', '路明非', 'Ricardo M Lu (李嘉图·M·路), 小魔鬼, ルー・ミンフェイ', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b271923-BzUjdkYiu2ul.png', 'main', '__Level:__ S

The only S-class student at Kassel College, he lived in his uncle''s house when he was very young. It is said that his parents were far away on the other side of the ocean, engaged in important research, but he never met him. Lu Mingfei also had a vague impression of his parents. It was not until one day that he suddenly received an admission letter from Kassel College, and the ignorant boy was about to start his legendary life.
', 'Daiki Yamashita', '山下大輝', '2026-05-31T19:30:43.86746+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:30:43.86746+00:00'),
  ('7ae00cf3-5664-4ec8-8ff4-5020b23a225a', 'dc09d33b-392c-463c-ad57-4c397e2d5a37', 'Mingfei Lu', '路明非', 'Ricardo M Lu (李嘉图·M·路), 小魔鬼, ルー・ミンフェイ', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b271923-BzUjdkYiu2ul.png', 'main', '__Level:__ S

The only S-class student at Kassel College, he lived in his uncle''s house when he was very young. It is said that his parents were far away on the other side of the ocean, engaged in important research, but he never met him. Lu Mingfei also had a vague impression of his parents. It was not until one day that he suddenly received an admission letter from Kassel College, and the ignorant boy was about to start his legendary life.
', 'Jinwen Chen', '陈锦闻', '2026-05-31T19:30:43.872827+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:30:43.872827+00:00');

~!Little is known about his true origins; he claims to have lived for thousands of years and knowing Lu Mingfei for just as long. His current story begins in Herzog''s research facility in Black Swan Bay, where he was found by [Renata](https://anilist.co/character/302674/Ling), a fellow orphan. Since Herzog kept him locked in "Room zero", he adopted "Zero" (Usually shortened to Z) as his name. He became friends with [Renata](https://anilist.co/character/302674/Ling) and they attempted to escape the facility together, making an oath to stay by each other''s side.!~', 'Xiaoning Zhou', '周湘宁', '2026-05-31T19:30:43.872827+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:30:43.872827+00:00'),
  ('ae59797b-1824-4d69-a3b3-efbbc4e11ed5', '5e3ef00f-2674-4bba-801b-6c8663094ad1', 'Yuuichirou Hyakuya', '百夜優一郎', '', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83015-XmUdY42WSKRG.png', 'main', '__Height:__ 170 cm (5''7")

Yuuichirou is a member of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and Shinoa Hiragi''s squad in the Moon Demon Company. He, along with Mikaela Hyakuya, possesses the "Seraph" gene, which is relevant to the forbidden taboo and the focal point of the story, "Seraph of the End".

Yuuichirou seems to be an excellent swordsman, as he was trained by Guren himself. He is also a "seraph of the end" with 1/10th of him being not human; he may have been experimented on by the Hyakuya, but this is unclear since the adults in charge of him were killed minutes after he arrived at the orphanage.', 'Miyu Irino', '入野自由', '2026-05-31T19:33:49.839989+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:33:49.839989+00:00'),
