A member of the Japanese Imperial Demon Army and a member of Yuu''s team of the Moon Demon Squad. She also the younger sister of Aoi Sanguu.

Mitsuba is shown to be a serious and by-the-book soldier, who dislikes those who break the formation and commit to individual action. In reality, she is a talkative, selfish girl. Despite this, she gets jealous easily. Mitsuba appears to be the most talkative girl in her group. ', 'Alex Moore', 'Alex Moore', '2026-05-31T19:33:49.81663+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:33:49.81663+00:00'),
