A member of the Seven Deadly Sins and is known as Lion''s Sin of Pride. He is renowned for gaining immense power during the day, and gradually becoming weaker with the setting of the sun, leaving him frail and submissive at night. His Sacred Treasure is the Divine Axe Rhitta. His inherent power is named Sunshine.', 'Kyle Hebert', '杉田智和', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00'),
  ('6cdbae10-bdae-4d56-b419-38a08810d4d6', 'f9c51840-6278-4d22-b6c0-3e31d9bf05d7', 'Elizabeth Liones', 'エリザベス・リオネス', 'Ellie, Elie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b72923-Hidpb955mwMW.png', 'main', 'Elizabeth Liones is the third adoptive princess of the Kingdom of Liones Originally an alleged survivor of Danafor''s destruction, Elizabeth was adopted and raised by the king Bartra Liones. After the Holy Knights rebel, she sets on journey to find Seven Deadly Sins, becoming a waitress for Meliodas'' tavern Boar Hat.

~!She is 107th and current incarnation of the Goddess Elizabeth, and the lover of Meliodas, captain of the Seven Deadly Sins. She is the deuteragonist of the series..!~', 'Erika Harlacher', '雨宮天', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00'),
  ('1fa4975f-5fd3-42a4-83b2-ba21499f55fb', 'f9c51840-6278-4d22-b6c0-3e31d9bf05d7', 'Hawk', 'ホーク', 'Hawky, Pork, Pig, Captain of the Knights of Leftovers Disposal, Power Level Obsessed, Lord Piglet', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n86683-ZXPoLZnKqNtx.png', 'main', 'Hawk is a talking pig and Meliodas''s companion. He is introduced as the cleaner of the Boar Hat bar who helps clean the disgusting food scraps. He is a relatively large pink pig who wears an earring with the word star boar on his left ear. His body is well rounded and his legs are fairly short. He has a unique patch of black spots shaped like a four-leafed clover. His body and appearance are fairly similar to a typical Gloucestershire Old Spots Pig. ', 'Cristina Vee', '久野美咲', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00'),
  ('697f7a99-235a-4157-902a-0c28b0dc41fc', 'f9c51840-6278-4d22-b6c0-3e31d9bf05d7', 'Solada', 'ソラーダ', 'Sorada', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n131251-iB9bO6g7YgYv.jpg', 'main', 'Solada is a member of the Winged People Clan', 'Johnny Yong Bosch', '代永翼', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00'),
  ('5e6a411f-b886-4197-82ed-5470bbe226ea', 'f9c51840-6278-4d22-b6c0-3e31d9bf05d7', 'Diane', 'ディアンヌ', 'Serpent''s Sin of Envy ', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b74653-XpMcsLVZBnkZ.jpg', 'main', 'Diane is a member of the Seven Deadly Sins and is The Sin of Envy with the symbol of the Serpent. She is also a member of the Giant''s Clan.   She is a fair maiden with pink eyes and medium length brown hair which is tied up into Mega Twintails. Despite being a beautiful looking maiden, she is in fact a giant from the giant clan, and is several times larger than ordinary humans. She wears a one piece orange suit, boots that extend almost up to the knees, and a metal armband which is embedded with shiny metal pebbles. Her current outfits and attire is believed to be the most fashionable ones. She wears an orange colored short sleeved bodysuit and boots.   As the Serpent''s Sin of Envy, her main traits are jealousy and envy. She shows strong affection for Meliodas, so when she met him together with Elizabeth, she grew very jealous and threw him away whilst calling him a cheater.  In contrary with Elizabeth who wants to be strong and powerful, she wants to be small.', 'Erica Mendez', '悠木碧', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00', '2026-05-31T19:37:07.105388+00:00'),
